<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">RRK01.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">OKUTANDIKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo kya Musa eky'okubanza ekirikwetwa Okutandika</para>
  <para style="toc2">Okutandika</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kut</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA MUSA EKY'OKUBANZA EKIRIKWETWA</para>
  <para style="mt1">OKUTANDIKA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Okuhangwa kw'ebintu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 1:10">Heb 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:16">Kol 1:16</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:3">Heb 11:3</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:11">Kush 4:11</ref>.</char>
    </note> Omu kutandika Ruhanga akahanga eiguru n'ensi. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:12">Yoh 8:12</ref>. </char></note> Ensi ekaba etari mu buteeka, kandi erimu busha; omwirima gukaba gushwekire amaizi maingi, kandi Omwoyo wa Ruhanga akaba naagyendagyenda ahaiguru y'amaizi. <verse eid="GEN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Ruhanga yaagira ati: Habeho omushana. Omushana gwabaho. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Ruhanga yaareeba omushana guri murungi; yaataanisa omushana n'omwirima. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 74:16">Zab 74:16</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaayeta omushana Nyomushana, n'omwirima yaagweta Nyekiro. Bwaira, bwasheesha, kyaba ekiro ky'okubanza.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Ruhanga yaagira ati: Habeho omwanya ahagati y'amaizi, gutaanise amaizi n'agandi. <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Ruhanga yaataho ogwo mwanya, gwataanisa amaizi g'ahansi yaagwo n'ag'ahaiguru yaagwo. Kyaba nikwo kyaba. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Ruhanga yaayeta ogwo mwanya Eiguru. Bwaira bwasheesha, kyaba ekiro kya kabiri.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 26:10">Yob 26:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 95:5">Zab 95:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga yaagira ati: Amaizi g'ahansi y'eiguru gaateeranire omu mwanya gumwe, eitaka rireebekye. Kyaba nikwo kyaba. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Ruhanga yaayeta eryo itaka Ensi, n'eiteeraniro ry'amaizi yaaryeta Enyanja. Ruhanga yaareeba kiri kirungi. <verse eid="GEN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 6:7">Heb 6:7</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaagira ati: Ensi emere ebirikumera, ebirikwera enjuma, kandi n'ebiti ebirikwana ebijuma, ebirimu embibo, buri kimwe omu muringo gwakyo. Kyaba nikwo kyaba. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Ensi yaamera ebirikumera, ebirikwera enjuma omu miringo yaabyo, n'ebiti ebirikwana ebijuma ebirimu embibo, buri kimwe omu muringo gwakyo. Ruhanga yaareeba kiri kirungi. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Bwaira, bwasheesha, kyaba ekiro kya kashatu. <verse eid="GEN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 74:16">Zab 74:16</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaagira ati: Habeho ebirikwaka omu mwanya omu iguru, bitaanise nyomushana na nyekiro; kandi bibe eby'okumanyisa obunaku n'ebiro n'emyaka; <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />bigume byakye omu mwanya omu iguru, bibone kwakira ensi. Kyaba nikwo kyaba. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Ruhanga yaakora ebirikwaka bihango bibiri, ekirikwaka ekihango okutegyeka nyomushana, kandi ekikye okutegyeka nyekiro; kandi yaakora n'enyonyoozi. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:3">Zab 8:3</ref>. </char></note>Ruhanga yaabita omu mwanya omu iguru okujwera ensi. <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />N'okutegyeka nyomushana na nyekiro, kandi n'okutaanisa omushana n'omwirima. Ruhanga yaareeba kiri kirungi. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Bwaira, bwasheesha, kyaba ekiro kya kana.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Ruhanga yaagira ati: Amaizi gaijure ebirikwegyendesa ebiine amagara, kandi n'ebirikuguruka bigurukye ahaiguru omu kaabunga. <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Ruhanga yaahanga <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emigoye n'eby'enyanja ebirikukira byona obuhango. </char></note>emigoye mihango, n'ebirikwegyendesa byona ebiine amagara, ebi amaizi gaazaire omu miringo yaabyo, n'ebirikuguruka byona ebiine amapapa omu miringo yaabyo. Ruhanga yaareeba kiri kirungi. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Ruhanga yaabiha omugisha, naagira ati: Muzaare, mukanye, mwijure omu maizi g'omu nyanja, kandi n'ebirikuguruka bikanye omu nsi. <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Bwaira, bwasheesha, kyaba ekiro kya kataano.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:18-23">Zab 104:18-23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga yaagira ati: Ensi ezaare ebiine amagara omu miringo yaabyo, amatungo n'ebirikugyendesa enda n'enyamaishwa z'omunsi omu miringo yaabyo; kyaba nikwo kyaba. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Ruhanga yaahanga enyamaishwa z'omu nsi omu miringo yaazo, n'amatungo omu miringo yaago, n'ebirikwekurura ahansi omu miringo yaabyo; Ruhanga yaareeba kiri kirungi.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhangwa kw'omuntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 8:6">Zab 8:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga yaagira ati. Katuhangye omuntu omu muringo gwaitu, ashushane naitwe; bategyekye eby'omu nyanja, n'ebirikuguruka omu mwanya, n'amatungo, n'ensi yoona, na byona ebirikugyendesa enda ahansi. <verse eid="GEN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:10">Kol 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:4">Mat 19:4</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaahanga omuntu orikumushusha; omu kushusha kwa Ruhanga yaaba nimwo yaamuhangira; yaahanga omushaija n'omukazi. <verse eid="GEN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 128:3">Zab 128:3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 128:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaabaha omugisha, kandi yaabagira ati: Muzaare, mukanye, mwijure ensi, ebe eyaanyu; mutegyekye eby'omu nyanja, n'ebirikuguruka omu mwanya, na byona ebiine amagara ebirikwegyendesa ahansi. <verse eid="GEN 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:14">Zab 104:14</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 104:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:17">Byak 14:17</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaagira ati: Reeba, naabaha ebirikumera byona ebirikwera enjuma, ebiri omu nsi yoona, n'ekiti kyona ekirikwana ebijuma ebirimu embibo; bibe eby'okurya byanyu. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Kandi enyamaishwa zoona ez'omu nsi, n'ebirikuguruka byona eby'omu mwanya, n'ekintu kyona ekirikugyendesa enda, buri kintu kyona ekiine omwitsyo, naabiha ebirikumera byona ebibisi, bibe eby'okurya byabyo. Kyaba nikwo kyaba. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:24">Zab 104:24</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaareeba byona ebi ahangire; kandi reeba, bikaba biri birungi munonga. Bwaira, bwasheesha, kyaba ekiro kya mukaaga.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuhuumura aha kiro kya mushanju</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Eiguru n'ensi n'ebirimu byona byahwa kuhangwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 31:17">Kur 31:17</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:4">Heb 4:4</ref>. </char></note> Aha kiro kya mushanju Ruhanga yaaheza ebi yaabaire naakora; kandi aha kiro ekyo yaahuumura emirimo ye yoona ei yaakozire. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:8-11">Kur 20:8-11</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaaha omugisha ekiro kya mushanju, yaakyeza; ahabw'okuba nikyo yaahuumuriireho emirimo yoona ei yaakozire omu kuhanga kwe.<verse eid="GEN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Okwo nikwo kuhangwa kw'eiguru n'ensi obu byahangwa.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="GEN 2:4">Ruhanga okuta Adamu omuri Edeni</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">Obu MUKAMA Ruhanga yaahanga ensi n'eiguru, <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />hakaba hatariho kishaka kyona aha nsi, kandi n'obunyaatsi bwona bukaba butakamezire ahabw'okuba MUKAMA Ruhanga akaba atakagwisize njura aha nsi, kandi hatariho muntu weena w'okuhinga eitaka; <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />kwonka oruho rukaba rwimuka, rujubya ensi yoona. <verse eid="GEN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Bwanyima MUKAMA Ruhanga yaahanga omuntu omu mucuucu gw'ahansi, yaamuhuuha omu nyindo omwitsyo gw'amagara, omuntu yaaba ohuriire.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 13:10">Kut 13:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi MUKAMA Ruhanga yaagira ekibanja omuri Edeni aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba; yaakitamu omuntu ou yaahangire. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:22">Kut 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:2">Kush 22:2</ref>, <ref loc="REV 22:14">14</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA Ruhanga yaamezamu omuti gwona ogurikushemeza amaisho, n'omuti gwona ogushemereire kuriibwa; kandi ahagati y'ekibanja yaataho omuti gw'amagara, n'omuti ogw'okumanya oburungi n'obubi. <verse eid="GEN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Kandi omugyera gukaba gusheneneka niguruga omuri Edeni, kufukiiriza ekyo kibanja; kandi gukihika aho, gwebaganisamu emigyera ena. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Ogw'okubanza gukaba nigwetwa Pishoni; ogwo nigwo gweziguurukire ensi yoona eya Havila erimu ezaabu; <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />kandi ezaabu ey'omu nsi egyo ni nungi; na <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bedolaki n'ekintu ekirikukwata nk'amakanca nari amasira ekiruga omu miti. </char></note>bedolaki n'amaabare agarikwetwa shohamu niyo biba. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Eiziina ry'omugyera gwa kabiri ni Gihoni; ogwo nigwo gweziguurukire ensi yoona ya Kuushi. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Eiziina ry'ogwa kashatu ni Hidekeeli; ogwo nigwo guraba omu maisho g'ensi ya Asiria. Kandi omugyera ogwa kana ni Furaati. <verse eid="GEN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />MUKAMA Ruhanga yaatwara ogwo muntu, yaamuta omu kibanja ky'omuri Edeni okukihinga n'okukirinda. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />MUKAMA Ruhanga yaaragiira ogwo muntu, naagira ati: Omuti gwona ogw'omu kibanja noikirizibwa kuryaho nk'oku orikwenda; <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />kwonka omuti gw'okumanya oburungi n'obubi otariguryaho, ahabw'okuba eizooba eri origuryaho, buzimazima oryafa.<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhangwa kwa Haawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Bwanyima MUKAMA Ruhanga yaagira ati: Ti kirungi omuntu kuguma wenka; ka mmukorere omuhwezi omushemereire. <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />MUKAMA Ruhanga yaahanga omu itaka enyamaishwa zoona ez'omu ishwa, n'ebirikuguruka omu mwanya byona; yaabireetera ogwo muntu, ngu areebe oku araabyete; kandi oku yaayetsire ekihangirwe kyona ekiine amagara, niryo ryabaire eiziina ryakyo. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Ogwo muntu yaayeta amatungo goona n'ebirikuguruka omu mwanya n'enyamaishwa zoona ez'omu ishwa amaziina; kwonka omuhwezi omushemereire akaba atakabonekire. <verse eid="GEN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:12">Kut 15:12</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA Ruhanga yaagwejegyeza ogwo muntu obutasisiimuka; ku yaagwejegyeire, yaamwihamu orubaju rumwe, yaagarura enyama omu mwanya gwaarwo; <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />orwo rubaju oru MUKAMA Ruhanga yaihire omu muntu, yaaruhangamu omukazi, yaamureetera ogwo muntu. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:30">Efe 5:30</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:8">1 Kor 11:8</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu yaagira ati: Ogu n'eigufa eryaruga omu magufa gangye, kandi n'omubiri ogwaruga omu mubiri gwangye; ayetwe omukazi, ahakuba yaihwa omu mushaija. <verse eid="GEN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:7">Mak 10:7</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:28-31">Efe 5:28-31</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo omushaija aritsigiraho ishe na nyina, akaguma n'omukazi we; bombi bakaba omubiri gumwe. <verse eid="GEN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Kandi ogwo mushaija n'omukazi we bombi bakaba bataine ki bajwaire, kandi batarikukwatwa nshoni.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Okutegwa kw'omuntu n'okushiisha kwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 20:2">Kush 20:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi enjoka ekaba eri enyabwengye okukira enyamaishwa zoona ezi MUKAMA Ruhanga yaahangire. Yaabuuza omukazi eti; N'eky'amazima, Ruhanga akagira ngu mutarirya aha muti gwona ogw'omuri eki kibanja? <verse eid="GEN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Omukazi yaagarukamu enjoka ati: Nitwikirizibwa kurya ebijuma by'emiti y'omu kibanja, <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />kureka ebijuma by'omuti oguri ahagati y'ekibanja; nibyo Ruhanga yaagizire ati: Mutaribirya, n'obu kwakuba okubikoraho, mutakaafa. <verse eid="GEN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:3">2 Kor 11:3</ref>. </char></note> Enjoka yaagambira omukazi eti: Okufa kwo, buzima timurifa; <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />ahabw'okuba Ruhanga naamanya ngu eizooba eri muriguryaho, amaisho gaanyu garyaiguka, naimwe mube nka Ruhanga, mumanye oburungi n'obubi. <verse eid="GEN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:12-19">Rom 5:12-19</ref>. </char></note> Omukazi ku yaareebire omuti guri murungi kurya, nigushemeza amaisho, kandi nigwetengwa ahabw'okuha omuntu obwengye, yaacwa aha bijuma byagwo, yaarya, yaahaho na iba, nawe yaarya. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Ahonaaho amaisho gaabo bombi gaiguka, baamanya ku bajwaire busha, baayebaziirira amababi g'omutiini g'okwekingaho.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuhana enjoka na Adamu na Haawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 31:33">Yob 31:33</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:1-12">Zab 139:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 9:3">Amo 9:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mabeho g'omwabazyo baahurira MUKAMA Ruhanga naagyendagyenda omu kibanja; omushaija n'omukazi we baayeshereka MUKAMA Ruhanga omu miti y'omu kibanja. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 2:2">Mat 2:2</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA Ruhanga yaayeta omushaija, naagira ati: Ori nkahi? <verse eid="GEN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:3">Zab 51:3</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 51:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Omushaija yaagira ati: Naakuhurira ori omu kibanja; naatiina, ahakuba naaba njwaire busha; naayeshereka. <verse eid="GEN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Ruhanga yaamubuuza ati: N'oha okugambiire ku ojwaire busha? Waarya aha muti ogu naakuzibiire kuryaho? <verse eid="GEN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 28:13">Enf 28:13</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:13">Yak 1:13</ref>. </char></note> Omushaija yaagarukamu ati: Omukazi ou wampaire kuguma naanye, niwe yampa aha bijuma by'ogwo muti, naanye nkarya. <verse eid="GEN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />MUKAMA Ruhanga yaabuuza omukazi ati: Iwe ekyo waakora ki? Omukazi yaagarukamu ati: Enjoka niyo yambeihabeiha, naanye nkarya. <verse eid="GEN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:25">Isa 65:25</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:17">Mik 7:17</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA Ruhanga yaagira enjoka ati: Ahabw'okukora ekyo, waakyeenwa okukira amatungo goona n'enyamaishwa zoona ez'omu ishwa; oryaguma ogyendese enda, orye omucuucu ebiro byona eby'amagara gaawe; <verse eid="GEN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:6">Kub 21:6</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 21:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:20">Rom 16:20</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:14">Heb 2:14</ref>. </char></note> kandi ndyata obuzigu ahagati yaawe n'ogu mukazi, n'ahagati y'oruzaaro rwawe n'orwe; orwe ruryakuteera omutwe, naiwe oryaruteera ekitsintsiino. <verse eid="GEN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:15">1 Tim 2:15</ref>. </char></note> Yaakubuukana omukazi, yaamugira ati: Ndyakanyisa munonga obusaasi bwawe omu kuzaara; omu busaasi nimwo orizaarira abaana; n'okwetenga kwawe kuryaguma kube ahari baro; nawe aryakutegyeka. <verse eid="GEN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Kandi yaagira Adamu ati: Ahabw'okuhurira eiraka ry'omukazi waawe, okarya aha muti ogu naakuzibiire kuryaho, eitaka ryakyeenwa ahabwawe; oryaguma oriihemu eby'okurya obihendekyeire ebiro byona eby'amagara gaawe; <verse eid="GEN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:7">Yob 5:7</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 2:23">Mub 2:23</ref>. </char></note> riryakumerera amahwa n'amatojo; oryaguma otungwe ebirikumera omu misiri; <verse eid="GEN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:21">1 Kor 15:21</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 15:22">22</ref>. </char></note> ebi orirya biryakutuutura aha maisho, okuhitsya obu origaruka omu itaka; ahakuba nimwo waihirwe; ahabw'okuba ori omucuucu, n'omu mucuucu nimwo origaruka.<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Omushaija yaayeta omukazi we eiziina <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Haawa amakuru ngu Oine amagara; omu Ruheburaayo ni Khawa. </char></note>Haawa, ahakuba niwe nyina w'abahuriire boona. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />MUKAMA Ruhanga yaakorera Adamu n'omukazi we ebijwaro by'empu, yaabajweka.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okubinga Adamu omuri Edeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 3:3">Kut 3:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 2:9">2:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima MUKAMA Ruhanga yaagira ati: Reeba, omuntu ogu ahindukire nk'omwe ahariitwe omu by'okumanya oburungi n'obubi; mbwenu nu arekye kugorora omukono gwe, akatwara aha muti gw'amagara, akarya, akagumaho ebiro byona. <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA Ruhanga yaamwiha omu kibanja kya Edeni, ngu aze kuhinga eitaka eri yaihirwemu, <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 1:7">Heb 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 14:6">Yoh 14:6</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga nikwo kubinga omuntu, akata <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">baakerubi n'omutwe gumwe aha mahe ga baamaraika. </char></note>baakerubi aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba bw'ekibanja kya Edeni, na rurara erikumurinkana kandi erikuhindahinduka embaju zoona, okurinda omuhanda ogurikuza aha muti gw'amagara.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ebya Kaini na Abeeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Bwanyima Adamu yaamanya Haawa omukazi we, yaagira enda, yaazara Kaini; yaagira ati: Ntungire omwana w'omwojo ahabw'okuhwerwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Yaagaruka, yaazaara Abeeli omurumuna. Abeeli yaaba omuriisa w'entaama, Kaini we yaaba omuhingi. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Ebiro ku byagyenzire nibihingura, Kaini yaareetera MUKAMA omutoijo gw'ebi yaahingire. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:12">Kur 13:12</ref>. </char></note> Na Abeeli yaareeta aha mijigaijo y'entaama ze n'ebishaju byazo. Ruhanga yaasiima Abeeli n'ebi yaatoija; <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:4">Heb 11:4</ref>. </char></note> kwonka tiyaasiima Kaini n'ebi yaatoija. Kaini yaagira ekiniga kingi, yairirimba aha maisho. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />MUKAMA yaabuuza Kaini ati: N'enki ekyakukwatsa ekiniga? Kandi n'enki ekyakwiririmbya aha maisho? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Ku oraakore gye, torikwija kusiimwa? Kwonka ku oraabe otakozire gye, ekibi nikiija kuguma kibandami aha rwigi, kikugwereire; kwonka iwe oshemereire kukitegyeka. <verse eid="GEN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:35">Mat 23:35</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:12-15">1 Yoh 3:12-15</ref>. </char></note> Kaini yaagambira Abeeli omurumuna ati: Ija, tuze omu ishwa. Ku baahikireyo, Kaini yaagurukira Abeeli omurumuna, yaamwita.<verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />MUKAMA yaabuuza Kaini ati: Abeeli murumuna waawe arahi? Kaini yaagarukamu ati: Tindikuhamanya. Niinye murinzi wa murumuna wangye? <verse eid="GEN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:24">Heb 12:24</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaamugira ati: Eki waakora ki? Eiraka ry'eshagama ya murumuna waawe, nirimpururiza omu itaka. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:15-20">Bir 28:15-20</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:10">Gal 3:10</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu hati waakyeenwa omu nsi, eyaayashamya akanwa kumira eshagama ya murumuna waawe, ei omukono gwawe gwasheesha; <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />ku orihinga eitaka, tiririkwereza by'okurya; oryaguma ori empungi, n'ekizengyerezi omu nsi. <verse eid="GEN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Kaini yaagira MUKAMA ati: Ekifubiro eki wampa ni kihango, tikirikubaasa kwemerwa. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Reeba, eri izooba wancwa aha itaka, kandi tinkireebwa mu maisho gaawe; ndyaguma ndi empungi n'ekizengyerezi omu nsi; kandi orindeeba weena aryanyita. <verse eid="GEN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />MUKAMA yaagira ati: Mbwenu oriita Kaini, ahoorwe emirundi mushanju. MUKAMA yaata ahari Kaini akamanyiso, ngu orimubugana weena atarimwita. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 13:23">2 Bag 13:23</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Kaini yaaruga omu maisho ga MUKAMA, yaatuura omu nsi ya Noodi aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba bwa Edeni.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oruzaaro rwa Kaini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Bwanyima Kaini yaamanya omukazi we, yaagira enda, yaazaara Enoka; yaayombeka orurembo, yaarweterera ogwo mutabani Enoka. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Enoka yaazaara Iradi; Iradi yaazaara Mehuyaeli; Mehuyaeli yaazaara Mesushaeli; na Mesushaeli yaazaara Lameka. <verse eid="GEN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lameka yaashwera abakazi babiri, omwe naayetwa Ada, n'ondiijo naayetwa Ziila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Ada yaazaara Yabali; niwe ishenkuru w'abariisa b'ente abatuura omu mahema. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Kandi omurumuna orikwetwa Yubali niwe ishenkuru w'abateezi b'enanga n'emikuri. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Na Ziila yaazaara Tubali-kaini, omuheesi w'ebintu byona ebirikushara eby'emiringa n'eby'ebyoma; na munyaanya wa Tubali-kaini akaba ari Naama. <verse eid="GEN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Lameka yaagira abakazi be ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">Ada na Ziila, mumpurire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">Naimwe baka Lameka, muhurire ebi ndikugamba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">Nyitsire omushaija ahabw'okumputaaza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">N'omutsigazi ahabw'okunteera.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Kaini ku araabe naahoorerwa emirundi mushanju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:24">Buzima Lameka naija kuhoorerwa emirundi makumi mushanju na mushanju.<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adamu okuzaara Seezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Adamu yaagaruka yaamanya omukazi we, yaazaara omwana w'omwojo, yamweta Seezi; ahakuba Haawa akagira ati: Ruhanga yanshumbuusha ondiijo mwana omu mwanya gwa Abeeli, ou Kaini yaitsire. <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:24">1 Bag 18:24</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:32">Yoel 2:32</ref>. </char></note> Na Seezi yaazaara omwojo, yaamweta Enosi; omu bunaku obwo abantu baatandika kutakira eiziina rya MUKAMA.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Oruzaaro rwa Adamu na Seezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Eki n'ekitabo ky'oruzaaro rwa Adamu. Aha izooba eri Ruhanga yaahangiireho omuntu, akamuhanga naashushana nawe; <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />yaahanga omushaija n'omukazi, yaabaha omugisha, yaabeeta Omuntu, aha izooba eri baahangiirweho.<verse eid="GEN 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Adamu ku yaamazire emyaka igana na makumi ashatu, yaazaara omwana w'omwojo orikumushusha omu muringo gwe, yaamweta Seezi. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Ku yaaherize kuzaara Seezi, yaamara emyaka magana munaana ei yaazaariiremu abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:12">Rom 5:12</ref>. </char></note> Emyaka yoona ei Adamu yaamazire yaahika magana mwenda na makumi ashatu; yaafa.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Seezi ku yaamazire emyaka igana n'etaano, yaazaara Enosi; <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />ku yaaherize kuzaara Enosi, yaamara emyaka magana munaana na mushanju, ei yaazaariiremu abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Emyaka yoona ei Seezi yaamazire, yaahika magana mwenda na ikumi n'ebiri; yaafa.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Enosi ku yaamazire emyaka makumi mwenda, yaazaara Kenani; <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />ku yaaherize kuzaara Kenani, yaamara emyaka magana munaana na ikumi n'etaano, ei yaazaariiremu abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Emyaka yoona ei Enosi yaamazire yaahika magana mwenda na itaano; yaafa.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Kenani ku yaamazire emyaka makumi mushanju, yaazaara Mahalaleeli; <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />ku yaaherize kuzaara Mahalaleeli, yaamara emyaka magana munaana na makumi ana, ei yaazaariiremu abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Emyaka yoona ei Kenani yaamazire, yaahika magana mwenda na ikumi; yaafa.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Mahalaleeli ku yaamazire emyaka makumi mukaaga n'etaano, yaazaara Yaredi; <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />ku yaaherize kuzaara Yaredi, yaamara emyaka magana munaana na makumi ashatu, ei yaazaariiremu abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Emyaka yoona ei Mahalaleeli yaamazire yaahika magana munaana na makumi mwenda n'etaano; yaafa.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Yaredi ku yaamazire emyaka igana na makumi mukaaga n'ebiri, yaazaara Enoka; <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />ku yaaherize kuzaara Enoka, yaamara emyaka magana munaana, ei yaazaariiremu abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Emyaka yoona ei Yaredi yaamazire yaahika magana mwenda na makumi mukaaga n'ebiri; yaafa.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Enoka ku yaamazire emyaka makumi mukaaga n'etaano, yaazaara Mesuseela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 2:6">Mal 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:4">Kush 3:4</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaaherize kuzaara Mesuseela, yaaguma naagyenda na Ruhanga okumara emyaka magana ashatu, ei yaazaariiremu abaana b'aboojo n'abaishiki. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Emyaka yoona ei Enoka yaamazire yaahika magana ashatu na makumi mukaaga n'etaano. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:11">2 Bag 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:5">Heb 11:5</ref>. </char></note> Enoka yaagyenda na Ruhanga, yaabura, ahabw'okuba Ruhanga akamutwara.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Mesuseela ku yaamazire emyaka igana na makumi munaana na mushanju, yaazaara Lameka; <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />ku yaaherize kuzaara Lameka, yaamara emyaka magana mushanju na makumi munaana n'ebiri, ei yaazaariiremu abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Emyaka yoona ei Mesuseela yaamazire yaahika magana mwenda na makumi mukaaga na mwenda; yaafa.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Lameka ku yaamazire emyaka igana na makumi munaana n'ebiri, yaazaara omwana w'omwojo; <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17">Kut 3:17</ref>. </char></note> yaamweta Noa, naagira ati: Ogu niwe aritutambira enaku ezi turikureeba omu mirimo n'okufa kubi nitukoresa emikono yaitu, ebirikuruga omu itaka eri MUKAMA yaakyeenire. <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Ku yaaherize kuzaara Noa, yaamara emyaka magana ataano na makumi mwenda n'etaano, ei yaazaariiremu abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Emyaka yoona ei Lameka yaamazire yaahika magana mushanju na makumi mushanju na mushanju; yaafa. <verse eid="GEN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Noa ku yaahikize emyaka magana ataano, yaazaara Sheemu, Haamu na Yafeesi.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Okusiisikara kw'abantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Abantu ku baatandikire kukanya omu nsi, kandi baazaara abaishiki, <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:3">Bir 7:3</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 7:4">4</ref>. </char></note> abaana ba Ruhanga baareeba abaishiki b'abantu bari barungi; baashweramu abakazi boona abu baakunzire. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:20">1 Pet 3:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:39">Zab 78:39</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagira ati: Omwoyo wangye tariguma naahakana n'abantu ebiro byona; ahakuba n'abantu-buntu; kandi emyaka yaabo eryaba igana na makumi abiri. <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Omu biro ebyo hakaba hariho abantu b'ebikaaka; kandi bwanyima y'ebyo abaana ba Ruhanga ku baashweire bahara b'abantu, baabazaaraho abaana; abaana abo nibo bantu b'amaani aba ira abaarangainwe.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:28-31">Rom 1:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:19">Mat 15:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaareeba obubi bw'abantu buri bwingi omu nsi, na buri kiteekateeko ky'omu mitima yaabo kiri kibi obutoosha. <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:11">1 Sam 15:11</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 15:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:10">Isa 63:10</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:30">Efe 4:30</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaayefuuza eki yaahangiire omuntu omu nsi, kandi kyamugwisa kubi omu mutima gwe. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />MUKAMA nikwo kugira ati: Ndyahwerekyereza abantu abu naahangire omu nsi, mbamareho, abantu n'enyamaishwa n'ebirikugyendesa enda, n'ebirikuguruka omu mwanya; ahabw'okuba nyefuurize eki naabihangiire. <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:12">Kur 33:12</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Noa we Ruhanga yaamugirira embabazi.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuragiira Noa okukora emeeri ahabw'omwegyemure gw'amaizi oguribaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Oru nirwo ruzaaro rwa Noa. Noa akaba ari ohikiriire, otaine kabara omu busingye bwe. Noa yaaguma naagyenda na Ruhanga. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Kandi Noa akaba aine abaana bashatu b'aboojo, Sheemu, Haamu na Yafeesi. <verse eid="GEN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Ensi ekaba esiisikaire omu maisho ga Ruhanga, eijwire eiraro. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 14:2">Zab 14:2</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaareeba ensi, kandi reeba, ekaba esiisikaire, ahakuba byona ebiine omubiri bikaba biherize kusiisikara omu mitwarize yaabyo. <verse eid="GEN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:7">1 Pet 4:7</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaagambira Noa ati: Mmaririire kumaraho abaine omubiri boona; ahabw'okuba bareeteire ensi kwijura eiraro; reeba ndyabahwerekyereza hamwe n'ensi. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />N'ahabw'ekyo oyekorere emeeri omu muti ogurikwetwa goferi, ocwemu ebishengye, ogisiigye koroto omunda n'enyima. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Kandi oku nikwo oraagikore; oburaingwa bwayo bube mikono magana ashatu, obuhango bwayo mikono makumi ataano, n'obwemi bwayo mikono makumi ashatu. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Ku oriheza ahaiguru, ocwemu edirisa okuruga ahaiguru mukono gumwe; omuryango gwayo ogucwe omu rubaju; kandi ogitemu kanyinaibiri na kanyinaishatu. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Kandi reeba, ndyareeta omwegyemure gw'amaizi, gushwekye ensi okucwekyereza byona ebiine omubiri n'omwitsyo gw'amagara, mbimareho ahansi y'eiguru; ebiri omu nsi byona bife. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Kwonka ndyahamya endagaano yangye naiwe; oryataaha omu meeri n'abatabani baawe n'omukazi waawe na bakaamwana baawe. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Aha bintu byona ebiine amagara oryataasya bibiri bibiri ebya buri muringo, obirinde bigume naiwe bihuriire; biryaba ekishaija n'ekikazi. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Aha birikuguruka omu miringo yaabyo, aha nyamaishwa omu miringo yaazo n'aha birikugyendesa enda omu miringo yaabyo, bibiri bibiri ebya buri muringo biryaija ahariiwe, obirinde bigume bihuriire; <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:29">Kut 1:29</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 1:30">30</ref>. </char></note> kandi oyetwarire aha by'okurya byona ebirikuriibwa, obyehunikire, bibe eby'okurya byawe n'eby'ebi oine byona. <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Noa yaakora atyo, nka byona ebi Ruhanga yaamuragiire oku biri; kandi yaaba nikwo yaatwaza.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Noa okutaaha omu meeri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 11:7">Heb 11:7</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:5">2 Pet 2:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaagambira Noa ati: Ija n'eka yaawe yoona, mutaahe omu meeri; ahakuba omu b'obusingye obu niiwe ndeebire ohikiriire. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:1-31">Lev 11:1-31</ref>. </char></note> Aha nyamaishwa ezitarikuzira otwareho mushanju mushanju, ekishaija n'ekikazi; aha zirikuzira ibiri ibiri, enshaija n'enkazi; <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />n'aha birikuguruka nabyo mushanju mushanju, ekishaija n'ekikazi, oruzaaro rwabyo rubone kugumaho omu nsi yoona. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Ahakuba ebiro mushanju ku biraahwe, niinyija kugwisa enjura aha nsi okumara ebiro makumi ana, nyomushana na nyekiro; kandi buri kintu kyona ekihuriire eki naahangire, ndyakimariraho kimwe aha nsi. <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Noa yaakora byona nk'oku MUKAMA yaamuragiire. <verse eid="GEN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Obu omwegyemure gw'amaizi gwaija aha nsi, Noa akaba ahikize emyaka magana mukaaga.<verse eid="GEN 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Noa yaataaha omuri egyo meeri n'abatabani n'omukazi we na bakaamwana, ahabw'omwegyemure gw'amaizi. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Aha nyamaishwa ezitarikuzira n'ezirikuzira n'aha birikuguruka, n'aha birikugyendesa enda byona, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />haataaha bibiri bibiri, byashanga Noa omu meeri, ekishaija n'ekikazi, nk'oku Ruhanga yaaragiire Noa. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Ebiro mushanju ku byahingwire, omwegyemure gw'amaizi gwashandaara aha nsi.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:10">Mal 3:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa Noa ogwa magana mukaaga omu kwezi kwa kabiri aha kiro kya ikumi na mushanju, eryo izooba enshuro zoona ez'okuzimu zikaiguka, n'amadirisa g'omu iguru gaigurwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Enjura yaamara ebiro makumi ana neegwa nyomushana na nyekiro. <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Eryo izooba Noa n'abatabani, Sheemu, Haamu na Yafeesi, n'omukazi we na bakaamwana bashatu baataaha omu meeri. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Bo n'enyamaishwa zoona omu miringo yaazo, n'amatungo goona omu miringo yaago, n'ebirikugyendesa enda ahansi byona omu miringo yaabyo, n'ebirikuguruka byona, enyonyi z'emiringo yoona, <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />byona byashanga Noa omu meeri, bibiri bibiri ahari byona ebiine omubiri n'omwitsyo gw'amagara. <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:1-16">Zab 91:1-16</ref>. </char></note> Ebyataahiremu byona hakataaha ekishaija n'ekikazi, nk'oku Ruhanga yaamuragiire; MUKAMA yaamukingiranamu.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Omwegyemure gwamara aha nsi ebiro makumi ana; amaizi gaakanya, gaimutsya emeeri, yaaruga aha nsi. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Amaizi gaakanya, gaaba maingi munonga aha nsi; emeeri yaaguma neegazeereeraho. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Amaizi gaayeyongyera munonga kushandaara aha nsi; enshozi zoona ez'ahansi y'eiguru zaashwekwa amaizi. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Amaizi gaayeyongyera kwijura, gaahika ahaiguru mikono ikumi n'etaano okuruga aha mitwe y'enshozi. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:39">Mat 24:39</ref>. </char></note> Ebiine omubiri byona ebirikwegyendesa byafa, ebirikuguruka n'amatungo n'enyamaishwa n'ebirikugyendesa enda ahansi byona, na buri muntu weena; <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />byona ebyabaire biri ahansi, ebiine omwitsyo gw'amagara, byafa. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Buri kintu kyona ekihuriire ekyabaire kiri ahansi kyacwekyerezibwa, abantu, enyamaishwa, ebirikugyendesa enda n'ebirikuguruka omu mwanya; byamarirwaho kimwe omu nsi; Noa wenka yaaba niwe yaatsigaraho, n'abu yaabaire aine omu meeri. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Kandi amaizi gaamara ebiro igana na makumi ataano, gakishandaire aha nsi.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Okwoma kw'amaizi, na Noa okuruga omu meeri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:24">Kur 2:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga yaijuka Noa n'ebiine amagara byona, n'amatungo goona agu yaabaire aine omu meeri; Ruhanga yaareeta omuyaga gwahuuha ensi, amaizi gaatandika kwijururuka. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Enshuro z'okuzimu n'amadirisa g'omu iguru byaigarwa, n'enjura eyaabaire neeruga omu iguru yaazibirwa; <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />amaizi gaaguma nigatuuba aha nsi; bwanyima y'ebiro igana na makumi ataano amaizi gaabaganukaho; <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />emeeri yaahika aha nshozi za Araraati aha kiro kya ikumi na mushanju ky'okwezi kwa mushanju. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Amaizi gaaguma nigatuuba okuhitsya omu kwezi kwa ikumi; aha kiro ky'okubanza eky'okwo kwezi emitwe y'ebibungo yaareebeka.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Ku haahingwireho ebiro makumi ana, Noa yaigura edirisa y'emeeri ei yaakozire; <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />yaashohoza ekikoona, kyaguma nikizengyerera okuhitsya obu amaizi gaayomeire kimwe aha nsi. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Kandi yaashohoza enkombe, ngu amanye amaizi ku garaabe gaayomire ahansi; <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />kwonka enkombe tiyaabona h'okuteekama, yaagaruka kumushanga omu meeri, ahabw'okuba amaizi gakaba gakishwekire ensi yoona; yaashohoza omukono gwe, yaagikwata, yaagitaasya omu meeri. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Yaamara ebiro mushanju, yaagaruka yaashohoza egyo nkombe; <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />egyo nkombe yaagaruka ahariwe omu mwabazyo; kandi reeba, ekaba eine akababi k'omuzeituuni omu kanwa. Ekyo kyamanyisa Noa ku amaizi gaatuubire aha nsi. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Noa yaamara ebindi biro mushanju, yaashohoza egyo nkombe; yaagyenderayo, tiyaagaruka.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Omu mwaka gwa magana mukaaga na gumwe, omu kwezi kw'okubanza, aha kiro ky'okubanza, amaizi gaayomera kimwe aha nsi; Noa yaihaho ekyabaire kishwekire emeeri, yaanaga amaisho aheeru, kandi reeba, ahansi hakaba hoomire. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Kandi omu kwezi kwa kabiri, aha kiro kya makumi abiri na mushanju, ensi yaayomera kimwe.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Ruhanga yaagambira Noa ati: <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />Shohora orugye omu meeri, n'omukazi waawe n'abatabani baawe na bakaamwana baawe. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:22">Kut 1:22</ref>. </char></note> Kandi oshohoze byona ebiine amagara ebi obaire oine, ebiine omubiri byona, ebirikuguruka n'enyamaishwa n'ebirikwekurura ahansi, bibone kuzaara munonga omu nsi, bikanye, bigiijuremu. <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Noa yaashohora n'abatabani n'omukazi we na bakaamwana; <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />enyamaishwa zoona, ebirikugyendesa enda byona, ebirikuguruka byona, na byona ebirikwegyendesa aha nsi, nk'enganda zaabyo oku zaabaire ziri, byaruga omu meeri. <verse eid="GEN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Bwanyima Noa yaayombekyera MUKAMA eitambiro, yaatoorana enyamaishwa n'ebirikuguruka ebya buri ruganda orutarikuzira, yaabitambira aha itambiro kuba ebitambo byokize. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:21">Efe 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 54:9">Isa 54:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:9">Yer 17:9</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:1-3">Efe 2:1-3</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaahurira ekisooroora kirungi, yaagira omu mutima gwe ati: Tindikyeena nsi obundi ningitura omuntu, ahakuba ebiteekateeko by'omumutima gw'omuntu biba bibi okuruga omu buto bwe; kandi tindigaruka kwita kintu kyona ekiine amagara, nk'oku nkozire. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Omu bunaku bwona ensi ekiriho, eibiba n'eigyesha, embeho n'obutagatsi, ekyanda n'eitumba, nyomushana na nyekiro, tibirihwaho.<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Endagaano ya Ruhanga na Noa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Ruhanga yaaha Noa n'abatabani omugisha, yaabagira ati: Muzaare, mukanye, mwijure ensi. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 3:7">Yak 3:7</ref>. </char></note> Enyamaishwa zoona ez'omu nsi n'ebirikuguruka byona muryabiitsa obwoba, bibatiine, na byona ebirikugyendesa enda ahansi n'eby'omu nyanja byona; mubihairwe kubitegyeka. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Ebirikwegyendesa byona ebiine amagara biryaba eby'okurya byanyu; mbibahaire byona, nk'oku naabahaire ebirikumera. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:23">Bir 12:23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:20">Byak 15:20</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 15:29">29</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka mutarirya enyama n'amagara gaayo, niyo shagama yaayo. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:31">Kub 35:31</ref>. </char></note> Kandi buzima eshagama y'amagara gaanyu ndyagihoora, ngihoorere enyamaishwa yoona n'omuntu; amagara g'omuntu weena ndyagahoora ahabwa mugyenzi we. <verse eid="GEN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:17">Lev 24:17</ref>. </char></note> Orisheesha eshagama y'omuntu, n'eye baryagisheesha; ahakuba Ruhanga akahangira omuntu omu muringo gwe. <verse eid="GEN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />Mbwenu muzaare, mukanye, muzaare munonga omu nsi, mugiijure. <verse eid="GEN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Ruhanga yaagambira Noa n'abatabani, ati: <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />Reeba, nyowe naahamya endagaano yangye naimwe, kandi na baijukuru baanyu abaribakurata, <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />n'ebihangirwe byona ebiine amagara ebiri hamwe naimwe, ebirikuguruka, amatungo n'enyamaishwa yoona eri hamwe naimwe omu nsi, nka byona ebirugire omu meeri oku biri. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Kandi nimpamya endagaano yangye naimwe, ebiine omubiri byona tibirigaruka kucwekyerezibwa maizi g'omwegyemure; kandi tiharigaruka kubaho mwegyemure kucwekyereza ensi. <verse eid="GEN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Ruhanga yaagira ati: Aka niko kamanyiso k'endagaano ei naaragaana naimwe na buri kihangirwe kyona ekiine amagara ekiri hamwe naimwe okuhitsya obusingye bwona; <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />naata omuhanganzima gwangye omu kicu, gugume guri akamanyiso k'endagaano ei naaragaana n'ensi. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Ahundihikisiza enjura hoona, omuhanganzima gwareebeka omu bicu, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:9">Isa 54:9</ref>. </char></note> ndyaijuka endagaano yangye naimwe n'ekihangirwe kyona ekiine omubiri; amaizi tigarigaruka kuba omwegyemure gw'okuhwerekyereza ebiine omubiri byona. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Omuhanganzima ku guriba guri omu bicu, ndyagureeba, nyijukye endagaano etarihwaho ey'Omuhangi n'ekihangirwe kyona ekiine amagara ekiri omu nsi. <verse eid="GEN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Ruhanga yaagambira Noa ati: Aka niko kamanyiso ak'endagaano ei naaragaana n'ebiine omubiri byona, ebiri aha nsi.<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekibi kya Noa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Batabani ba Noa abaarugire omu meeri ni Sheemu, Haamu na Yafeesi; kandi Haamu niwe ishe wa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Abo bonshatu nibo batabani ba Noa; kandi nibo baakomookirweho abaabugire ensi yoona.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Noa yaatandika kuhinga; yaabyara omusiri gw'emizaabibu; <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 20:1">Enf 20:1</ref>. </char></note> yaanywa viinyo yaayo, yaasinda, yaabyama omu ihema rye ajwaire busha. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Haamu ishe wa Kanaani ku yaareebire ishe ajwaire busha, yaashohora, yaagambira bakuru be aheeru. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:1">Gal 6:1</ref>. </char></note> Sheemu na Yafeesi baatwara ekijwaro, bakitaire aha mabega gaabo bombi, baagyenda ekisiganyima, baashweka ishebo ajwaire busha. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Noa ku yaasinduukire, yaamanya eki omutabani omuto akozire; <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:20">1 Bag 9:20</ref>. </char></note> yaagira ati: Kanaani akyeenwe; aryaba omuhuuku w'abahuuku ahari beene ishe. <verse eid="GEN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Kandi ati: MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Sheemu asiimwe; kandi Kanaani abe omuhuuku we. <verse eid="GEN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Ruhanga ahangusye Yafeesi; atuure omu mahema ga Sheemu, kandi Kanaani abe omuhuuku we.<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Bwanyima y'omwegyemure Noa yaamara emyaka magana ashatu na makumi ataano. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 89:48">Zab 89:48</ref>. </char></note> Emyaka yoona ei Noa yaamazire, yaahika magana mwenda na makumi ataano; yaafa.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Oruzaaro rwa beene Noa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Oru nirwo ruzaaro rwa beene Noa, Sheemu, Haamu na Yafeesi; omwegyemure gw'amaizi ku gwahweireho, baazaara abaana b'aboojo. <verse eid="GEN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 1:5-7">1 Bus 1:5-7</ref>. </char></note> Aba nibo batabani ba Yafeesi, Gomeri, Magogi, Madai, Yavani, Tubalo, Mesheki na Tirasi. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Batabani ba Gomeri ni Ashikenaazi, Rifaasi, na Togaruma; <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Batabani ba Yavani ni Elisha, Tarushiishi, Kitimu na Dodanimu. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Abo nibo baakomookirweho abantu abaabugire ensi ez'aha rubaju rw'enyanja; kandi abo nibo beene Yafeesi, buri omwe nk'orurimi rwe oku ruri, omu miryango yaabo n'omu mahanga gaabo.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Aba nibo batabani ba Haamu, Kuushi, Miziraimu, Puuti na Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Batabani ba Kuushi ni Seeba, Havila, Sabuta, Raama na Sabuteeka; n'abatabani ba Raama ni Sheeba na Dedani. <verse eid="GEN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Na Kuushi yaazaara Nimuroodi; yaatandika kuba emanzi omu nsi. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Akaba ari omuhiigi rugambwa omu maisho ga MUKAMA; nk'oku bagira ngu, N'omuhiigi rugambwa omu maisho ga MUKAMA nka Nimuroodi. <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Ensi ei yaabandiizemu kuba omugabe ni Shinaari, eyaabaire erimu Babeeli, Ereki, Akadi na Kalune. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Okuruga okwo yaagumizamu yaaza Ashuri, yaayombeka Nineeve, Rehoboosira, Kaala, <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />na Reseni ey'ahagati ya Nineeve na Kaala, (nirwo rurembo rukuru). <verse eid="GEN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Miziraimu yaazaara Ludimu, Anamimu, Lehabimu, Nafutuhimu, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />Patirusimu, Kasiluhimu (owaakomookirweho Abafilistia) na Kafutorimu. <verse eid="GEN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Na Kanaani yaazaara Sidoni omwana w'omujigaijo na Heesi; <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />n'Abayebusi, Abaamori, Abagirugashi, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />Abahiivi, Abaaruki, Abasini, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />Abaarivadi, Abazemari, n'Abahamasi. Bwanyima emiryango y'Abanyakanaani yaabuga hoona. <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />Omwatano gw'Abanyakanaani gukaba nigutandikira Sidoni, gugyema Gerari okuhika Gaaza, kandi gutoora Sodoma, Gomora, Aduma na Zeboimu okuhika Lasha. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Abo nibo beene Haamu nk'emiryango yaabo n'endimi zaabo, n'ensi zaabo n'amahanga gaabo oku byabaire biri.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Na Sheemu mukuru wa Yafeesi, ishenkuru w'abaana ba Eberi boona, nawe yaazaara abaana. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 1:17">1 Bus 1:17</ref>. </char></note> Aba nibo beene Sheemu, Elamu, Ashuri, Arufakisaadi. Ludi na Aramu. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Aramu yaazaara Uzi, Huli, Geseri, na Maasha. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Arufakisaadi yaazaara Sheela, na Sheela yaazaara Eberi. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 1:19">1 Bus 1:19</ref>. </char></note> Eberi yaazaara aboojo babiri; eiziina ry'omwe akaba ari Pelegi, ahabw'okuba omu bunaku bwe nibwo abantu b'omu nsi baabaganisibwamu; kandi omurumuna akaba naayetwa Yokitaani. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Yokitaani yaazaara Alimodaadi, Shelefu, Hazarimaveesi, Yeera, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Hadoramu, Uzali, Dikila, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obali, Abimaeli, Sheeba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ofiri, Havila, na Yobabu; abo boona ni beene Yokitaani. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Ensi ei baabaire batwiremu, ekaba neetandikira Meesha, etoora Sefari, ehika omu nsi y'ebibungo oburugwa-izooba. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Abo nibo baana ba Sheemu nk'emiryango yaabo n'endimi zaabo n'ensi zaabo n'amahanga gaabo oku byabaire biri.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Egyo niyo miryango ya beene Noa nk'oruzaaro rwabo n'amahanga gaabo oku byabaire biri; kandi nibo baakomookirweho amahanga agaabugire hoona omu nsi bwanyima y'omwegyemure.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuhindahindura endimi z'abantu ahari Babeeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Ensi yoona ekaba eine orurimi rumwe n'engambo emwe. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:12">Dan 1:12</ref>. </char></note> Ku baafurukiire oburugwa-izooba, baareeba oruhita omu nsi ya Shinaari; baarutuuramu. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Baagambirana bati: Mwije tubumbe, amatafaari, tugootsye gye. N'ahabw'ekyo baagira amatafaari omu mwanya gw'amabaare, na koroto omu mwanya gw'obudongo. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:28">Bir 1:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:51">Luk 1:51</ref>. </char></note> Baagira bati: Mwije tweyombekyere orurembo n'omunaara, guhikye ahaiguru, tubone kurangaanwa, turekye kutaataanira hoona omu nsi yoona. <verse eid="GEN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 53:2">Zab 53:2</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaashuuma kureeba orurembo n'omunaara, ebi abantu baabaire nibombeka. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />MUKAMA yaagira ati: Reeba, abantu aba n'eihanga rimwe, kandi baine orurimi rumwe; ku baraabe baatandika kukora ebi, omu bi barikuteekateeka kukora, tihariho kiribarema. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4-11">Byak 2:4-11</ref>. </char></note> Katushuume tuhindahindure orurimi rwabo, barekye kuhurirana. <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Atyo MUKAMA yaabataataanisa, baarugayo, baabuga ensi yoona; baarekyera aho kwombeka orurembo. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Nikyo rwayeteirwe Babeeli; ahakuba niho MUKAMA yaahindahindwire orurimi rw'ensi yoona; kandi okuruga obwo MUKAMA yaabataataanisa, baabuga ensi yoona.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oruzaaro rwa Sheemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Oru nirwo ruzaaro rwa Sheemu. Ku yaabaire aine emyaka igana, omwegyemure gumazire emyaka ebiri guhweireho, yaazaara Arufakisaadi. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Ku yaaherize kuzaara Arufakisaadi, yaamara emyaka magana ataano, ei yaazaariiremu abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki. <verse eid="GEN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Arufakisaadi, ku yaamazire emyaka makumi ashatu n'etaano, yaazaara Sheela; <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />ku yaaherize kuzaara Sheela, yaamara emyaka magana ana n'eshatu ei yaazaariiremu abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki. <verse eid="GEN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Sheela ku yaamazire emyaka makumi ashatu, yaazaara Eberi. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Ku yaaherize kuzaara Eberi, yaamara emyaka magana ana n'eshatu, ei yaazaariiremu abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki. <verse eid="GEN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Eberi ku yaamazire emyaka makumi ashatu n'ena, yaazaara Pelegi. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Ku yaaherize kuzaara Pelegi, yaamara emyaka magana ana na makumi ashatu, ei yaazaariiremu abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki. <verse eid="GEN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Pelegi ku yaamazire emyaka makumi ashatu, yaazaara Reu; <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />ku yaaherize kuzaara Reu, yaamara emyaka magana abiri na mwenda, ei yaazaariiremu abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki. <verse eid="GEN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Reu ku yaamazire emyaka makumi ashatu n'ebiri, yaazaara Serugi. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Ku yaaherize kuzaara Serugi, yaamara emyaka magana abiri na mushanju, ei yaazaariiremu abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki. <verse eid="GEN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Serugi ku yaamazire emyaka makumi ashatu, yaazaara Nahori. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Ku yaaherize kuzaara Nahori, yaamara emyaka magana abiri, ei yaazaariiremu abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki. <verse eid="GEN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Nahori ku yaamazire emyaka makumi abiri na mwenda, yaazaara Teera; <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />ku yaaherize kuzaara Teera, yaamara emyaka igana na ikumi na mwenda, ei yaazaariiremu abaana b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzaarwa kwa Abrahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 24:2">Yos 24:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Teera ku yaamazire emyaka makumi mushanju, yaazaara Abramu, na Nahori na Harani. <verse eid="GEN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Oru nirwo ruzaaro rwa Teera. Teera akazaara Abramu na Nahori na Harani; Harani yaazaara Looti, <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Harani yaafa ishe akiriho, yaagwa Uri ey'aba Kaludaaya, omu nsi ei yaazaariirwemu. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:15">Kut 17:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:20">22:20</ref>. </char></note> Abramu na Nahori baashwera; eiziina rya muka Abramu akaba ari Sarai; n'eiziina rya muka Nahori akaba ari Milika, muhara wa Harani, ishe wa Milika, na Isika. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Kwonka Sarai akaba ari engumba, ataine mwana. <verse eid="GEN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:4">Byak 7:4</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:8">Heb 11:8</ref>. </char></note> Teera yaatwara Abramu omutabani, na Looti mwene Harani omwijukuru, na Sarai omukaamwana, muka omutabani Abramu; baaruga kumwe Uri ey'aba Kaludaaya, kuza omu nsi ya Kanaani; kwonka ku baahikire Harani, baaba niyo baatuura. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Emyaka yoona ei Teera yaamazire yaahika magana abiri n'etaano; yaafa, yaagwa Harani.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Okwetwa kwa Abrahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 15:7">Kut 15:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaagambira Abramu ati: Ruga omu nsi yaanyu, n'omu ruganda rwanyu n'omu nju ya sho, oze omu nsi ei ndikworeka; <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:6">Kut 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 18:18">18:18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 46:3">46:3</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 3:8">1 Bag 3:8</ref>. </char></note> ndyakuhindura eihanga rihango; kandi ndyakuha omugisha, ndangaanise eiziina ryawe; naiwe oryahaisa abandi omugisha. <verse eid="GEN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:35">Kut 24:35</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:4">26:4</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 28:14">28:14</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:8">Gal 3:8</ref>. </char></note> Ndyaha omugisha abarikushabira omugisha, n'orikukyeena ndyamukyeena; kandi omuriiwe enganda zoona ez'omu nsi nimwo ziriheerwa omugisha. <verse eid="GEN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Atyo Abramu yaagyenda, nk'oku MUKAMA yaamugambiire, na Looti yaagyenda nawe; kandi Abramu akaba ahikize emyaka makumi mushanju n'etaano, obu yaaruga Harani. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:8">Heb 11:8</ref>. </char></note> Abramu yaagyenda na Sarai omukazi we, na Looti omwana w'omurumuna, n'ebi baabaire batungire byona, n'abantu abu baatungiire Haraani; baarugayo kuza omu nsi ya Kanaani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 12:5">Ku baahikire omu nsi ya Kanaani, <verse eid="GEN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Abramu yaaraba omu nsi egyo, yaahika omu mwanya ogurikwetwa Shekemu aha mwela gwa Moore. Omu bunaku obwo aba Kanaani bakaba bari omuri egyo nsi. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:1">Kut 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 34:4">Bir 34:4</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 13:4">Kut 13:4</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaayeyoreka Abramu, yaamugira ati: Ensi egi ndyagiha oruzaaro rwawe. Aho yaayombekyeraho MUKAMA, owaamweyorekire, eitambiro. <verse eid="GEN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Yaarugayo, yaaza omu kibungo aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba bwa Beseeli, emuri oburengyerwa-izooba na Ai oburugwa-izooba; okwo nayo yaayombekyerayo MUKAMA eitambiro, yaatakira eiziina rye. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Abramu yaagumizamu, naatoora omu nsi ya Negebu.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abramu okuza Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 26:1">Kut 26:1</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 26:7">7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima haabaho enjara omuri egyo nsi; Abramu yaashuuma Misri kushuhuukirayo; ahakuba enjara ekaba eri nyingi omu nsi egyo. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Ku yaabaire ari haihi kuhika Misri, yaagambira omukazi we Sarai ati: Reeba nimmanya ku ori omukazi murungi orikureebwa; <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:5-18">Kut 20:5-18</ref>. </char></note> kandi aba Misri ku barikureeba, baryagira bati: Ogu n'omukazi we; baanyite, haza iwe bakurekye. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:25">Efe 4:25</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ninkweshengyereza, ogume ogire oti: Ni munyaanyazi mbone kutunga omugisha ahabwawe, ndekye kufa, nkaba niiwe naazira. <verse eid="GEN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Abramu ku yaahikire Misri, aba Misri baareeba omukazi ari murungi munonga. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Abanyiginya ba Faraho baamureeba, baamusiimira Faraho; bwanyima baamutwara omu nju ya Faraho. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Faraho yaatwaza gye Abramu ahabwa Sarai; kandi Abramu akaba aine entaama n'ente n'enimi z'endogoya n'abahuuku n'abazaana, ebuguma z'endogoya n'engamira. <verse eid="GEN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:14">Zab 105:14</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaareetera Faraho n'eka ye ebibonaboneso bingi ahabwa Sarai muka Abramu. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:10">Kut 26:10</ref>. </char></note> Faraho yaatuma Abramu, yaamugira ati: Beitu shi, ontuzire ki? Ahabw'enki tongambiire ku ari omukazi waawe? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Ongiriire ki oti: Ni munyaanyazi? Naanye nikyo mmutwariire kuba omukazi wangye. Mbwenu omukazi waawe ngugwo, omutware, oyegyendere. <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Faraho nikwo kuragiira abashaija be oku baraamutwaze; batyo bakamushendekyereza n'omukazi we n'ebi yaabaire aine byona.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Abramu okutaana na Looti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Abramu yaaruga Misri n'omukazi we n'ebi yaabaire aine byona, na Looti, baataaha Negebu. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:35">Kut 24:35</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Abramu akaba ari omutungi munonga, aine amatungo maingi n'efeeza n'ezaabu. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Yaaruga omuri Negebu, yaagumizamu okuhika Beseeli, yaahika omu mwanya ahagati ya Beseeli na Ai, ahu yaabandize kuteera eihema omu kubanza; <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Kut 12:7</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 12:8">8</ref>. </char></note> kandi aho niho eitambiro eri yaabandize kwombeka, ryabaire riri. Okwo Abramu yaatakirirayo eiziina rya MUKAMA.<verse eid="GEN 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Kandi Looti nawe, owaagyenzire na Abramu, akaba aine amasyo g'entaama n'ag'ente n'amahema. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 36:7">Kut 36:7</ref>. </char></note> Ensi egyo ekaba etabahikire kugituuranamu, ahakuba amatungo gaabo gakaba gari maingi; nikyo baabaire batarikubaasiza kutuura hamwe omuri obwo bunaku. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Abariisa b'Abramu n'aba Looti baagira empaka. Omu bunaku obwo Abanyakanaani n'Abaperizi bakaba batwire omu nsi egyo. <verse eid="GEN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:14">Fil 2:14</ref>, <ref loc="PHP 2:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Abramu yaagambira Looti ati: Ninkweshengyereza, turekye kugirirana amahari, n'obu baakuba abariisa bangye n'abaawe; ahabw'okuba turi ishe-emwe. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:18">Rom 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 3:11">Yak 3:11</ref>, <ref loc="JAS 3:12">12</ref>, <ref loc="JAS 3:13-18">13-18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 1:1">Zab 1:1</ref>. </char></note> Ensi yoona tekuri omu maisho? Naakweshengyereza, reka tutaane; ku oraatware orubaju bumosho, naanye niinyija kuza aha rwa buryo; nari shi ku oraatware orwa buryo, nyowe niinyija kuza aha rwa bumosho. <verse eid="GEN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Looti yaanaga amaisho, yaareeba oruhita rwa Yorudani rwona okuhika Zoari, nirufuka rwona nk'omusiri gwa MUKAMA, nari nk'ensi ya Misri, MUKAMA atakahwerekyereize Sodoma na Gomora. <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />N'ahabw'ekyo Looti yaihamu oruhita rwa Yorudani rwona; yaatoora oburugwa-izooba. Okwo nikwo baataine. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Abramu yaatuura omu nsi ya Kanaani, na Looti yaatuura omu ndembo z'omu ruhita; yaafurura eihema rye, yaariteera haihi na Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:20">Kut 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:7">2 Pet 2:7</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abantu ba Sodoma bakaba bari abanyabibi, nibacumura munonga ahari MUKAMA.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuragaana na Abramu endagaano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Bwanyima MUKAMA yaagambira Abramu, aherize kutaana na Looti, ati: Yema omu mwanya ogu orimu, onagye amaisho, oreebe obukiizi-bwa bumosho n'obwa-buryo, oburugwa-izooba n'oburengyerwa-izooba; <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />ahakuba ensi egi yoona ei orikureeba, ndyagikuha, ebe eyaawe kandi n'eya baijukuru baawe okuhitsya ebiro byona. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:10">Bir 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:12">Heb 11:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi oruzaaro rwawe ndyarukanyisa, rube nk'omucuucu gw'ahansi; omuntu ku araabe naabaasa kubara omucuucu gw'ahansi, na baijukuru baawe nabo aryabaasa kubabara. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Imuka ogyende, orabe omu nsi egi, oreebe oburaingwa n'obuhango bwayo; ahakuba niiwe ndigiha. <verse eid="GEN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Abramu nikwo kufurura eihema rye, akagyenda, akatuura haihi n'emyela ya Mamure eyaabaire eri Heburooni, akombekyerayo MUKAMA eitambiro.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Abramu okuhururira Looti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Omu biro bya Amurafeli omugabe wa Shinaari, na Arioki omugabe wa Elasaari, na Kedolaomeeri omugabe wa Elamu, na Tidali omugabe wa Goyimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />abo bagabe bakarwanisa Beera omugabe wa Sodoma na Birusha omugabe wa Gomora, na Shinabu omugabe wa Aduma, na Shemebeeri omugabe wa Zeboimu, n'omugabe wa Beela (niyo Zoari). <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Abo boona baateeranira engabo zaabo omu ruhita rwa Sidimu, niyo Nyanja y'omwonyo. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Bakaba bamazire emyaka ikumi n'ebiri nibakorera Kedolaomeeri; kwonka omu mwaka gwa ikumi n'eshatu baamugomera. <verse eid="GEN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Bwanyima omu mwaka gwa ikumi n'ena Kedolaomeeri yaija n'abagabe abaahurwire nawe, baateera aba Reefa ab'omuri Ashetaroosi-karunaimu, n'aba Zuuzi omuri Haamu, n'aba Emimu omuri Shave-kiryasaimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />n'aba Hoori, omu bibungo byabo bya Seiri, okuhika Eli-parani, haihi n'eihamba; baabagomoora. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Bwanyima baagaruka, baahika Enimishipati (niyo Kadeshi), baakubuura ensi yoona ey'Abaamaleki, n'Abaamori abaabaire batwire Hazazori-tamaari. <verse eid="GEN 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Bwanyima haahurura omugabe wa Sodoma n'owa Gomora n'owa Aduma n'owa Zeboimu n'owa Beela (niyo Zoari), baatenga orugamba omu ruhita rwa Sidimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />baarwanisa Kedolaomeeri omugabe wa Elamu na Tidali omugabe wa Goyimu na Amurafeeli omugabe wa Shinaari na Arioki omugabe wa Elasari, abagabe bana baarwanisa abataano. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Kandi oruhita rwa Sidimu rukaba rwijwire ebiina bya koroto; abagabe ba Sodoma na Gomora baahunga, abamwe baabigwamu, abandi baahungira omu bibungo. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Abagabe abaababingire baanyaga ebintu byona eby'omuri Sodoma na Gomora n'eby'okurya byabo, baayegyendera. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:17">Yer 2:17</ref>, <ref loc="JER 2:19">19</ref>. </char></note> Baanyagiranamu na Looti, mutabani wa murumuna wa Abramu, owaabaire atwire Sodoma, n'ebintu bye; baagyenda.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Bwanyima haija omwe owaacwire, yaakigambira Abramu Omuheburaayo, owaabaire atwire haihi n'emyela ya Mamure Omuamori, murumuna wa Eshikooli na Aneri; abo bakaba nibakwatanisa na Abramu. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Abramu ku yaahuriire ngu mutabani w'omurumuna anyagirwe, yaahurura n'abashaija be abeegyesiibwe eby'okurwana, abaazairwe omu ka ye, magana ashatu na ikumi na munaana, baabakurata okuhika Daani. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Abramu yaabaganisa omu ngabo ze kubarwanisa nyekiro, yaabateera, yaababinga yaabahitsya Hooba aha bukiizi-bwa-bumosho obwa Damasiko. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 30:8">1 Sam 30:8</ref>. </char></note> Yaabaaka ebi baabaire banyagire byona, yaagarura na Looti mutabani w'omurumuna n'ebintu bye n'abakazi n'abandi bantu.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Melikizedeki okushabira Abramu omugisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Abramu ku yaatabaarukire, naaruga kwita Kedolaomeeri n'abagabe abaabaire bahurwire nawe, omugabe wa Sodoma yaashohora kumubuganira omu ruhita rwa Shaave (oruhita rw'omugabe). <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Zab 110:4</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 7:10-22">Heb 7:10-22</ref>. </char></note> Na Melikizedeki omugabe wa Saalemu yaareeta omugaati na viinyo; kandi akaba ari omunyamurwa wa Ruhanga Rukira-boona. <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />Yaamushabira omugisha, naagira ati: Abramu aheebwe omugisha Ruhanga Rukira-boona. Omuhangi w'eiguru n'ensi; <verse eid="GEN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />kandi Ruhanga Rukira-boona, ohaireyo abazigu baawe omu mikono yaawe, asiimwe. Bwanyima Abramu yaamuha ekicweka kya ikumi ekya byona. <verse eid="GEN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />N'omugabe wa Sodoma yaagambira Abramu ati: Nyowe mpa abantu, reero iwe eminyago ogyetwarire. <verse eid="GEN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Abramu yaamugarukamu ati: Ndahiire MUKAMA Ruhanga Rukira-boona, Omuhangi w'eiguru n'ensi, <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:9-12">2 Kor 11:9-12</ref>. </char></note> ku ntaritwara kahuuzi n'obu kaakuba akakoba k'enkaito nari ekintu kyawe kyona, nyentsya otakaagira oti: Niinye naatungiise Abramu. <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Tinditwara kintu kyona, kureka ebi abatsigazi bariire, n'omugabo gw'abashaija abu mpurwire nabo; kandi Aneri na Eshikooli na Mamure nabo batware omugabo gwabo.<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Okworekwa kwa Abramu n'okuraganisibwa oruzaaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 11:6">Heb 11:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Abramu omu kworekwa, MUKAMA naamugira ati: Abramu, otatiina. Niinye ngabo yaawe; kandi oryaheebwa ebihembo bingi munonga. <verse eid="GEN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Abramu yaagira ati: Ai Mukama RUHANGA, oryampa ki, obu naaguma ndi encwekye, haza omuhunguzi w'ebyangye ari Eliezeeri owa Damasiko. <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Kandi Abramu yaagaruka yaagira ati: Reeba torampaire ruzaaro; kandi owaazaariirwe omu ka yangye niwe ariba omuhunguzi w'ebyangye. <verse eid="GEN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:16">Kut 17:16</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyamwizira, MUKAMA naamugira ati: Ogwo tiwe arihungura ebyawe, kureka omwana, ou oryezaarira, niwe aribihungura. <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:12">Heb 11:12</ref>. </char></note> Yaamushohoza aheeru, yaamugira ati: Rarama oreebe ahaiguru, obare enyonyoozi, oreebe ku oraabe noobaasa kuzibara. Yaamugira ati: Na baijukuru baawe nikwo bariingana batyo. <verse eid="GEN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:6">Gal 3:6</ref>. </char></note> Abramu yaikiriza MUKAMA, MUKAMA yaakimubarira kuba okuhikiirira.<verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Kandi yaagaruka, yaamugira ati: Niinye MUKAMA owaakwihire omuri Uri ey'aba Kaludaaya, kukuha ensi egi ngu ogihungure. <verse eid="GEN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:36-40">Bar 6:36-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:18">Luk 1:18</ref>. </char></note> Abramu yaamubuuza ati: Ai Mukama RUHANGA, nimmanyira hi ku ndigihungura? <verse eid="GEN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Yaamugarukamu ati: Ndeetera enyana ehikize emyaka eshatu, n'ebuguma y'embuzi ehikize emyaka eshatu, n'empaya y'entaama nayo ey'emyaka eshatu, n'akaiba n'enkombe nto. <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Yaabimutwarira byona, yaabishaturamu habiri, yaabirambika naabireebanisa; kwonka enyoni zo tiyaazishaturamu. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Amahungu ku gaabaire gaija kugwa aha mitumbi, Abramu agabinga. <verse eid="GEN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Eizooba ku ryabaire nirirengarenga, Abramu yaakwatwa oturo twingi; kandi reeba, omwirima mwingi ogurikutiinisa gwamushweka. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:40">Kur 12:40</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagambira Abramu ati: Omanyire kimwe ku oruzaaro rwawe rurishuhuukira omu nsi etari yaarwo, bakakorera ab'ensi egyo, nibaitwa kubi emyaka magana ana. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Kwonka eihanga eryo, eri barikorera, ndyaritaho orubanja; kandi bwanyima baryarugayo baine eitungo ringi. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Kwonka iwe oryashanga baashwenkuru n'obusingye, oryaziikwa gye ohikize emyaka ya bukuru. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 2:16">1 Tes 2:16</ref>. </char></note> Omu bwijukuruza bwa kana baryagaruka aha, ahabw'okuba ebibi by'Abaamori tibikakanyire kurengyesereza. <verse eid="GEN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Bwanyima eizooba ku ryaherize kurenga, haabaho omwirima, reeba ekikoomi ekirikucumbuuka, n'orumuri orurikwaka byaraba ahagati y'ebyo bishate. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:8">Kut 17:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:26">2 Bus 9:26</ref>. </char></note> Aha izooba eryo MUKAMA yaaragaana na Abramu endagaano, naagira ati: Oruzaaro rwawe ndyaruha egi nsi, okuruga aha kagyera ka Misri okuhika aha mugyera omuhango Furaati. <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />Ensi y'Abakeeni, ey'Abakenizi, ey'Abakadumooni, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />ey'Abahiiti, ey'Abaperizi, ey'Abareefa, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />ey'Abaamori, ey'Abanyakanaani, ey'Abagirugashi, n'ey'Abayebusi.<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ebya Sarai na Hagari, n'okuzaarwa kwa Ishimaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 13:2">Bar 13:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:7">Luk 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:2">1 Sam 1:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reero Sarai muka Abramu akaba atamuzaariire baana; kandi akaba aine omuzaana Omunyamisrikazi, owaabaire naayetwa Hagari. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Sarai yaagambira Abramu ati: Reeba, MUKAMA anyimire oruzaaro; ninkweshengyereza, byama n'omuzaana wangye; shana nkaamutungaho abaana. Abramu yaikiriza enaama ya Sarai. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />N'ahabw'ekyo Abramu ku yaabaire amazire emyaka ikumi omu nsi ya Kanaani, Sarai omukazi we yaatwara omuzaana we Hagari, Omunyamisrikazi, yaamuha iba kuba omukazi we.<verse eid="GEN 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 30:23">Enf 30:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abramu yaaraarira Hagari yaatwara enda; ku yaareebire yaagira enda, yaagaya mugore we. <verse eid="GEN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Sarai yaagambira Abramu ati: Okuhemurwa kwangye kube niiwe kwazaho; ahakuba nkakuha omuzaana wangye kukufumbata; mbwenu ku areebire yaagira enda, yangaya. MUKAMA atucwere orubanja, nyowe naiwe. <verse eid="GEN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Abramu yaamugarukamu ati: Reeba, omuzaana waawe ari omu bushoboorozi bwawe; omugire nk'oku orikwenda. Sarai nikwo kumutwaza kubi, nawe akamuhunga.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Bwanyima maraika wa MUKAMA yaamushanga omu ihamba haihi n'eiziba eriri aha muhanda ogurikutoora Shuuri; <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />yaamubuuza ati: Hagari omuzaana wa Sarai, nooruga hi? Kandi nooza hi? Yaagira ati: Nimpunga mugore wangye Sarai. <verse eid="GEN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Maraika wa MUKAMA yaamugira ati: Garuka ahari mugore waawe, omworobere. <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:12">Kut 25:12</ref>. </char></note> Maraika wa MUKAMA yaagaruka yaamugira ati: Ndyakanyisa munonga oruzaaro rwawe, rureme eibara ahabw'obwingi. <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Kandi maraika wa MUKAMA yaagaruka yaamugira ati: Reeba oine enda, oryagizaaramu omwana w'omwojo, omwete Ishimaeli, ahakuba MUKAMA ahuriire okwitwa kubi kwawe. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Aryaba nk'enturegye omu bantu, aryaguma arwanise omuntu weena, n'abantu boona baryamurwanisa; aryatuura beene ishe boona hangahari. <verse eid="GEN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 139:1-12">Zab 139:1-12</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA owaagambire nawe Hagari yaamweta eiziina, naagira ati: Niiwe Ruhanga oreeba; ahakuba Hagari akagira ati: Biri Otuura nandeeba nkaamureebera n'aha? <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Nikyo eiziba eryo ryayeteirwe <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beeri-lahairoi amakuru ngu, eiziiba ry'Ogwo otahwaho kandi orikundeeba. </char></note>Beeri-lahairoi; kandi riri ahagati ya Kadeshi na Beredi. <verse eid="GEN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Bwanyima Hagari yaazaarira Abramu omwana w'omwojo; Abramu yaayeta omwana w'omwojo, ou Hagari yaazaire, Ishimaeli. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Obwo Abramu akaba ahikize emyaka makumi munaana na mukaaga, obu Hagari yaamuzaarira Ishimaeli.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuhindura eiziina rya Abramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 5:22">Kut 5:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abramu ku yaahikize emyaka makumi mwenda na mwenda, MUKAMA yaamweyoreka, yaamugira ati: Ndi Ruhanga ow'Obushoboorozi bwona; ogume ogyende gye omu maisho gangye, kandi obe ohikire; <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />naanye ndyaragaana naiwe endagaano, kandi ndyakukanyisa munonga. <verse eid="GEN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Abramu yaagwa ahansi, yaajuumara; Ruhanga yaamugambira ati: <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />Reeba, endagaano yangye ogiine; oryaba ishe w'amahanga maingi munonga. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />Kandi tokigaruka kwetwa Abramu, kureka Abrahamu, ahakuba naakugira ishe w'amahanga maingi munonga. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Kandi ndyakuha okuzaara munonga, nkukanyise, nkuhindure amahanga, n'abagabe bakukomookyemu. <verse eid="GEN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:7-9">Rom 9:7-9</ref>. </char></note> Ndyahamya endagaano yangye naiwe, kandi ngihamye n'oruzaaro rwawe bwanyima yaawe okuhitsya obusingye bwarwo bwona, ebe endagaano etarihwaho, nyowe kuba Ruhanga waawe n'ow'oruzaaro rwawe orwa bwanyima. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:45">Kur 29:45</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima iwe n'oruzaaro rwawe ndyabaha ensi ei oshuhuukiiremu, ensi yoona eya Kanaani, ebe eyaawe obusingye bwona; naanye ndyaguma ndi Ruhanga waabo.<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okusharwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Ruhanga yaagaruka yaagambira Abrahamu ati: Oryaguma orinde endagaano yangye, iwe n'oruzaaro rwawe orwa bwanyima yaawe obusingye bwarwo bwona. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Egi niyo ndagaano yangye ei muriguma nimurinda, ei ndikuragaana naimwe kandi n'oruzaaro rwawe orwa bwanyima; omushaija weena omuriimwe aryasharwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:8">Byak 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:11">Rom 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 6:15">Gal 6:15</ref>. </char></note> Muryasharwa ekishushu ky'omubiri gwanyu, kabe akamanyiso k'endagaano yangye naimwe. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Omwojo weena omuriimwe omu busingye bwanyu bwona, ku arihitsya ebiro munaana azairwe, asharwe, yaaba ozairwe omu ka yaawe, nari otari w'omu ruzaaro rwawe, owaaguzirwe empiiha aha banyamahanga. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Orizaarwa omu ka yaawe n'origurwa empiiha zaawe, bashemereire kusharwa; kandi endagaano yangye eryaba aha mibiri yaanyu, ebe endagaano etarihwaho. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Kandi omushaija weena oriba atashazirwe kishushu ky'omubiri gwe aryacuubwa omu ihanga rye; ahabw'okuba aryaba aitsire endagaano yangye.<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okuraganisa Saara okuzaara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Ruhanga yaagambira Abrahamu ati: Ebya Sarai omukazi waawe, otarigaruka kumweta Sarai kureka omwete Saara. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:1">Kut 21:1</ref>. </char></note> Naanye ndyamuha omugisha; kandi ndyamukuhaho omwana w'omwojo; buzima ndyamuha omugisha, abe nyina w'amahanga; abagabe b'amahanga niwe barikomookaho. <verse eid="GEN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:12">Kut 18:12</ref>. </char></note> Abrahamu yaagwa ahansi, yaajuumara, yaasheka, yaayebuuza ati: Beitu shi omwana aryazaarwa omugurusi w'emyaka igana? Kandi na Saara, azaare? <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Abrahamu yaagambira Ruhanga ati: Ishimaeli ku yaakugizire amagara omu maisho gaawe! <verse eid="GEN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:28-31">Gal 4:28-31</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaagira ati: Ngaaha! Kwonka na Saara omukazi waawe aryakuzaarira omwana w'omwojo, omwete <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isaaka, amakuru ngu, Ensheko </char></note>Isaaka; kandi ndyahamya endagaano yangye nawe n'oruzaaro rwe orwa bwanyima, ebe endagaano etarihwaho. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Kandi ebya Ishimaeli nabyo, naakuhurira. Reeba, ndyamuha omugisha, mmuhe okuzaara munonga, mmukanyise. Aryazaara abategyeki ikumi na babiri, kandi ndyamugira eihanga rihango. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Kwonka endagaano yangye ndyagihamya ahari Isaaka, ou Saara arikuzaarira omu bunaku obwatairweho omu mwaka ogurikwija.<verse eid="GEN 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Ruhanga ku yaaherize kugamba na Abrahamu, yainamuka, yaaruga ahu Abrahamu yaabaire ari. <verse eid="GEN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Bwanyima Abrahamu yaatwara Ishimaeli omutabani n'abaazaariirwe omu ka ye boona n'abaaguzirwe empiiha ze boona, yaashara ekishushu ky'omubiri gw'omushaija weena owaabaire ari omu ka ye, nk'oku Ruhanga yaamugambiire. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Abrahamu akaba ahikize emyaka makumi mwenda na mwenda, obu yaasharwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Na Ishimaeli omutabani akaba ahikize emyaka ikumi n'eshatu, obu yaasharwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Abrahamu akasharwa aha izooba rimwe na Ishimaeli omutabani. <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:19">Kut 18:19</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'abashaija boona, abaazaariirwe omu ka ye, n'abaaguzirwe empiiha ze aha banyamahanga, bakasharwa hamwe nawe.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Abrahamu okukunira baamaraika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />MUKAMA yaayeyorekyera Abrahamu aha myela ya Mamure, ashutami omu muryango gw'eihema rye omu ihangwe; <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:2">Heb 13:2</ref>. </char></note> ku yaimukize amaisho, yaareeba abashaija bashatu beemereire hangahari. Ku yaabareebire, yaimuka omu muryango gw'eihema, yairuka kubabugana, yainama ahansi, yaagira ati: <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />Mukama wangye, ku ndaabe ningirirwa embabazi omu maisho gaawe, ninkweshengyereza otahingura omwiru waawe. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Kabareete otwizi, munaabe aha bigyere, mwije ahansi y'omuti, muhuumure, <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />naanye ndeete akagaati, mugarukwemu amaani mubone kugumizamu, nk'oku mwahunguka aha mwiru waanyu. Baagira bati: Kora nk'oku waagamba. <verse eid="GEN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Abrahamu yaayehuuta, yaataaha omu ihema, yaashangamu Saara, yaamugira ati: Rahuka ogire encuro ishatu z'esaano y'obunono, okibumbabumbe, ogiihemu otugaati. <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Kandi yairuka, yaaza omu masyo, yaihamu enyana nto nungi, yaagiha omushumba we, nawe yaagibaaga ahonaaho, yaagiteeka. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Abrahamu yaatwara amajuta n'amate n'enyama y'enyana ei yaateeka, yaabita omu maisho gaabo; yaaguma ayemereire aha rubaju rwabo ahansi y'omuti, nibarya.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Baamubuuza bati: Saara omukazi wawe arahi? Yaagarukamu ati: Ari omu ihema. <verse eid="GEN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:9">Rom 9:9</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagira ati: Buzimazima, obunaku ku burihika, ndyagaruka; kandi reeba, Saara omukazi waawe aryazaara omwana w'omwojo. Saara akaba ari omu muryango gw'eihema enyima ye, abihuriire. <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:11">Heb 11:11</ref>. </char></note> (Obwo Abrahamu na Saara bakaba bakuzire, bahikire omu ngingo zaabukuru; kandi Saara akaba atakiza mu micwe y'abakazi.) <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:18">Luk 1:18</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo Saara yaashekyera aha mutima, naagira ati: Nimbaasa kushemererwa naakaikwire, na ibanye ari omugurusi? <verse eid="GEN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />MUKAMA yaagambira Abrahamu ati: N'enki ekyashetsya Saara, akagira ati: N'eky'amazima ndyazaara omwana nkaikwire? <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:17">Yer 32:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:26">Mat 19:26</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:18-25">Rom 4:18-25</ref>. </char></note> Hariho ekirema MUKAMA? Omu bunaku obwatairweho ndyagaruka; kandi ebiro bye ku birihika, Saara aryazaara omwana w'omwojo. <verse eid="GEN 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Kwonka Saara yaayehakana ati: Tinaasheka; ahakuba akaba atiinire. Yaamugarukamu ati: Ngaaha! Okusheka kwo waasheka.<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okumanyisa Abrahamu eby'okuhwerekyereza Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Abo bashaija baimuka, baarugayo, baagyenda bagyemire Sodoma; na Abrahamu yaabashendekyereza <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17-18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 25:14">Zab 25:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:15">Yoh 15:15</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaayebuuza ati: Abrahamu ku araabe arihinduka eihanga rikuru ery'amaani, kandi n'amahanga goona ag'omu nsi gariheerwa omugisha omuriwe, nshemereire kumushereka eki ndikuza kukora? <verse eid="GEN 18:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:6">Bir 6:6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 6:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:15">Yos 24:15</ref>. </char></note> Ngaaha! Ahakuba nkamutoorana, ngu abone kuragiira abaana be n'ab'omu ka ye abarimukurata, okuguma omu muhanda gwa MUKAMA, nibakora eby'okuhikiirira n'eby'oburyo, ngu MUKAMA abone kureetera Abrahamu ebi yaamugambiire. <verse eid="GEN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />MUKAMA yaagira ati: Nk'oku okutaka kw'abarikurega Sodoma na Gomora kuri kwingi ahabw'ekibi kyabo ekihinguraine munonga, <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:8">Kur 3:8</ref>. </char></note> nikyo naaza kushuumira hati, nkareeba kwo, ku baraabe bakozire nk'okutaka kw'abarikubarega, oku mpuriire, oku kuri; nari ku kiraabe kitari kityo, nakyo nkimanye. <verse eid="GEN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Abashaija abo baaruga aho, baagumizamu nibaza Sodoma; kwonka Abrahamu yaaguma ayemereire omu maisho ga MUKAMA.<verse eid="GEN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abrahamu okweshengyerereza aba Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 16:22">Kub 16:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abrahamu yaamwirira haihi, yaagira ati: Buzima noija kucwekyereza abahikiriire hamwe n'ababi: <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Mbwenu omu rurembo ku haakuba harimu abahikiriire makumi ataano, okaarucwekyereza, oyanga kurusaasira ahabw'abahikiriire makumi ataano abarimu? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:5">Rom 3:5</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 3:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Nikikabure ekyo kukurugaho, okwita abahikiriire hamwe n'ababi, n'okureeba abahikiriire nibatwazibwa nk'ababi! Ekyo nikikabure! Omucwi w'emanja z'ensi yoona tarikora ebihikire? <verse eid="GEN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:1">Yer 5:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 22:30">Ezk 22:30</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagarukamu ati: Omu rurembo rwa Sodoma ku ndaashangyemu abahikiriire makumi ataano, niinyija kurusaasira rwona ahabwabo. <verse eid="GEN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:4">Zab 8:4</ref>. </char></note> Abrahamu yaagaruka yaagira ati: Reeba, naayehanga kugamba na Mukama wangye, haza ndi omucuucu n'eiju. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Mbwenu shi, abahikiriire makumi ataano kuhaakuburaho bataano, okaacwekyereza orurembo rwona ahabw'abo abataano abaaburaho? Yaagira ati: Ku ndaashangyeyo makumi ana na bataano, tindikwija kurucwekyereza. <verse eid="GEN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Abrahamu yaagaruka yaamugira ati: Ku haraabonekyeyo makumi ana! Yaagarukamu ati: Tindikwija kurucwekyereza ahabw'abo makumi ana. <verse eid="GEN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Kandi yaagaruka yaagira ati: Mukama wangye arekye kungwerwa kubi, ngarukye ngambe. Ku haraabonekyeyo makumi ashatu. Yaamugarukamu ati: Tindikwija kurucwekyereza, ku ndaashangyeyo makumi ashatu. <verse eid="GEN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Yaagira ati: Reeba, naayehanga kugamba na Mukama wangye. Ku haraabonekyeyo makumi abiri. Yaagarukamu ati: Tindikwija kurucwekyereza ahabw'abo makumi abiri. <verse eid="GEN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:39">Bar 6:39</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaagira ati: Mukama wangye arekye kuguubwa kubi, ngarukye ngambe omurundi ogu gwonka. Mbwenu shi ku haraabonekyemu ikumi. <verse eid="GEN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Yaamugarukamu ati: Tindirucwekyereza ku hakubonekayo ikumi. <verse eid="GEN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 18:34" />MUKAMA ku yaaherize kugamba na Abrahamu, yaagyenda; kandi na Abrahamu yaagaruka owe.<verse eid="GEN 18:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s1">Baamaraika okuhika Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 18:2">Kut 18:2</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 18:22">22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baamaraika abo bombi baahika Sodoma omu mwabazyo; baashanga Looti ashutami aha irembo rya Sodoma. Looti ku yaabareebire, yaimuka kubabugana; yainama ahansi, yaagira ati: <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />Bakama bangye, nimbeeshengyereza mukubuukye, mutaahe omu ka y'omwiru waanyu, munaabe aha bigyere, muraare; omu kasheeshe kare mwimukye, mugyende. Baagarukamu bati: Ngaaha; kureka nitwija kuraara omu muhanda, burugyeho busheeshe. <verse eid="GEN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Yaabagyema munonga, baakubuuka, baataaha omu ka ye; yaabateekyera obugyenyi, yaateeka emigaati etatumbisiibwe, baarya.<verse eid="GEN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Kwonka ku baabaire batakabyamire, abashaija b'omu rurembo Sodoma, abato n'abakuru, abantu boona abaarugire embaju zoona baayehinguririza egyo nju; <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:24">Rom 1:24</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:7">Yud 1:7</ref>. </char></note> baayeta Looti, nibagira bati: Abashaija abaija owaawe ogu mwabazyo barahi? Batureetere, tubamanye. <verse eid="GEN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Looti yaashohora, yaabashanga aha muryango, yaagaruraho orwigi; <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />yaabagira ati: Bagyenzi bangye, nimbeeshengyereza mutakora ekibi ekirikushusha kityo. <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Reeba, nyine bahara bangye babiri abatakamanyaga mushaija; ka mbabashohoreze, mubakore, nk'oku murikwenda; kwonka mutagira eki mwakora ahari aba bashaija, ahakuba baizire kuraara omu nju yangye. <verse eid="GEN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:14">Kur 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 2:7-9">2 Pet 2:7-9</ref>. </char></note> Baagira bati: Rugaho, tuhigize. Baagaruka baagira bati: Orushaija oru rukaija rushuhuukire, mbwenu nirwenda kwehindura omuramuzi? Hati twaza kukugira kubi okukira oku twakubagizire. Baamiganira ahari ogwo mushaija Looti, bairira haihi kucwa orwigi. <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Abashaija abaabaire bari omu nju, baashohoza emikono yaabo, baataasya Looti, baakinga orwigi. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:11">Byak 13:11</ref>. </char></note> Baahumya amaisho g'abashaija abaabaire bari aha rwigi, abato n'abakuru; nahabw'ekyo baafa kubi, nibakorakora nibasherura orwigi.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 6:22">Yos 6:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima abo bashaija baabuuza Looti bati: Oine abandi bantu aha? Mukwe waawe, n'abatabani baawe, na bahara baawe, n'omuntu weena ou oine omuri oru rurembo, obaihe omuri ogu mwanya; <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />ahakuba twaza kugucwekyereza, ahabw'okuba okutaka kw'abarikubarega kurengyesereize omu maisho ga MUKAMA; kandi MUKAMA atutumire kugucwekyereza. <verse eid="GEN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:6">Yer 51:6</ref>, <ref loc="JER 51:45">45</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:4">Kush 18:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:28-30">Luk 17:28-30</ref>. </char></note> Looti yaashohora, yaagambira abakwe, abaabaire nibenda kushwera bahara be, naagira ati: Mwimukye, murugye omu mwanya ogu; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA naayenda kucwekyereza orurembo. Kwonka omu maisho ga bakwe be yaashusha nk'orikuteera obuyaga.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhunga kwa Looti n'okucwekyereza kwa Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Ku bwaseesire, baamaraika baateera Looti obwira, nibagira bati: Imuka otware omukazi waawe na bahara baawe bombi abari aha, mutakaagwa omu rubanja rw'orurembo. <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:7">Kur 34:7</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka yaaguma naayeziringa; abashaija abo nikwo kumukwata omukono, n'omukono gw'omukazi we, n'emikono ya bahara be bombi, bakamushohoza aheeru y'orurembo, nk'oku MUKAMA yaamusaasiire. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:39">Heb 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:26">Kut 19:26</ref>. </char></note> Ku baaherize kubashohoreza kimwe, omwe yaagira ati: Hunga otafa; otareeba enyima, n'obu kwakuba okwemereraho omu ruhita rwona; hungira omu bibungo, otakaacwekyerezibwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Looti yaabagira ati: Ngaaha, Mukama wangye. <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Reeba omwiru waawe naaheebwa omugisha omu maisho gaawe, waakanyisa embabazi zaawe ezi wangirira kunkiza okufa. Tindikubaasa kuhungira mu bibungo, ntakaahikwaho akabi, nkafa. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Reeba, orurembo ruriya ruri haihi okuhungiramu, kandi ni rukye. Naakweshengyereza mbe nirwo naahungiramu, (ti rukye?), Amagara gangye nigaija kukiriramu. <verse eid="GEN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Yaamugarukamu ati: Naakwikiriza n'ekyo nakyo, okutahwerekyereza rurembo oru waagambaho. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Yehuute ohungireyo; ahakuba tindikubaasa kukora kintu kyona, otakahikireyo. Orwo rurembo nikyo rwayeteirwe Zoari.<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Looti yaahika Zoari, akashana kaatagata. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:29">Luk 17:29</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:7">Yud 1:7</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaabona kunaga ahari Sodoma na Gomora omuriro n'obuganga bw'ekibiriiti, nibiruga ahari MUKAMA omu iguru; <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />yaacwekyereza ezo ndembo, n'oruhita rwona n'abaatuuzi baamwo boona, n'ekyabaire kimezire ahansi. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Luk 17:31</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omukazi we, owaabaire amukuratiire, yaareeba enyima, yaahinduka enyomyo y'omwonyo. <verse eid="GEN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:22">Kut 18:22</ref>. </char></note> Abrahamu yaimuka omu kasheeshe, yaaza ahu ayemereire omu maisho ga MUKAMA, <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />yaareeba aha bukiizi bwa Sodoma na Gomora n'oruhita rwona; kandi reeba, ensi ekaba neecumba omwika nk'ogw'ekikoomi. <verse eid="GEN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Kandi Ruhanga, ku yaabaire naacwekyereza endembo z'omuri orwo ruhita, yaijuka Abrahamu, yaatuma ahari Looti ngu azirugyemu, omu kucwekyereza ezo ndembo ezi Looti yaabaire atwiremu.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obukomooko bw'aba Moabu n'aba Amoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Bwanyima Looti yaaruga Zoari yainamuka omu bibungo na bahara be bombi; ahakuba akatiina kutuura Zoari; atyo yaataaha omu nyanga na bahara be bombi. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Omukuru yaagambira omuto ati: Tataitwe akuzire; kandi omu nsi tiharimu muntu oriija kutushwera, nk'emicwe y'ensi yoona oku eri. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Ija tunywaise tataitwe viinyo, tumusinze, tubyame nawe, tutungye oruzaaro, turekye kufa bucwekye. <verse eid="GEN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Baasinza ishebo ekyo kiro; omukuru yaataahamu, yaabyama na ishe; kandi ishe tiyaamanya bunaku bu yaabyamiramu nawe, n'obu yaimukiramu. <verse eid="GEN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Ku bwaseesire, omukuru yaagira omuto ati: Reeba, nyekiro mbyamire na taata; ka tugarukye tumusinze eki kiro; naiwe otaahemu, obyame nawe, tutungye oruzaaro, turekye kufa bucwekye. <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Batyo baagaruka baasinza ishebo na viinyo ekyo kiro; omuto yaimuka, yaabyama nawe; ishe tiyaamanya bunaku bu yaabyamiramu nawe, nobu yaimukiramu. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Okwo nikwo bahara ba Looti baatwekirwe ishebo. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:9">Bir 2:9</ref>. </char></note> Omukuru yaazaara omwana w'omwojo, yaamweta Moabu; niwe ishe w'Abamoabu n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:19">Bir 2:19</ref>. </char></note> Omuto nawe yaazaara omwana w'omwojo, yaamweta Ben-ami; niwe ishe w'Abaamoni n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Abrahamu okugaruka kubeiha ngu omukazi we ni munyaanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Abrahamu yaarugayo, yaaza aha bukiizi bw'ensi ya Negebu, yaatuura ahagati ya Kadeshi na Shuuri; bwanyima yaashuhuukira Gerari. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:11-15">Kut 12:11-15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:7">26:7</ref>. </char></note> Abrahamu yaagamba ku omukazi we Saara ari munyaanya. Abimeleki omugabe wa Gerari yaatuma ahari Saara, yaamutwara. <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Kwonka Ruhanga yaija ahari Abimeleki nyekiro omu kirooto, yaamugira ati: Reeba, waafa, ahabw'okuba omukazi ou otwaire aine iba. <verse eid="GEN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Kwonka Abimeleki akaba atakamuhikire; Abimeleki nikwo kugarukamu ati: Nooyenda kwita eihanga eritaine rubanja? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />We wenka tarangizire ati: Ogu ni munyaanyazi? Kandi omukazi nawe akagira ati: Ndi munyaanya. Eki eki nkozire nkikozire, nyine omutima gw'amazima n'emikono etaine rubanja. <verse eid="GEN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Ruhanga yaamugarukamu omu kirooto, ati: Eego, nimmanya ngu okikozire, oine omutima gw'amazima; kandi naanye nkuzibiire kuncumuraho; nikyo ntakwikiririize kumukoraho. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Mbwenu nu garurira ogwo mushaija omukazi we, ahakuba ni nabi, akushabire orekye kufa; kwonka ku oraabe otamumugaruriire, omanyire kimwe ngu noija kufa hamwe n'abaawe boona.<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Abimeleki yaaguruka kare, yaatuma aha bairu be boona, yaabateekyerereza ebyo byona, baatiina munonga. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Bwanyima yaatuma ahari Abrahamu, yaamubuuza ati: otutuzire ki? Nkucumwireho ki, waaza kundeetaho ekibi kihango, nyowe n'obugabe bwangye? Onkoreire ebitakorwa. <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Kandi yaagaruka yaabuuza Abrahamu ati: Okareeba ki, ekyakureeteire kukora otyo? <verse eid="GEN 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Abrahamu yaagarukamu ati: Nkakikora ahabw'okuteekateeka ngu: Buzima omu mwanya ogu tiharimu kutiina Ruhanga; nibaija kuunyita ahabw'omukazi wangye. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Kandi ekindi, ni munyaanyazi buzima, owa taata otari wa maawe; kwonka nkamushwera. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Bwanyima Ruhanga ku yaanyihire omu ka ya taata, yampindura ow'okuzengyerera, naagira Saara nti: Eky'embabazi eki oshemereire kunkorera n'eki; buri mwanya gwona ogu turizamu, ogume ogire oti: Ogu ni munyaanyazi. <verse eid="GEN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:14">Kut 12:14</ref>. </char></note> Abimeleki yaareeta entaama n'ente n'abahuuku n'abazaana, yaabiha Abrahamu, yaamugarurira na Saara omukazi we. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Kandi yaamugira ati: Reeba, ensi yangye ekuri omu maisho; otuure ahu orikwenda hoona. <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Yaagambira na Saara ati: Reeba, naaha munyaanyoko ebicweka by'efeeza rukumi, kukwihaho ekihemu omu maisho g'abari hamwe naiwe boona; kandi omu maisho g'abantu boona oryaguma ori ohikire. <verse eid="GEN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Bwanyima Abrahamu yaashaba Ruhanga; Ruhanga yaakiza Abimeleki n'omukazi we n'abazaana be; baazaara abaana; <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:17">Kut 12:17</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba MUKAMA akaba ayigariire kimwe enda z'ab'omu ka ya Abimeleki ahabwa Saara muka Abrahamu.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Okuzaarwa kwa Isaaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:19">Kut 17:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA yaataayaayira Saara nk'oku yaagambire, kandi MUKAMA yaakorera Saara nk'oku yaaraganiise. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Saara yaagira enda, yaazaarira Abrahamu omwana w'omwojo yaakuzire, omu bunaku obu Ruhanga yaamugambiire. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Abrahamu yaayeta ogwo mwana ou yaazaire Isaaka, ou Saara yaamuzaariire. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10-12">Kut 17:10-12</ref>. </char></note> Abrahamu yaashara omwana we Isaaka amazire ebiro munaana azairwe, nk'oku Ruhanga yaamuragiire. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Kandi Abrahamu akaba ahikize emyaka igana, obu yaazaara ogwo mwana Isaaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Isa 54:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:14">Luk 1:14</ref>. </char></note> Saara yaagira ati: Ruhanga anshekize; n'oraakihurire weena naija kusheka. <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Yaagaruka yaagira ati: N'oha owaakugizire Abrahamu, ngu Saara nawe aryayontsya abaana? Ahakuba mmuzaariire omwana w'omwojo omu bugurusi bwe. <verse eid="GEN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Omwana yaakura, yaacuuka; Abrahamu yaateeka obugyenyi bwingi aha izooba eri Isaaka yaacuukiireho.<verse eid="GEN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saara okubingisa Hagari na Ishimaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 16:1">Kut 16:1</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 16:4">4</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 16:15">15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Saara yaareeba omwana wa Hagari Omunyamisrikazi, ou yaazairweho Abrahamu, naazaana n'omutabani. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:29-31">Gal 4:29-31</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo yaagiriire Abrahamu ati: Binga ogu muzaana n'omwana we; ahakuba omwana w'ogu muzaanakazi tarihungura n'omwana wangye Isaaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:18">Kut 17:18</ref>. </char></note> Ekigambo ekyo kyagwisa kubi Abrahamu ahabw'omwana we. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:18">Heb 11:18</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaagambira Abrahamu ati: Otaguubwa kubi ahabw'omwana n'ahabw'omuzaanakazi waawe. Kyona eki Saara araakugambire, omworobere; ahabw'okuba baijukuru baawe baryayetererwa Isaaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Kandi omwana w'omuzaana nawe ndyamuhindura eihanga, ahabw'okuba n'omwana waawe. <verse eid="GEN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />N'ahabw'ekyo Abrahamu yaimuka omu kasheeshe kare, yaagira eby'okurya n'efurebe y'amaizi, yaabiha Hagari, yaabimuta aha ibega, yaamuha n'ogwo mwana, yaamwohereza. Yaarugayo, yaaguma naagyendagyenda omu ihamba rya Beeri-sheba.<verse eid="GEN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Amaizi ku gaahweire omu furebe, yaarambika omwana ahansi y'ekishaka, <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />yaagyenda, yaashutama hangahari naamureeba, kaanya nk'aharikurashwa omwambi; ahabw'okuba akagira ati: Ka ndekye kureeba omwana wangye naakaba. Ku yaabaire ashutami naareeba ei ari, omwana yaimutsya eiraka, yaarira. <verse eid="GEN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:7">Kur 3:7</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaahurira eiraka ry'ogwo mwana; maraika wa Ruhanga yaayema omu iguru, yaayeta Hagari, yaamugira ati: Waaba ota, Hagari? Otatiina, ahabw'okuba Ruhanga yaahurira eiraka ry'omwojo ah'ari. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:13">Kut 21:13</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 25:12">25:12</ref>. </char></note> Imuka, oimutsye omwana, omweyegamize aha mukono; ahakuba ndyamuhindura eihanga rihango. <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:17">2 Bag 6:17</ref>. </char></note> Omuri ogwo mwanya Ruhanga yaigura amaisho ga Hagari, yaareeba eiziba ry'amaizi, yaagyenda, yaijuza efurebe amaizi, yaanywaisa omwana. <verse eid="GEN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Okuruga aho Ruhanga yaaguma n'omwojo, yaakura, yaatuura omu ihamba, yaaba omurasi rugambwa. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Yaaguma omu ihamba rya Parani; nyina yaamushwererera Omunyamisrikazi.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abrahamu okuragaana na Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Omu biro ebyo Abimeleki na Fikooli omukuru w'engabo ze baagambira Abrahamu bati: Ruhanga ari hamwe naiwe omu bi orikukora byona. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />N'ahabw'ekyo ondahire Ruhanga, ku otarimbeiha nari mutabani wangye, n'obu yaakuba mwijukuru wangye; kureka nk'embabazi ezi naakugiriire oku ziri, naiwe ku nikwo oringirira n'ensi, ei waashuhuukiiremu. <verse eid="GEN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Abrahamu yaamugarukamu ati: Naaza kukurahira.<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 26:15-22">Kut 26:15-22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Abrahamu yaatonganisa Abimeleki ahabw'eiziba eri abairu ba Abimeleki baamwakire n'empaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Abimeleki yaagarukamu ati: Tindikumanya owaakozire ekyo; naiwe tokabingambiraga, kandi tinkakihuriraga, kureka eri izooba. <verse eid="GEN 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:28-31">Kut 26:28-31</ref>. </char></note> Abrahamu yaatwara entaama n'ente, yaaziha Abimeleki; bombi baaragaana endagaano. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Abrahamu yaashoroora omu busyo abaagazi b'entaama mushanju. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Abimeleki yaabuuza Abrahamu ati: Abaagazi b'entaama aba mushanju abu waashoroora, n'aba ki? <verse eid="GEN 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Yaagarukamu ati: Aba baagazi b'entaama mushanju naabakuha, obatware, babe eky'okuhamya eiziba eri ku niinye naarifukwire. <verse eid="GEN 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Nikyo yaayeteire omwanya ogwo Beeri-sheba, ahakuba aho niho baarahiriire bombi. <verse eid="GEN 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Batyo baaragaanira endagaano Beeri-sheba; bwanyima Abimeleki na Fikooli omukuru w'engabo ze baimuka, baagaruka omu nsi y'Abafilistia. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:27">Bir 33:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:6">Isa 9:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Abrahamu yaabyara ekiti ky'omwesheli ahari Beeri-sheba; yaaramizaho eiziina rya MUKAMA Ruhanga otahwaho. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Bwanyima Abrahamu yaamara ebiro bingi, ashuhuukiire omu nsi y'Abafilistia.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okugyeza Abrahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 1:12-14">Yak 1:12-14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo Ruhanga yaagyeza Abrahamu, yaamweta ati: Abrahamu! Yaamweetaba ati: Nyamuhanga! <verse eid="GEN 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:16">Yoh 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:1">2 Bus 3:1</ref>. </char></note> Yaamugira ati: Twara omwana waawe omwe nyamunegyere Isaaka, ou okunda, oze omu nsi ya Moria, omutambire aha kibungo kimwe omu bibungo by'aho, eki ndaakugambire, kuba ekitambo ekyokize. <verse eid="GEN 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:17-19">Heb 11:17-19</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Abrahamu yaimuka kare omu kasheeshe, yaatandika endogoya ye, yaatwara babiri aha batsigazi be na Isaaka omwana we; yaashatura enku z'okwotsya ekitambo, yaimuka, yaaza omu mwanya ogu Ruhanga amugambiire. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Aha kiro kya kashatu Abrahamu yaanaga amaisho, yaareeba omwanya gukiri hare. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Abrahamu yaagira abatsigazi be ati: Imwe mugume aha n'endogoya, nyowe n'omwojo tuze kuriya, turamye, haza tugarukye, tubashangye aha. <verse eid="GEN 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:17">Yoh 19:17</ref>. </char></note> Abrahamu yaakwata enku z'okwotsya ekitambo, yaazikorera Isaaka omwana we; we yaatwara omuriro n'omusyo gw'endiga; baagyenda hamwe bombi. <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Isaaka yaayeta Abrahamu ishe ati: Taata! Abrahamu yaamwetaba ati: N'enki, mwana wangye? Yaagira ati: Beitu shi ka twine omuriro n'enku; omwana gw'entaama ogw'okutamba gurahi? <verse eid="GEN 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:19">1 Pet 1:19</ref>. </char></note> Abrahamu yaagarukamu ati: Mwana wangye, Ruhanga naija kwebonera omwana gw'entaama gw'ekitambo ky'okwotsya. Batyo baagumizamu bombi.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 10:17">Yoh 10:17</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 10:18">18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baahikire omu mwanya ogu Ruhanga amugambiire, Abrahamu yaayombekayo eitambiro, yaariteekyeraho enku, yaaboha Isaaka omwana we, yaamugarika aha itambiro aha nku. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:6-12">Isa 53:6-12</ref>. </char></note> Abrahamu yaakununkirira omusyo kurezya omutabani. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Maraika wa MUKAMA yaayema omu iguru, yaamweta ati: Abrahamu! Abrahamu! Yaayetaba ati: Nyamuhanga! <verse eid="GEN 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:32">Rom 8:32</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:22">Yak 2:22</ref>. </char></note> Yaamugira ati: Otakora ahari ogwo mwana, nari kugira eki waamwitsa; ahabw'okuba hati naamanya ku orikutiina Ruhanga ahabw'okutaanyima mwana waawe omwe nyamunegyere. <verse eid="GEN 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Abrahamu yaimutsya amaisho, yaamagamaga, yaareeba enyima ye empaya y'entaama ekwatsirwe ebikamba omu mahembe; Abrahamu yaagyenda, yaihayo egyo mpaya, yaagitamba kuba ekitambo ekyokize omu mwanya gw'omwana we. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Abrahamu yaayeta ogwo mwanya Yehovayire, nk'oku kirikugambwa na hati ngu, Aha kibungo kya MUKAMA kiryaheebwa.<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okugaruka kuragaanisa Abrahamu omugisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Maraika wa MUKAMA yaagaruka yaayema omu iguru, yaayeta Abrahamu omurundi gwa kabiri, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />yaamugira ati: Naayerahira, nikwo MUKAMA arikugira, ahabw'okukora eki, otanyime mwana waawe omwe nyamunegyere, <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:16">Kut 13:16</ref>. </char></note> nti: Okukuha ndyakuha omugisha, kandi n'okukanyisa ndyakanyisa oruzaaro rwawe rube nk'enyonyoozi z'omu iguru, kandi nk'omusheenyi gw'aha rubaju rw'enyanja; n'oruzaaro rwawe ruryakubuura amarembo g'abazigu baarwo; <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:8">Gal 3:8</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 3:9">9</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 3:16">16</ref>. </char></note> kandi omurirwo amahanga goona ag'omu nsi nimwo gariheerwa omugisha, ahabw'okuba oyorobeire eiraka ryangye. <verse eid="GEN 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Bwanyima Abrahamu yaagaruka aha batsigazi be; baimuka baagyenda hamwe Beeri-sheba; Abrahamu yaaba niyo yaatuura.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 11:29">Kut 11:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo baagambira Abrahamu bati: Reeba, Milika nawe azaariire Nahori abaana; <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />omujigaijo ni Uzi, n'omurumuna Buuzi, na Kemueli ishe wa Aramu; <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />na Kesedi, Haazo, Piludashi, Yidulafu na Besueli. <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:15">Kut 24:15</ref>. </char></note> Besueli yaazaara Rebeka; abo omunaana nibo Milika yaazaariire Nahori, murumuna wa Abrahamu. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Kandi n'omukazi we w'ekinyanshunju orikwetwa Reuma, nawe yaazaara Teeba, Gahamu, Tahashi na Maaka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Saara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Saara akamara emyaka igana na makumi abiri na mushanju; egyo niyo myaka ei yaahikize. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Yaafeera Kiryasiaraba (niyo Heburooni) omu nsi ya Kanaani; Abrahamu yaataaha omu ihema kuririra Saara n'okumucurira; <verse eid="GEN 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />yaaruga aha mutumbi gwe, yaashohora, yaagambira aba Heesi ati: <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:30">Kut 49:30</ref>. </char></note> Ndi omunyaihanga kandi omushuhuuki omuriimwe; mumpe omwanya gw'okuziikamu, mbone kuziika omufu wangye, andugye omu maisho. <verse eid="GEN 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Aba Heesi baagarukamu Abrahamu bati: <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />Mukama waitu, tuhurire; ori omuntu mukuru munonga omuriitwe; ziika omufu waawe omu kituuro eki oraatoorane omu bituuro byaitu byona; tihariho n'omwe omuriitwe oraakwime ekituuro kye, ngu otaziikamu omufu waawe. <verse eid="GEN 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Abrahamu yaimuka, yainama omu maisho ga bakama b'ensi, aba Heesi. <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />Yaabagira ati: Ku muraabe nimwikiriza ngu nziikye omufu wangye, andugye omu maisho, mumpurire, munyeshengyerereze Efurooni mwene Zohari, <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />ampe enyanga ya Makipeela ei aine, eri aha muheru gw'ekibanja kye; agingurize omu maisho gaanyu nk'obuguzi bwayo oku buri, gube omwanya gwangye ogw'okuziikamu. <verse eid="GEN 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:4">Rus 4:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi obwo Efurooni akaba ashutami omu ba Heesi; Efurooni ogwo Omuhiiti yaagarukamu Abrahamu, aba Heesi boona abaabaire nibataaha omu irembo ry'orurembo rwe bamuhuriire, naagira ati: <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />Ngaaha, Mukama wangye, mpurira. Ekyo kibanja naakikuha, n'enyanga yaamwo; naabikuheera omu maisho g'eihanga ryaitu. Oziikyemu omufu waawe. <verse eid="GEN 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Abrahamu yainama omu maisho ga bakama b'ensi. <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />Yaagambira Efurooni, boona bahuriire, ati: Ku oraabe nookisiima, naakweshengyereza, ompurire; nkuheereze obuguzi bw'ekibanja nk'oku buri; kandi ikiriza obutware, naanye mbone kuziikamu omufu wangye. <verse eid="GEN 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Efurooni yaagarukamu Abrahamu ati: <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />Mukama wangye, mpurira. Akabanja akarikugurwa shekeli z'efeeza magana ana nikyo ki ahariiwe naanye? Mbwenu ziikamu omufu waawe. <verse eid="GEN 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Abrahamu yaikiriza Efurooni, yaamurengyera efeeza ezi yaagambira omu maisho g'aba Heesi, shekeli magana ana z'efeeza, ezirikukoresibwa abashuubuzi.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 25:9">Kut 25:9</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 49:30">49:30</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:16">Byak 7:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okwo nikwo Efurooni yaaguzire ekibanja kye, ekyabaire kiri Makipeela, aharikureeba Mamure, ekibanja n'enyanga yaamwo, n'emiti yoona eyaabaire erimu okuhika aha mwatano ogwabaire gukyehinguririize, <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />byahamibwa omu maisho g'aba Heesi n'ag'abaabaire nibataaha omu irembo ry'orurembo rwe kuba ebya Abrahamu. <verse eid="GEN 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Bwanyima y'ekyo, Abrahamu yaaziika omukazi we Saara omu nyanga y'omu kibanja kya Makipeela, aharikureeba Mamure (niyo Heburooni) omu nsi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Ekyo kibanja n'enyanga yaamwo byahamibwa aba Heesi kuba ebya Abrahamu n'okuba omwanya gwe gw'okuziikamu.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s1">Abrahamu okutuma ow'okuriimira omutabani omukazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Abrahamu akaba akuzire, ahikire omu ngingo zaabukuru; kandi MUKAMA akaba amuhaire omugisha omuri byona. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:2">Kut 15:2</ref>. </char></note> Abrahamu yaagambira omugaragwa we mukuru owaabaire naategyeka eby'omu ka ye byona, ati: Ija ote omukono gwawe ahansi y'ekibero kyangye; <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:16">Kur 34:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:14-17">2 Kor 6:14-17</ref>. </char></note> nkurahize MUKAMA Ruhanga w'eiguru n'ensi, ku otarishwererera mwana wangye omuri bahara b'Abanyakanaani, abu ntwiremu; <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:2">Kut 28:2</ref>. </char></note> kureka ku ogigyenda omu ihanga ryaitu, kandi omuri beene waitu, okaba niyo waashwererera omwana wangye Isaaka omukazi. <verse eid="GEN 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Omugaragwa yaamugarukamu ati: Shana akaayanga kwija naanye omu nsi egi. Ku kiriba kyabaire kityo, omwana waawe mmugarure omu nsi ei waarugiremu? <verse eid="GEN 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Abrahamu yaamugira ati: Oyerinde, otarigarurayo omwana wangye. <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:7">Zab 34:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:9">Isa 63:9</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA Ruhanga w'eiguru owaanyihire omu ka ya taata n'omu nsi ei naazairwemu, kandi owangambiire naarahira ati: Oruzaaro rwawe ndyaruha ensi egi, Ogwo aryatuma maraika we akwebembere, oshwererereyo omwana wangye omukazi. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Omukazi ku aryanga kwija naiwe, orwo tiruriba rubanja rwawe ahabw'endahiro ei naakurahiza; kwonka eki ndikukwehanangiriza, otarigarurayo omwana wangye. <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Omugaragwa nikwo kuta omukono ahansi y'ekibero kya Abrahamu mukama we, akamurahira ku arikikora.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Bwanyima omugaragwa yaatwara engamira ikumi aha za mukama we n'ebintu birungi eby'okuriimisa eby'emiringo yoona ebi yaahairwe mukama we, yaimuka yaaza Mesopotamia, yaahika haihi n'orurembo rwa Nahori. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:16">Kur 2:16</ref>. </char></note> Yaateeza engamira ebikokora ahansi aheeru y'orurembo aha iziba ry'amaizi omu mwabazyo, ahu abakazi batahira amaizi. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:6">Fil 4:6</ref>. </char></note> Yaashaba ati: Ai MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa mukama wangye Abrahamu, ninkweshengyereza, mpa omugisha hati, ogirire mukama wangye Abrahamu embabazi. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Reeba, nyemereire aha aha iziba; kandi abaishiki b'abanyarurembo nibaija kutaha amaizi. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Mbwenu kibe kiti; omwishiki, ou ndaagire nti, Tuura orunywero rwawe, nnyweho, naakweshengyereza, nawe akagarukamu ati, Nywaho, kandi naaza kweshera n'engamira zaawe, abe ogwo ou waatooraniire omwiru waawe Isaaka; kandi aho niho ndaamanyire ku waagirira mukama wangye embabazi.<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Ku yaabaire atakaherize kushaba, reeba, haashohora Rebeka, muhara wa Besueli, mutabani wa Milika, muka Nahori murumuna wa Abrahamu, aine orunywero rwe aha ibega. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Kandi omwishiki ogwo akaba ari murungi munonga orikureebwa, omwishiki otakamanyaga mushaija; yaashuuma aha iziba, yaijuza orunywero rwe amaizi, yainamuka. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Omugaragwa yairuka kumubugana, yaagira ati: Naakweshengyereza, mpa otwizi, nnywere aha runywero rwawe. <verse eid="GEN 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Yaamugira ati: Nywaho, Mukama wangye. Yaarahuka, yaata orunywero rwe aha kiganja, yaamunywaisa. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Ku yaaherize kumunywaisa, yaagira ati: Naaza kweshera n'engamira zaawe, nazo zinywe okuhitsya obu ziraakuukye. <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Yaarahuka yaashuka amaizi omu bwato, yaagaruka omu iziba kutaha, yaayeshera engamira ze zoona. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Omushaija yaamugumyaho amaisho ahunami, kumanya ku MUKAMA araabe ahaire orugyendo rwe omugisha, nari shi ataruguhaire.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 3:3">1 Pet 3:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Engamira ku zaakuukire, omushaija yaihayo empeta y'ezaabu ey'oburemeezi bw'ekicweka kya shekeli, n'engoro ibiri ez'okumujweka aha mikono, ziine oburemeezi bwa shekeli ikumi z'ezaabu, <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />yaamugira ati: Ori muhara w'oha? Ngambira, naakweshengyereza. Kandi tukaabona oburaaro omu ka ya sho? <verse eid="GEN 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Yaamugarukamu ati: Ndi muhara wa Besueli, mutabani wa Milika, ou yaazairweho Nahori. <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Yaagaruka yaagira ati: Twine obunyaatsi n'eby'okurya byazo ebirikumara; kandi n'oburaaro buriyo. <verse eid="GEN 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:31">Kur 4:31</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:6">Enf 3:6</ref>. </char></note> Omushaija yainama, yaaramya MUKAMA, <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />yaagira ati: MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa mukama wangye Abrahamu, ahimbisibwe, ahakuba tarekire kugirira mukama wangye embabazi n'obwesigwa; kandi naanye MUKAMA anyebembeire, yampitsya ahari beene ishe ba mukama wangye. <verse eid="GEN 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Omwishiki yairuka, yaagambira ab'omwa nyina ebigambo ebyo byona.<verse eid="GEN 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 29:5">Kut 29:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Rebeka akaba aine munyaanya orikwetwa Labaani; Labaani ogwo yaashohora, yairuka kubugana ogwo mushaija aha iziba. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Ku yaareebire empeta y'ezaabu n'engoro aha mikono ya munyaanya, kandi yaahurira Rebeka munyaanya naagamba ebi yaagambirwa ogwo mushaija, yaija ah'ari, yaashanga ayemereire aha rubaju rw'engamira aha iziba. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Yaamugira ati: Ija otaahe, iwe ou MUKAMA ahaire omugisha. N'enki ekikwemereize aheeru? Ahakuba naakuteekateekyera enju, n'ahu engamira ziraaraare. <verse eid="GEN 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:24">43:24</ref>. </char></note> Atyo omushaija yaataaha omu nju, Labaani yaatandiikurura engamira, yaareeta obunyaatsi n'eby'okurya by'engamira, n'amaizi g'okunaabisa ebigyere bye n'eby'abashaija abu yaabaire aine. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:5-7">Efe 6:5-7</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima baamureetera eby'okurya; kwonka we yaagira ati: Tindikwija kurya, ntakagambire bi ntumirwe. Ndi Labaani ati: Bigambe.<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Yaagira ati: Ndi omugaragwa wa Abrahamu. <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:3">Yob 1:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA akaha mukama wangye omugisha mwingi munonga, yaahinduka omuntu rugambwa. Yaamuha amasyo g'entaama n'ag'ente, efeeza n'ezaabu, abahuuku n'abazaana, engamira n'endogoya. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Na Saara muka mukama wangye yaamuzaarira omwana w'omwojo yaakuzire; n'omwana ogwo ishe amuhaire ebi aine byona. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Mbwenu mukama wangye akndahiza, naagira ati: Otarishwererera omwana wangye omukazi omu baishiki b'Abanyakanaani, abu ntwire omu nsi yaabo; <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />kureka oryagaruka omu muryango gwa taata n'omuri beene waitu, obe niyo waashwererera omwana wangye omukazi. <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Naagambira mukama wangye nti: Shana omukazi tariikiriza kwija naanye. <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:20">Kur 23:20</ref>. </char></note> Yangarukamu ati: MUKAMA ou ngyenda nandeeba, aryatuma maraika we, ahe orugyendo rwawe omugisha, obone kushwererera omwana wangye omukazi omuri beene waitu n'omu muryango gwa taata. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Ku orihika omuri beene waitu, oryaba otakiine rubanja ahabw'endahiro ei naakurahiza; kandi n'obu bariba batamukuhaire, nabwo torigira rubanja ahabw'endahiro egyo.<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:42: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 1:11">Neh 1:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu eri izooba ku naahika aha iziba, naashaba nti: Ai MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa mukama wangye Abrahamu, ku oraabe ohaire omugisha orugyendo rwangye oru ndimu, <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />reeba, naayemerera aha iziba; mbwenu kibe kiti; omwishiki oraije kutaha amaizi, ou ndaashabe nti, Mpa aha maizi g'omu runywero rwawe, nnyweho, <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />nawe akangira ati: Nywaho, kandi naaza kweshera n'engamira zaawe, abe niwe yaaba omukazi, ou MUKAMA yaateekateekyeire omwana wa mukama wangye. <verse eid="GEN 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:24">Isa 65:24</ref>. </char></note> Ku naaba ntakaherize bi naaba ninshaba omu mutima gwangye, naayecura Rebeka naashohora omu rurembo, aine orunywero rwe aha ibega; yaashuuma aha iziba, yaataha amaizi, naamugira nti: Mpa nnyweho, naakweshengyereza. <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />Ahonaaho yaiha orunywero rwe aha ibega, yaagira ati: Nywaho; kandi ka nyeshere n'engamira zaawe. Ntyo naanywaho, kandi yaayeshera n'engamira. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:11">Ezk 16:11</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 16:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Naamubuuza nti: Ori muhara w'oha? Yaagarukamu ati: Ndi muhara wa Besueli, mutabani wa Nahori, ou yaazaire ahari Milika; naanye nikwo kumujweka empeta aha nyindo, n'engoro aha mikono ye. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Bwanyima nainama, naaramya MUKAMA, kandi naasiima MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa mukama wangye Abrahamu, onyebembeire omu muhanda oguhikire kushwererera omwana wa mukama wangye omukazi omuri beene waabo. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Mbwenu ku muraabe nimwikiriza kukorera mukama wangye eby'embabazi n'eby'amazima, mungambire; nari shi, ku muraabe mutarikwikiriza, nabwo mungambire, mbone kugira orubaju oru naatoora, yaaba rwa buryo yaaba rwa bumosho. <verse eid="GEN 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:42">Mat 21:42</ref>. </char></note> Labaani na Besueli baagarukamu nibagira bati: Enaama egi n'eya MUKAMA; titwine ki turikubaasa kukugambira, yaaba kukwikiriza, nari kukwangira. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Reeba, Rebeka akuri omu maisho, mutware, mugyende, abe muka omwana wa mukama waawe, nk'oku MUKAMA yaagambire.<verse eid="GEN 24:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Omugaragwa wa Abrahamu ku yaahuriire okugarukamu kwabo, yainama, yaaramya MUKAMA. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Ogwo mugaragwa yaihayo ebintu birungi by'efeeza n'ezaabu n'ebijwaro, yaabiha Rebeka; kandi yaaha munyaanya na nyina ebintu by'obuguzi bwingi. <verse eid="GEN 24:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Bwanyima baarya, baanywa, we n'abashaija abu yaabaire aine, baaraarayo; ku baimukire omu kasheeshe, yaagira ati; Mundagye, ngarukye owa mukama wangye. <verse eid="GEN 24:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Munyaanya na nyina baamugarukamu bati: Reka omwishiki agume naitwe okumara ebiro nka ikumi nari okukiraho, bwanyima abone kugyenda. <verse eid="GEN 24:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Yaabagira ati: Nk'oku MUKAMA ahaire orugyendo rwangye omugisha, mutantuuza aha; kureka mundagye, ngarukye owa mukama wangye. <verse eid="GEN 24:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Baagira bati: Ka twete omwishiki, tumubuuze, ayegambire. <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Baayeta Rebeka, baamubuuza bati: Noikiriza kugyenda n'ogu mushaija? Yaagira ati: Niinyikiriza. <verse eid="GEN 24:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Batyo baaraga Rebeka munyaanyabo n'omurezi we n'omugaragwa wa Abrahamu n'abashaija be. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:60: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:11">Rus 4:11</ref>. </char></note> Baashabira Rebeka omugisha, nibagira bati: Munyaanyiitwe, obe nyina w'abantu enkumi n'obukumi; kandi oruzaaro rwawe rukubuure amarembo g'abarikurwanga. <verse eid="GEN 24:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Rebeka yaimuka n'abazaana be, baatemba engamira, baagyenda n'ogwo mushaija. Okwo nikwo omugaragwa yaatwaire Rebeka, akeegyendera.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Obwo Isaaka akaba yaarugire Beeri-lahairoi, atwire omu nsi ya Negebu. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:63: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:8">Yos 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:35">Mak 1:35</ref>. </char></note> Omu mwabazyo Isaaka yaashohora, yaaza omu ishwa kutunga omwanya gw'okuteekateeka; ku yaanagire amaisho, yaareeba engamira niziija. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Kandi Rebeka yaimutsya amaisho ge; ku yaareebire Isaaka, yaaruga aha ngamira. <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />Yaabuuza omugaragwa ati: Omushaija oriya orikwija kutubugana n'oha? Omugaragwa yaagira ati: Niwe mukama wangye. Rebeka yaakwata omwenda gwe, yaagwetwekyerera. <verse eid="GEN 24:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Omugaragwa yaateekyerereza Isaaka ebi yaakozire byona. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Bwanyima Isaaka yaatwara Rebeka omu ihema rya Saara nyina yaaba omukazi we, yaamukunda, yaayebwa enaku z'okufa kwa nyina.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Abrahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Bwanyima Abrahamu yaashwera ondiijo mukazi orikwetwa Ketura. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Yaazaara nawe Zimuraani, Yokishaani, Medani, Midiani, Ishibaaki na Shua. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Yokishaani yaazaara Sheeba na Dedani. Kandi beene Dedani n'aba Ashuri n'aba Letushi n'aba Leumi. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Kandi abaana ba Midiani ni Efa, Eferi, Hanoki, Abida na Elidaa. Abo boona n'oruzaaro rwa Ketura.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Abrahamu yaaha Isaaka ebye byona. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Kwonka abaana b'ebinyanshunju bye ebi yaabaire aine, yaabaha ebiconco. Bwanyima yaaboohereza akiriho, ngu bataane n'omwana we Isaaka; baatoora oburugwa-izooba, baahika omu nsi y'obwo bukiizi. <verse eid="GEN 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Emyaka ei Abrahamu yaahikize ekaba eri igana na makumi mushanju n'etaano. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Abrahamu ku yaahikire omu ngingo zaabukuru, omwitsyo gwamuhwamu, yaafa gye ari omugurusi w'emyaka mingi, yaakurata baishenkuru. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:13">Kut 50:13</ref>. </char></note> Isaaka na Ishimaeli abatabani baamuziika omu nyanga ya Makipeela omu kibanja kya Efurooni mwene Zohari Omuhiiti, aharikureeba Mamure, <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />ekibanja eki Abrahamu yaaguzire ahari beene Heesi. Aho niho Abrahamu yaaziikirwe hamwe na Saara omukazi we. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Bwanyima y'okufa kwa Abrahamu Ruhanga yaaha Isaaka omwana we omugisha. Isaaka yaatuura Beeri-lahairoi.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Oru nirwo ruzaaro rwa Ishimaeli mwene Abrahamu, ou yaazaire ahari Hagari Omunyamisrikazi, omuzaana wa Saara. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Kandi aga nigo maziina ga beene Ishimaeli, nk'oku baakurataine. Omujigaijo gwa Ishimaeli ni Nebayoosi; haataho Kedari, Adubeeli, Mibusamu, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Mishuma, Duma, Masa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Hadadi, Teema, Yetura, Nafishi na Kedema. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Abo nibo batabani ba Ishimaeli, kandi ago nigo maziina gaabo, omu birorero byabo n'omu maka gaabo abategyeki ikumi na babiri nk'amahanga gaabo oku gaabaire gari. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Emyaka ei Ishimaeli yaahikize ekaba igana na makumi ashatu na mushanju; yaahwamu omwitsyo, yaafa, yaakurata baishenkuru. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Baatura okuruga Havila okuhika Shuuri eri omu maisho ga Misri, nootoora Asiria. Kandi Ishimaeli yaatuura beene ishe boona hangahari.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuzaarwa kwa Esau na Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Oru nirwo ruzaaro rwa Isaaka mwene Abrahamu. Abrahamu akazaara Isaaka; <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Isaaka ku yaahikize emyaka makumi ana, yaashwera Rebeka muhara wa Besueli Omusiria wa Padanaramu, munyaanya wa Labaani Omusiria. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Isaaka yaayeshengyereza MUKAMA ahabw'omukazi we, ahakuba akaba ari engumba; MUKAMA yaahurira okweshengyereza kwe, Rebeka omukazi we yaagira enda. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 9:9">1 Sam 9:9</ref>. </char></note> Abaana baamurwanira omunda; yaagira ati: Ku kiraabe kiri kiti, ngumiireho ki? Yaayehanuuza ahari MUKAMA. <verse eid="GEN 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />MUKAMA yaamugarukamu ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">Enda yaawe erimu amahanga abiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">Enganda ibiri ezi orizaara ziryataanamu habiri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">Oruganda rumwe ruryakiza orundi amaani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">Kakuru aryaheereza Kato.<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Ebiro bye eby'okuzaara ku byahikire, yaashangwa aine enda y'empasha. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Kakuru yaazaarwa naatukura, aine obwoya aha mubiri gwe gwona nk'omwenda gw'ebyoya; baamweta Esau. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 12:3">Hos 12:3</ref>. </char></note> Haakurataho Kato, omukono gwe gukwaitse ekitsintsiino kya Esau; baamweta Yakobo. Obwo Isaaka akaba ahikize emyaka makumi mukaaga, obu omukazi we yaabazaara.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esau okuguza Yakobo obukuru bwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Abo boojo baakura; Esau yaaba omuhiigi w'obwengye ruraaramahamba; Yakobo yaaba omucureezi, yaaguma omuka. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:2">Mat 1:2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 1:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Isaaka akaba naakunda Esau, ahabw'okuba akaba arya aha nyama z'enyamaishwa ezi yaabaire ahiiga; kwonka Rebeka akaba akunda Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Eizooba rimwe Yakobo akaba ateekire ekicumbe; Esau yaija naaruga kuhiiga, naakooza aine enjara. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Esau yaagira Yakobo ati: Mpa ekyo kicumbe ekirikutukura, ndyeho; ahakuba naaza kugwa enshazi. (Eiziina rye nikyo ryayeteirwe <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edomu amakuru ngu, Ekirikutukura. </char></note>Edomu.) <verse eid="GEN 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Yakobo yaamugira ati: Kureka obanze onguze obukuru bwawe. <verse eid="GEN 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Esau yaagira ati: Ndi haihi kwefeera. Eby'obukuru shi biryangasiraki? <verse eid="GEN 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:16">Heb 12:16</ref>. </char></note> Yakobo yaagira ati: Banza ondahire, Esau yaamurahira, yaamuguza obukuru bwe. <verse eid="GEN 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:32">1 Kor 15:32</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yakobo yaaha Esau omugaati n'ekicumbe ky'ebihimba; yaarya, yaanywa, yaimuka, yaayegyendera. Okwo nikwo Esau yaagayire obukuru bwe.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s1">Ebi Isaaka yaareebire omu nsi y'Abafilistia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:10">Kut 12:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo hakateera endiijo njara, etari eyaateire omu biro bya Abrahamu. Isaaka yaaza Gerari owa Abimeleki omugabe w'Abafilistia. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:3">Zab 37:3</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaayeyoreka Isaaka, yaamugira ati: Otashuuma Misri; ogume omu nsi, ei naaza kukugambira, <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />obe niyo waashuhuukiramu; naanye ndyaguma naiwe, nkuhe omugisha; ahabw'okuba iwe n'oruzaaro rwawe ndyabaha ensi ezi zoona, mpamye endahiro, ei naarahiire sho Abrahamu. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Kandi ndyakanyisa oruzaaro rwawe, rube nk'enyonyoozi z'omu iguru, nduhe ezi nsi zoona; kandi omurirwo amahanga goona ag'omu nsi nimwo gariheerwa omugisha; <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />ahabw'okuba Abrahamu akanyorobera, yaahurira ebi naamwehanangiriize, n'ebi naamuragiire, n'ebi naataireho, n'ebiragiro byangye.<verse eid="GEN 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Isaaka yaatuura Gerari; <verse eid="GEN 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />abantu baayo baamubuuza eby'omukazi we, yaabagarukamu ati: Ni munyaanyazi; ahakuba akatiina kugira ati, N'omukazi wangye, yaateekateeka ngu abashaija b'omuri ogwo mwanya nibaija kumwita azire Rebeka, ahakuba akaba ari murungi munonga orikureebwa. <verse eid="GEN 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Bwanyima ku yaamazireyo ebiro bingi, Abimeleki omugabe w'Abafilistia yaayozya amaisho omu dirisa, yaareeba Isaaka naazaana n'omukazi we Rebeka. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Abimeleki yaayeta Isaaka, yaamugira ati: Buzimazima, n'omukazi waawe. Ahanki ogizire oti, Ni munyaanyazi? Isaaka yaamugarukamu ati: Ahakuba nteekateekire ngu niinyija kwitwa ahabwe. <verse eid="GEN 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Abimeleki yaagira ati: Mbwenu shi ekyo, otukozire ki? Obundi kikaarahukire omwe aha bashaija bangye kubyama n'omukazi waawe atakimanyire, haza obwo niiwe waakubaire otureeteire orubanja. <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />N'ahabw'ekyo Abimeleki yaayehanangiriza abantu be boona, naagira ati: Orikora aha mushaija ogu nari aha mukazi we, buzimazima aryaitwa.<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Isaaka yaahinga omu nsi egyo; omu mwaka ogwo yaashaaruura ebirikukira ebi yaabibire emirundi igana; MUKAMA yaamuha omugisha. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Yaaba omushaija omutungi, yaaguma naayeyongyera kutunga, okuhitsya obu yaabaire omutungi rugambwa; <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />yaagira eitungo ringi ry'amasyo g'entaama n'ag'ente, n'eby'omuka bingi; Abafilistia baamugirira eihari (<verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:25-31">Kut 21:25-31</ref>. </char></note>Amaziba goona agaafukwirwe abairu ba ishe Abrahamu akiriho, Abafilistia bakaba baagatabire n'eitaka.) <verse eid="GEN 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Abimeleki yaagira Isaaka ati: Turugyemu, ogyende, ahabw'okuba nootukiza munonga amaani. <verse eid="GEN 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Isaaka yaarugayo, yaagomberera omu ruhita rwa Gerari, yaatuurayo. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Isaaka yaagaruka, yaigura amaziba agaafukwirwe omu biro bya Abrahamu ishe; ahakuba Abafilistia bakaba baagatabire bwanyima y'okufa kwa Abrahamu; yaageeta amaziina agu ishe yaabaire ageetsire. <verse eid="GEN 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Bwanyima abairu ba Isaaka baafukura omu ruhita, baagwa aha iziba ry'enshuro y'amaizi. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Abariisa ba Gerari baarwanisa aba Isaaka, nibagira bati: Amaizi aga n'agaitu. Yaayeta eryo iziba Eseki, ahakuba bakatongana nawe. <verse eid="GEN 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Baagaruka, baafukura erindi iziba, naryo baaritonganira; yaaryeta Sitina. <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Okwo yaarugayo, yaafukura erindi iziba; eryo tibaaritonganira; yaaryeta Rehoboosi; yaagira ati: Ahakuba hati MUKAMA atuhaire ah'okweshanzira, nitwija kukanyira omuri egi nsi. <verse eid="GEN 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Yaarugayo, yainamuka Beeri-sheba.<verse eid="GEN 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kur 3:6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:31">Rom 8:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha kiro ekyo MUKAMA yaamweyoreka, yaagira ati: Ndi Ruhanga wa sho Abrahamu; otatiina, ahabw'okuba ndi hamwe naiwe; ndyakuha omugisha, nkanyise oruzaaro rwawe ahabw'omwiru wangye Abrahamu. <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Kut 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 13:18">13:18</ref>. </char></note> Okwo yaayombekayo eitambiro, yaatakirirayo eiziina rya MUKAMA, yaateerayo eihema rye; okwo nayo abairu be baafukurayo eiziba.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Bwanyima Abimeleki yaaruga Gerari, hamwe na Ahuzaasi munywani we, na Fikooli omukuru w'engabo ze, baamushangayo. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Isaaka yaababuuza ati: Mureetsirwe ki owangye, haza mwanyangire, kandi mukambinga owaanyu? <verse eid="GEN 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Baamugarukamu bati: Tukareeba ku MUKAMA ari naiwe buzima; nikwo kugira tuti: Ka tugire endahiro ahagati yaitu naiwe, kandi turagaane n'endagaano, <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />ku otaritukora kubi, nkaitwe oku tutarakukozireho, kandi nk'oku tutaine kintu kyona eki twakwitsize, kureka okukukorera ebirungi n'okukuraga n'obusingye. Mbwenu ori omuntu ou MUKAMA ahaire omugisha. <verse eid="GEN 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Bwanyima Isaaka yaabateekyera obugyenyi, baarya, baanywa. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Baimuka nibutaagurukana, baarahirana na Isaaka, yaabaraga, baamurugaho n'obusingye. <verse eid="GEN 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Aha izooba eryo abairu ba Isaaka baija, baamugambira eby'eiziba eri bafukwire, nibagira bati: Tufumukire aha maizi. <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Yaaryeta Shiiba; nikyo orwo rurembo rwayeteirwe Beeri-sheba, n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Esau ku yaahikize emyaka makumi ana, yaashwera Yudeesi muhara wa Beeri Omuhiiti, na Basemaasi muhara wa Eloni Omuhiiti; <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:46">Kut 27:46</ref>. </char></note> abo bakazi baagwisa kubi Isaaka na Rebeka.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo okubeiha ishe n'okwiba omugisha gwa mukuru we</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 48:10">Kut 48:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Isaaka ku yaakuzire, n'amaisho ge gaagiirweho oruho, atakibaasa kureeba gye, yaayeta omutabani Kakuru, Esau, yaamugira ati: Mwana wangye! Onu ati: Ndi aha, Taata. <verse eid="GEN 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:14">Yak 4:14</ref>. </char></note> Yaamugira ati: reeba, nkuzire, tindikumanya izooba ri ndifeeraho. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />N'ahabw'ekyo ninkweshengyereza, ihayo ebi ohiigisa, omutana gwawe n'obuta bwawe, oze omu ihamba, onyitireyo enyamaishwa, <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:28">Kut 49:28</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:20">Heb 11:20</ref>. </char></note> onteekyere enyama, ozirungye nk'oku nkunda, ozindeetere, ndye, nkushabire omugisha ntakafiire.<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Isaaka ku yaabaire naagambira omutabani Esau, Rebeka yaashangwa amuhuriire. Atyo Esau yaaza omu ihamba kuhiiga enyamaishwa n'okugireeta. <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Rebeka yaagambira omutabani Yakobo ati: Naahurira sho naagambira mukuru waawe Esau ati: <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />Gyenda onyitire enyamaishwa, onteekyere enyama, ozirungye, ndye, nkushabire omugisha omu maisho ga MUKAMA natakafiire. <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Mbwenu nu, mwana wangye, nyorobera okore eki ndikukuragiira. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Irooko oze omu busyo bw'embuzi, onyihireyo ebyagazi bibiri bito birungi, naanye nteekyere sho enyama, ngirungye nk'oku akunda; <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />haza ogimutwarire, arye, akushabire omugisha atakafiire. <verse eid="GEN 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:25">Kut 25:25</ref>. </char></note> Yakobo yaagambira Rebeka nyina ati: Noomanya Esau mukuru wangye ku ari omushaija w'ebyoya, haza nyowe omubiri gwangye ku gurikuterera. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Obundi taata akaankoraho, anteekateekaho ku ndi engobya, nyihayo omukyeeno omu mwanya gw'omugisha. <verse eid="GEN 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:25">Mat 27:25</ref>. </char></note> Nyina yaamugira ati: Omukyeeno gwawe gube niinye gwazaho, mwana wangye; iwe fa okunyorobera, obindeetere. <verse eid="GEN 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Yakobo yaagyenda, yaabireetera nyina; nawe yaateeka enyama, yaagirunga, nk'oku ishe yaabaire naakunda. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Kandi Rebeka yaihayo ebijwaro birungi by'omutabani Esau kakuru; ebi Rebeka yaabaire aine omu nju, yaabijweka omutabani Yakobo kato; <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />kandi yaata empu z'ebyo byana by'embuzi aha mikono ye, n'aha bitsya bye aharikuterera; <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />bwanyima yaamuha enyama zirungire n'omugaati ogu yaateekateeka.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Yakobo yaija ahari ishe, yaagira ati: Taata! Onu ati: Ndi aha; ori oha, mwana wangye? <verse eid="GEN 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:2">1 Bag 14:2</ref>. </char></note> Yakobo yaagarukamu ishe ati: Niinye Esau kakuru omwana waawe; naakora nk'oku wandagiira; mbwenu imuka oshutame, orye aha nyama ei naakureetera, obone kunshabira omugisha. <verse eid="GEN 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:7">Kur 20:7</ref>. </char></note> Isaaka yaabuuza omwana we ati: Beitu shi, waagirahutsya ota, mwana wangye? Onu ati: Ahakuba MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe yampiira. <verse eid="GEN 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Isaaka yaagira Yakobo ati: Irira aha, mwana wangye, nkukoreho, ndeebe ku oraabe ori omwana wangye Esau buzimazima, nari shi otari we. <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Yakobo yairira haihi Isaaka ishe; Isaaka yaamukoraho, yaagira ati: Eiraka n'erya Yakobo, kwonka emikono n'eya Esau. <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Tiyaamumanya, ahabw'okuba engaro ze zikaba ziine ebyoya, nk'eza mukuru we Esau; yaiha aho, yaamushabira omugisha. <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:25">Efe 4:25</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaruka yaamubuuza ati: Beitu kwo buzima, ori omwana wangye Esau? Yaamugarukamu ati: Ndi we. <verse eid="GEN 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Isaaka yaagira ati: Ginyirize haihi, ndyeho, mwana wangye, nkushabire omugisha. Yaagimwiriza haihi, yaarya, yaamureetera na viinyo, yaanywa. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Isaaka ishe yaamugira ati: Irira haihi, onnywegyere, mwana wangye. <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Yaamwirira haihi, yaamunywegyera. Isaaka yaahurira omugaju gw'ebijwaro bye, yaamushabira omugisha, naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:27">Reeba, okutaamirana kw'omugaju gw'omwana wangye</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:27">Nikushusha nk'okw'eishwa, eri MUKAMA ahaire omugisha.<verse eid="GEN 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 11:20">Heb 11:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 65:9">Zab 65:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Ruhanga akuhe aha rume orurikuruga omu iguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:28">N'aha mweru gw'ensi, n'engano nyingi na viinyo nyingi.<verse eid="GEN 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 24:9">Kub 24:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enganda z'abantu zikuheereze, n'amahanga gakwinamire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Otegyekye beene sho, n'abaana ba nyoko bakwinamire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Weena orikukyeena, akyeenwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Kandi weena orikushabira omugisha, nawe aheebwe omugisha.<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esau okuririra omugisha gwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Bwanyima Isaaka ku yaabaire yaaheza kushabira Yakobo omugisha, Yakobo yaiha ati ebigyere omu maisho ga Isaaka ishe, Esau mukuru we yaija naaruga kuhiiga. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Nawe yaateeka enyama, yaagirunga, yaagitwarira ishe; yaagira ishe ati: Taata, imuka orye aha nyama ei omwana waawe yaakureetera, obone kunshabira omugisha. <verse eid="GEN 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Isaaka ishe yaamubuuza ati: Kandi shi, iwe ori oha? Onu ati: Ndi omwana waawe w'omujigaijo Esau. <verse eid="GEN 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:3">Kut 28:3</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 28:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Isaaka yaatetema munonga, yaagira ati: Owaaruga aha, andeeteire enyama, nkarya ahari byona, nkamushabira omugisha otakaizire, n'oha? Kandi n'omugisha ogwo aryaguheebwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:17">Heb 12:17</ref>. </char></note> Esau ku yaahuriire ebigambo bya ishe, yaarira, yaaborooga munonga n'obusaasi bwingi, yaagira ishe ati: Ai bambe, Taata, naanye nshabira omugisha. <verse eid="GEN 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:6">1 Tes 4:6</ref>. </char></note> Yaagira ati: Murumuna waawe yaija aha n'obugobya, yaatwara omugisha gwawe. <verse eid="GEN 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Esau yaagira ati: <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yakobo amakuru ngu, Okutaaha omu by'ondi; nari okugobeza ondi. </char></note>Yakobo ni Yakobo kwo; eiziina niwe muntu. Eki n'ekya kabiri nangobeza; akanyihaho obukuru bwangye; mbwenu reeba kandi yaanyihaho n'omugisha gwangye. Yaagaruka yaamubuuza ati: Toine kagisha naanye aku wantsigiraho? <verse eid="GEN 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Isaaka yaamugarukamu ati: Reeba, naamuhindura mukama waawe, na beene ishe boona naabamuha kuba abairu be; naamujarika, naamuha engano na viinyo eby'okumutunga; mbwenu shi, ninkikukorera ki, mwana wangye? <verse eid="GEN 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Esau yaabuuza ishe ati: Oine omugisha gumwe gwonka, Taata? Ai bambe Taata, naanye nshabira omugisha. Esau yaaborooga, yaarira. <verse eid="GEN 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:20">Heb 11:20</ref>. </char></note> Isaaka nikwo kumugira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">Oryatuura hare n'omweru gw'ensi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">N'orume orurikuruga omu iguru ahaiguru.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 8:14">2 Sam 8:14</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:20">2 Bag 8:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Rurara yaawe niyo erikubaisaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">Oryaheereza murumuna waawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">Kwonka ku orimwehindurira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">Oryaruga omu butegyeki bwe.<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:41: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="OBA 1:10">Oba 1:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okuruga aho Esau yaayanga Yakobo ahabw'omugisha ogu ishe yaamushabiire; Esau yaagira omu mutima gwe ati: Ebiro by'okucurira taata biri haihi; bwanyima yaabyo ndyaita murumuna wangye Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Baagambira Rebeka ebi Esau omwana we mukuru agambire; yaatuma ow'okweta Yakobo omwana we omuto, yaamugira ati: Omanye mukuru waawe Esau ku amaririire kukwita, kwemara ekiniga. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Mbwenu nu, mwana wangye, hurira eki ndikukugambira; imuka ohungire Harani owa Labaani munyaanyazi, <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />obe oriyo omuri ebi biro, okuhitsya obu ekiniga kya mukuru waawe kiraahwe, <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />n'enziika ye ekakurugaho, akeebwa eki omukozire; obwo ndyakutumaho, ogarukye. Ningasirwa ki, ku ndaabafiise mwembi eizooba rimwe? <verse eid="GEN 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:8">Kut 28:8</ref>. </char></note> Rebeka yaagira Isaaka ati: Amagara gangye garuhire na bahara ba Heesi; Yakobo ku arishwera omwishiki omuri bahara ba Heesi, ori nk'aba ab'omu nsi egi, kiryagasira ki amagara gangye?<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo okuhungira Padanaramu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Isaaka yaayeta Yakobo, yaamushabira omugisha, yaamwehanangiriza ati: Otarishwera omu Bakanaanikazi. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:6">Kut 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:6">2 Kor 5:6</ref>, <ref loc="2CO 5:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:9">Heb 11:9</ref>. </char></note> Imuka oze Padanaramu owa Besueli shwenkuru, oshwereyo omukazi omuri bahara ba Labaani nyokoromi. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Kandi Ruhanga ow'obushoboorozi bwona akuhe omugisha, akuhe okuzaara munonga, akukanyise, obe omutwe muhango gw'amahanga; <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />kandi akuhe omugisha gwa Abrahamu, iwe n'oruzaaro rwawe, obone kuhungura ensi ei waashuhuukiiremu, ei Ruhanga yaahaire Abrahamu. <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Atyo Isaaka yaayohereza Yakobo, yaaza Padanaramu owa Labaani mwene Besueli Omusiria, munyaanya wa Rebeka, nyina wa Yakobo na Esau.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Esau ku yaareebire Isaaka yaashabira Yakobo omugisha, kandi yaamwohereza Padanaramu kushwerayo omukazi; n'omu kumushabira omugisha yaamwehanangiriza ngu atarishwera omukazi omu baishiki ba Kanaani; <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />na Yakobo yaayorobera ishe na nyina, yaaza Padanaramu, <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Esau yaamanyira aho ku abaishiki ba Kanaani batarikugwisa gye Isaaka ishe; <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 36:3">Kut 36:3</ref>. </char></note> Esau nikwo kuza owa Ishimaeli, akashwera Mahalaasi muhara wa Ishimaeli mwene Abrahamu, kandi munyaanya Nebayoosi, akamwongyera aha bakazi abu yaabaire aine.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okweyorekyera Yakobo omu kirooto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Yakobo yaaruga Beeri-sheba, naatoora Harani; <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />yaahika omu mwanya, yaaguraaramu, ahakuba eizooba rikaba ryarengire; yaatwara eibaare rimwe aha mabaare agaabaire gari omu mwanya ogwo, yaaryeshegura, yaabyama, yaagwejegyera. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:1">Kut 41:1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:51">Yoh 1:51</ref>. </char></note> Yaaroota, naareeba amatembero gatsimbire ahansi, omutwe gwago guhikire omu iguru, baamaraika ba Ruhanga nibagatemberaho, kandi nibagatemburukiraho. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:1">Kut 35:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi reeba, MUKAMA akaba ayemereire ahaiguru yaago, naagira ati: Ndi MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Abrahamu shwenkuru, kandi Ruhanga wa Isaaka; ensi egi ei obyamiho ndyagikuha n'oruzaaro rwawe; <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 13:14-16">Kut 13:14-16</ref>. </char></note> n'oruzaaro rwawe ruryaba nk'omucuucu gw'ahansi, rubugye oburengyerwa-izooba, n'oburugwa-izooba, obukiizi-bwa-bumosho n'obwa-buryo; kandi omuriiwe n'omu ruzaaro rwawe enganda zoona ez'omu nsi nimwo ziriheerwa omugisha. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 36:6">Kut 36:6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 23:19">Kub 23:19</ref>. </char></note> Reeba ndi hamwe naiwe, ndyaguma ninkurinda ahu oriza hoona, kandi nkugarure omu nsi egi; ahakuba tindikutsigaho, okuhitsya obu ndiheza kukora ebi naakugambira.<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 3:5">Kut 3:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yakobo yaasisiimuka omu turo, yaagira ati: Buzimazima MUKAMA ari omu mwanya ogu, nyowe naaba ntakimanyire. <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Yaatiina, yaagira ati: Omwanya ogu ka nigutiinisa! Omwanya ogu ti kindi, n'enju ya Ruhanga, kandi n'eirembo ry'eiguru. <verse eid="GEN 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Yakobo yaimuka nibutaagurukana, yaihaho eibaare, eri yaabaire ayeshegwire, yaaribyara kuba enyomyo, yaashuka amajuta aha mutwe gwaryo. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Omwanya ogwo yaagweta Beseeli; kwonka eiziina ry'orurembo rwaho rikaba riri Luuzi obunyakare. <verse eid="GEN 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:3">Kut 31:3</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:8">1 Tim 6:8</ref>. </char></note> Yakobo yaahiga naagira ati: Ruhanga ku ariguma naanye, yandinda omuri oru rugyendo oru ndimu, yaaguma nampa eby'okurya n'eby'okujwara, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 11:31">Bar 11:31</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 5:17">2 Bag 5:17</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima naagaruka owa taata n'obusingye, obwo MUKAMA aryaba Ruhanga wangye; <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lev 27:30</ref>. </char></note> n'eri ibaare eri naabyara nk'enyomyo, eryaba enju ya Ruhanga; kandi ahari byona ebi origuma nompa, tindibura kukuha ekicweka kimwe kya ikumi.<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo okukorera Labaani n'okushwera bahara be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 12:12">Hos 12:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yakobo yaagumizamu orugyendo rwe, yaahika omu nsi y'abantu b'oburugwa-izooba. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Yaimutsya amaisho, yaareeba eiziba omu ishwa, n'amasyo ashatu g'entaama gabyami haihi naryo; ahabw'okuba aha iziba eryo niho baabaire bageeshera; eibaare eryabaire riri aha munwa gw'eiziba rikaba riri rihango munonga. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Amasyo goona ku gaabaire gateeranira aho, abariisa baiha eibaare aha munwa gw'eiziba, beeshera, bwanyima barigaruraho.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Yakobo yaabuuza abariisa ati: Beene waitu, nimuruga hi? Baamugarukamu bati: Nituruga Harani. <verse eid="GEN 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Yaababuuza ati: Nimumanya Labaani mwene Nahori? Banu bati: Nitumumanya. <verse eid="GEN 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Yaababuuza ati: Ariyo agumire? Banu bati: Agumire. Nangwa reeba, na Rakeeli muhara we, nguriya naija n'entaama. <verse eid="GEN 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Yakobo yaagira ati: Reeba, bukiri omu ihangwe, n'obunaku bw'okuzaagiza amasyo tibukahikire; mweshere entaama, mugyende muziriise. <verse eid="GEN 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Baamugira bati: Titurikubaasa, amasyo goona gatakateeraine, bakaiha eibaare aha munwa gw'eiziba, tukabona kweshera entaama.<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:16">Kur 2:16</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 2:17">17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaabaire naakigamba nabo, Rakeeli yaija n'entaama za ishe; ahakuba niwe yaabaire aziriisa. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Yakobo ku yaareebire Rakeeli muhara wa Labaani nyinarumi n'entaama ze, yaahika aha iziba, yaiha eibaare aha munwa gwaryo, yaayeshera entaama za Labaani nyinarumi <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Yakobo yaanywegyera Rakeeli, yaimutsya eiraka, yaarira naaborooga. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Yaayetondera Rakeeli ku aine obuzaare na ishe, kandi ku ari mutabani wa Rebeka. Rakeeli yairuka, yaabigambira ishe. <verse eid="GEN 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:29">Kut 24:29</ref>. </char></note> Labaani ku yaahuriire ebigambo bya Yakobo omwihwa, yairuka kumubugana, yaamubumbatira, yaamunywegyera, yaamutaasya omu ka ye. Yakobo yaagambira Labaani ebyabaireho byona. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Labaani yaamugira ati: <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:14: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu Ruheburaayo, ori eigufa ryangye kandi omubiri gwangye </char></note>Buzimazima ori owangye ow'aha mara. Yaaguma nawe okumara okwezi kwona.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Bwanyima Labaani yaamubuuza ati: Beitu shi, oshemereire kunkorerera busha, ngu ahakuba twine obuzaare? Okaayenzire ku nkuha bihembo ki? <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Kandi Labaani akaba aine abaishiki babiri; eiziina ry'omukuru akaba ari Lea, kandi ery'omuto ari Rakeeli. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Lea akaba ataine maisho garikwera; kwonka Rakeeli akaba ari murungi munonga w'okurigirwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:41">Kut 31:41</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo Yakobo akakunda Rakeeli. Yakobo nikwo kugarukamu Labaani ati: Niinyija kukukorera emyaka mushanju, ompingire Rakeeli muhara waawe omuto. <verse eid="GEN 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Labaani yaamugarukamu ati: Ni kirungi okumukuha okukira okumuha ondiijo muntu weena. Guma naanye. <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="SNG 8:7">Kyesh 8:7</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Yakobo yaakora emyaka mushanju ahabwa Rakeeli; kandi egyo myaka yaamubeera nk'ebiro bikye, ahabw'okukunda oku yaabaire naamukunda.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Bwanyima Yakobo yaagira Labaani ati: Mpingira omukazi wangye, mmushwere, ahabw'okuba mpikize ebiro byangye. <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 14:10">Bar 14:10</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 14:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Labaani yaateeka obugyenyi, yaayeta abantu boona ab'omuri ogwo mwanya. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Omu mwabazyo yaareeta muhara we Lea, yaamuhingira Yakobo, yaamushwera. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Kandi Labaani yaaha muhara we Lea omuzaana we Zilupa kuba omuzaana we. <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Omu kasheeshe Yakobo yashanga ari Lea; yaayetomboitera Labaani, naagira ati: Beitu shi, ongizire ota? Tindakukoreire ahabwa Rakeeli? Mbwenu ongobereize ki? <verse eid="GEN 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Labaani yaagira ati: Owaitu tikwo tugira, okuhingira omuto omukuru atakashweirwe. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Banza omare saabiiti n'ogwo, haza tukuhingire n'ogu, ogarukye onkorere endiijo myaka mushanju. <verse eid="GEN 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Yakobo yaakora atyo; yaamara saabiiti na Lea; bwanyima Labaani yaamuhingira Rakeeli muhara we. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Kandi Labaani yaaha Rakeeli omuzaana we Biliha kuba omuzaana we. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:41">Kut 31:41</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Yakobo yaashwera Rakeeli; kandi yaamukunda munonga okukira Lea; yaagaruka yaakorera Labaani endiijo myaka mushanju.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 30:1">Kut 30:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA ku yaareebire Lea yaaba enyangwakazi, yaigura enda ye; kwonka Rakeeli we yaaba engumba. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Lea yaagira enda, yaazaara omwana w'omwojo; yaamweta Reubeeni; ahakuba akagira ati: MUKAMA areebire okwitwa kubi kwangye; mbwenu ibanye naija kunkunda. <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Yaagaruka yaagira enda, yaazaara ondiijo mwojo; yaagira ati: MUKAMA ahuriire ku ndikwangwa, nikyo yampeera n'ogu; yaamweta Simeoni. <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Yaagaruka yaagira enda, yaazaara omwojo; yaagira ati: Aha murundi ogu ibanye naija kukwatanisa naanye, ahakuba mmuzaariire aboojo bashatu; n'ahabw'ekyo yaamweta Leevi. <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Yaagaruka yaagira enda, yaazaara omwojo; yaagira ati: Omurundi ogu naaza kuhimbisa MUKAMA; nikyo yaamweteire Yuda; bwanyima oruzaaro rwayemerera.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="s1">Abandi baana ba Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:11">Kut 37:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Rakeeli ku yaareebire atazaariire Yakobo baana yaagirira mukuru we eihari; yaagambira Yakobo ati: Mpa abaana; ku oraabe otabampaire, ninfa. <verse eid="GEN 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 1:5">1 Sam 1:5</ref>. </char></note> Yakobo yaagirira Rakeeli ekiniga, yaagira ati: Niinye waata omu mwanya gwa Ruhanga owaakwimire oruzaaro? <verse eid="GEN 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Yaamugarukamu ati: Reeba omuzaana wangye Biliha, omushwere, abone kuzaarira aha maju gangye, naanye mmubonereho abaana. <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:22">Kut 35:22</ref>. </char></note> Yaamuha Biliha omuzaana we; Yakobo yaamushwera. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Biliha yaagira enda, yaazaarira Yakobo omwana w'omwojo. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Rakeeli yaagira ati: Ruhanga ancwereire orubanja, kandi yaahurira okushaba kwangye, yampa omwana w'omwojo. Nikyo yaamweteire Daani. <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Biliha omuzaana wa Rakeeli yaagaruka yaagira enda, yaazaarira Yakobo omwojo wa kabiri. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Rakeeli yaagira ati: Nfukaine munonga na mukuru wangye, naamwikarira. Nikyo yaamweteire Nafutaali. <verse eid="GEN 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Lea ku yaareebire atagaruka kuzaara, yaatwara Zilupa omuzaana we, yaamuha Yakobo kuba omukazi we. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Zilupa omuzaana wa Lea yaazaarira Yakobo omwana w'omwojo. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Lea yaagira ati: Eshi naahiirwa! Yaamweta Gaadi. <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Zilupa omuzaana wa Lea yaazaarira Yakobo omwojo wa kabiri; <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 31:28">Enf 31:28</ref>. </char></note> Lea yaagira ati: Eshi nyine omugisha! Ahakuba abakazi baryanyeta Ohiiriirwe; yaamweta Asheri.<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 25:30">Kut 25:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu igyesha ry'engano Reubeeni yaaza omu ishwa, yaagwa aha madudaimu, yaagareetera Lea nyina. Rakeeli yaashaba Lea ati: Ninkweshengyereza, mpa aha madudaimu ga mutabani waawe. <verse eid="GEN 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Lea yaamugarukamu ati: Iwe okyetsire ekigambo kikye okuncwa aha mushaija wangye; mbwenu nooyenda kutwara n'amadudaimu g'omwana wangye? Rakeeli yaagira ati: Mbwenu ku orampe amadudaimu g'omwana waawe, baro naija kukuraarira. <verse eid="GEN 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Omu mwabazyo Yakobo ku yaabaire naaruga omu ishwa naataaha, Lea yaashohora kumubugana, yaamugira ati: Oshemereire kundaarira, ahabw'okuba naaha amadudaimu g'omwana wangye ahabwawe. Yakobo nikwo kumuraarira ekyo kiro. <verse eid="GEN 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Ruhanga yaahurira okushaba kwa Lea, yaagira enda, yaazaarira Yakobo omwojo wa kataano. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Lea yaagira ati: Ruhanga yampa ebihembo, ahakuba nkaha ibanye omuzaana wangye; ogwo mwana yaamweta Isakaari. <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Lea yaagaruka yaagira enda, yaazaarira Yakobo omwojo wa mukaaga. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Lea yaagira ati: Ruhanga yampa ekiconco kirungi eky'obugore; mbwenu ibanye naija kuguma naanye, ahakuba mmuzaariire aboojo mukaaga; omwana yaamweta Zebuluuni. <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Bwanyima yaazaara omwishiki, yaamweta Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 1:19">1 Sam 1:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga yaijuka Rakeeli, yaahurira okushaba kwe, yaigura enda ye. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:25">Luk 1:25</ref>. </char></note> Yaagira enda, yaazaara omwana w'omwojo, yaagira ati: Ruhanga yaanyihaho ekihemu; <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />yaamweta Yosefu, naagira ati: MUKAMA anyongyere akandi koojo.<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo okushaba kugaruka owaabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Rakeeli ku yaaherize kuzaara Yosefu, Yakobo yaagira Labaani ati: Ndaga, ngarukye omuka omu nsi y'owaitu. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Ompe abakazi bangye n'abaana bangye, abu naakukorereire, ngyende; ahakuba noomanya omurimo ogu naakukoreire. <verse eid="GEN 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 39:3">Kut 39:3</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 39:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:9">Isa 61:9</ref>. </char></note> Labaani yaamugarukamu ati: Ku oraabe nongirira embabazi, ogume aha; ahakuba nyetegyereize ku MUKAMA ampaire omugisha ahabwawe. <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:15">Kut 29:15</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaruka yaagira ati: Oncwere ebihembo ebi orikwenda, niinyija kubikuha. <verse eid="GEN 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:6">Kut 31:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:45">Mat 24:45</ref>. </char></note> Yakobo yaamugarukamu ati: Noomanya oku naakukoreire, n'oku amatungo gaawe gaabaire, obu naabaire ninkigariisa. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Ahakuba agu waabaire oine ntakaizire, gakaba gari makye; mbwenu gakanyire, gaaba maingi munonga; kandi MUKAMA akakuha omugisha, ahu naabaire nza hoona. Mbwenu nyowe ndyatunga ryari eby'okukwatsa eka yangye? <verse eid="GEN 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Onu ati: Mbwenu nkuhe ki? Yakobo yaagarukamu ati: Toine ki orampe; kureka ku oraabe noikiriza kunkorera eki, niinyija kugumizamu kuriisa amasyo gaawe n'okugarinda. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Onyikirize ndabe omu busyo bwawe bwona eri izooba, nyihemu entaama zoona ez'ebigabo n'ez'amayenje, n'abaana baazo abarikwiragura, n'embuzi z'obugondo n'ez'ebitanga; ezirikushusha zityo nizo ziriba ebihembo byangye. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:6">Zab 37:6</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima ku oraije kureeba ebihembo byangye, amazima gangye nigaija kweyoreka; embuzi yoona ei oraashangye etari y'ebitanga nari ey'obugondo, n'entaama yoona etari erikwiragura, biri n'enyibano. <verse eid="GEN 30:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Labaani yaagira ati: Ni kirungi; ka kibe nk'oku waagamba. <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Eryo izooba Labaani yaashorooramu empaya z'embuzi ez'ebihuuga n'ez'obugondo n'ebuguma zoona ez'ebitanga n'ez'obugondo n'eine ekigabo yoona, n'entaama ezirikwiragura zoona, yaaziha abatabani; <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />yaatsiga ahagati ye na Yakobo omwanya gw'orugyendo rw'ebiro bishatu. Yakobo yaariisa amasyo ga Labaani agaatsigaraho.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Yakobo yaatwara enkoni z'emilebeni mibisi, n'ez'emiluzi, n'ez'arumoni, yaazicwamu amabara agarikwera maraingwa, gaareebeka. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Yaazita omu mikura erikutwara amaizi omu bwato, ahu amasyo ganywera; <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />ku gaabaire gaija kunywa, ezirikwenda kwema zaayema nizireeba ezo nkoni, zizaara ez'ebihuuga n'ez'ebigabo n'ez'amayenje. <verse eid="GEN 30:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Yakobo yaashoroora abo baana b'entaama, kandi amasyo yaagareebesa ez'ebihuuga n'ezirikwiragura zoona eziri omu busyo bwa Labaani; bwanyima eze yaazita aha kwazo, yaareka kuziteerana n'obusyo bwa Labaani. <verse eid="GEN 30:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Enungi ku zaabaire ziba nizeema, Yakobo ata enkoni omu mikura omu maisho gaazo, ngu zeemere ahagati y'ezo nkoni; <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />kwonka ku zaabaire ziba ziri mbi, areka kutaho enkoni; n'ahabw'ekyo embi ziri eza Labaani, enungi ziba eza Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Okwo nikwo ogwo mushaija yaayeyongyeire kutunga munonga, n'okugira amasyo maingi, abazaana n'abahuuku, engamira n'endogoya.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo okutaana na Labaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 31:31">Yob 31:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yakobo yaahurira batabani ba Labaani nibagira bati: Yakobo atwaire byona ebyabaire biri ebya tataitwe, kandi nimwo aihire eitungo eri ryona. <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:54">Bir 28:54</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaareeba Labaani atakimureeba gye nk'okubanza. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:15">Kut 28:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 32:9">32:9</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagambira Yakobo ati: Garuka omu nsi ya baashwenkuru n'omuri beene waanyu; kandi ndyaguma hamwe naiwe. <verse eid="GEN 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Yakobo yaatuma ahari Rakeeli na Lea kumushanga omu ishwa, ei amasyo ge gaabaire gari, <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:10">Isa 41:10</ref>. </char></note> yaabagira ati: Ndeebire shoimwe atakindeeba gye nk'okubanza; kwonka Ruhanga wa taata akaguma naanye. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Naimwe nimumanya ku naakoreire shoimwe n'amaani gangye goona. <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />Kandi shoimwe atuura nangobeza, ahindwire ebihembo byangye emirundi ikumi; kwonka Ruhanga taramwikiriize kunkora kubi. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Ku yaabaire angira ati: Ez'obugondo nizo ziriba ebihembo byawe, obusyo bwona buzaara ez'obugondo; akigira ati; Ez'ebihuuga nizo ziriba ebihembo byawe, obusyo bwona buzaara ez'ebihuuga. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:16">Kut 31:16</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo Ruhanga yaayakire shoimwe amatungo, akagampa. <verse eid="GEN 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />Omu bunaku bu amasyo gaabaire geemeramu, nkanaga amaisho nindoota, naareeba empaya z'embuzi ezaabaire nizeemya obusyo ziri ez'ebihuuga, n'ez'obugondo, n'ez'ebihuura. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Maraika wa Ruhanga yangambirira omuri ekyo kirooto ati: Yakobo! Naagarukamu nti: Mukama wangye. <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:7">Kur 3:7</ref>. </char></note> Yangira ati: Imutsya amaisho gaawe, oreebe empaya z'embuzi zoona ezirikwemya obusyo ku ziri ez'ebihuuga n'ez'obugondo n'ez'ebihuura; ahakuba ndeebire ebi Labaani arikukwitsa. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18">Kut 28:18</ref>. </char></note> Niinye Ruhanga wa Beseeli, ei waashukiire amajuta aha ibaare, kandi ei waahigiire nondahira; mbwenu imuka orugye omu nsi egi, ogarukye omu nsi ei waazaariirwemu. <verse eid="GEN 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Rakeeli na Lea baamugarukamu bati: Noogira ngu tukiine omugabo nari obuhunguzi owa tataitwe? <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Tarikutubara nk'abanyamahanga? Ahakuba akatutunda, kandi yaamariraho kimwe empiiha zaitu. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Eitungo ryona eri Ruhanga yaayakire tataitwe, n'eryaitu n'abaana baitu. N'ahabw'ekyo eki Ruhanga akugambiire kyona, okikore.<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Atyo Yakobo yaimuka, yaata abatabani n'abakazi be aha ngamira, <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />yaatwara amatungo ge goona n'ebintu byona ebi yaayetungiire, nigo matungo agu yaihire omuri Padanaramu, okuza owa Isaaka ishe omu nsi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:2">Kut 35:2</ref>. </char></note> Omuri ebyo biro Labaani akaba agiire kushara ebyoya by'entaama ze; Rakeeli yaiba ebishushani by'emandwa za ishe. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Yakobo yaayeiba ahari Labaani Omusiria, ahakuba taramugambiire ku arikwenda kuhunga. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Atyo yaacwa n'ebi yaabaire aine byona; yaimuka, yaayambuka omugyera Furaati, yaatoora omuhanda ogurikuza omu nsi y'ebibungo bya Gileadi, <verse eid="GEN 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Aha kiro kya kashatu baagambira Labaani ku Yakobo acwire. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Labaani nikwo kutwara beene ishe akamukurata; bwanyima y'ebiro mushanju akamushanga omu nsi y'ebibungo bya Gileadi. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 1:20">Mat 1:20</ref>. </char></note> Nyekiro Ruhanga yaizira Labaani Omusiria omu kirooto, yaamugira ati: Oyerinde, otagambira Yakobo ekigambo kyona, ekirungi nari ekibi.<verse eid="GEN 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Labaani okutongana na Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Labaani yaahika Yakobo, yaashanga ateire eihema rye omu nsi y'ebibungo bya Gileadi; Labaani na beene ishe nabo baateerayo amahema gaabo. <verse eid="GEN 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Labaani yaagambira Yakobo ati: Eki okozire ki okunyeibaho, okatwara bahara bangye nk'abu banyagire na rurara? <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Ohungiire ki ntakimanyire, okanyeibaho, otangambiire nkabona kukuraga tushemereirwe, nitweshongora n'ebitaasa n'enanga? <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Kandi ahabw'enki otaanyikiriize kunywegyera baijukuru bangye na bahara bangye nimbaraga? Eki okozire n'eky'obushema. <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 5:11">Zab 5:11</ref>. </char></note> Naaba nimbaasa kukukora kubi; kwonka Ruhanga wa sho araire angambiire ati: Oyerinde, otagambira Yakobo ekigambo kyona ekirungi nari ekibi. <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 18:24">Bar 18:24</ref>. </char></note> Nimmanya ku ogyenzire ahabw'okugirira eka ya sho orushusho; beitu shi oibiire ki emandwa zangye? <verse eid="GEN 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Yakobo yaagarukamu Labaani ati: Ahakuba nkatiina, naagira ngu noija kuunyaka bahara baawe n'empaka. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 44:9">Kut 44:9</ref>. </char></note> Kandi weena ou oraashangye aine emandwa zaawe, atakira. Tukiri aha omu maisho ga beene waitu, caaka, ekyawe eki oraashangye nyine okitware. Kwonka Yakobo akaba atarikumanya ku Rakeeli aziibire. <verse eid="GEN 31:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Labaani yaataaha omu ihema rya Yakobo n'erya Lea n'omu ihema ry'abazaana bombi; kwonka tiyaazishangamu. Yaaruga omu ihema rya Lea, yaataaha omu rya Rakeeli. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Rakeeli ogwo akaba yaazitwaire, yaazitaire omu matandiiko g'engamira, azishutamiire, Labaani yaacaaka eihema ryona, tiyaazibona. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Rakeeli yaagambira ishe ati: Mukama wangye, kitakugwisa kubi ahabw'okutakwimukira, ahakuba ndi omu kwezi. Labaani yaacaaka, kwonka tiyaazibona.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Yakobo yaagira ekiniga, yaatonganisa Labaani, naagira ati: Nshobize ki? Nkozire kibi ki ekikureeteire okunkurata otyo n'ekiniga? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Mbwenu ku waacaaka omu bintu byangye byona, aha bintu by'omu nju yaawe byona waashangamu ki? Kite aha omu maisho ga beene waitu na beene waanyu, batucwere orubanja. <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Mmazire naiwe emyaka makumi abiri; omuri egyo myaka entaama zaawe n'embuzi zaawe tizikatoroogaga, kandi tinkaryaga mpaya z'omu masyo gaawe. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Kur 20:10</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 20:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Ezaabaire ziitwa enyamaishwa, nkaba ntazikureetera, niinye zaabaire zifeera; kandi eyaabaire eibwa nyomushana nari nyekiro okaba ogindihisa. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Okwo nikwo naabaire nfa kubi; nyomushana nyitwa omushana, na nyekiro nyitwa embeho; ngurukwa oturo. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Mmazire egi myaka makumi abiri omu ka yaawe; ikumi n'ena nkagikukorera ahabwa bahara baawe bombi, n'omukaaga ahabw'obusyo bwawe; kandi ebihembo byangye okabihindura emirundi ikumi. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 124:1">Zab 124:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:13">Isa 8:13</ref>. </char></note> Kuri Ruhanga wa taata, Ruhanga wa Abrahamu, ou Isaaka yaabaire atiina, atarabaire hamwe naanye, buzimazima okaanyohereize ntaine kantu. Ruhanga areebire okubonabona n'okufa kubi kwangye ninkora, yaakuteisa eki kiro.<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Labaani yaagarukamu Yakobo ati: Abaishiki aba ni bahara bangye, n'abaana aba n'abaana bangye, kandi n'amasyo aga n'amasyo gangye, n'ebi byona ebi orikureeba n'ebyangye. Mbwenu eri izooba ngire nta aba baishiki bangye n'abaana baabo abu baazaire? <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:28">Kut 26:28</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:27">Yos 24:27</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ija tukore endagaano, nyowe naiwe; ebe omujurizi ahagati yangye naiwe. <verse eid="GEN 31:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18">Kut 28:18</ref>. </char></note> Yakobo yaatwara eibaare, yaaribyara kuba enyomyo. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Yaagambira beene ishe ati: Mutorotoore amabaare. Ku baagatorotoire, baagarunda hamwe; baariira aha rubaju rw'ekirundo kyago. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Labaani yaayeta ogwo mwanya Yegari-sahadusa; kwonka Yakobo yaagweta Galeedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Labaani yaagira ati: Eri izooba ekirundo eki kyaba omujurizi ahagati yangye naiwe. Nikyo kyayeteirwe Galeedi; <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />kandi na Mizipa; ahakuba akagira ati; MUKAMA agumye eriisho ahagati yangye naiwe, ku turiba twataine. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Ku oriita kubi abaishiki bangye, nari waabashwereraho abandi bakazi, n'obu hariba hataine oriho, omanye ngu Ruhanga niwe kareebi wangye naiwe. <verse eid="GEN 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Kandi yaagira Yakobo ati: Omanye eki kirundo, n'egi nyomyo, ebi naata ahagati yangye naiwe. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Ekirundo eki n'eky'okuhamya, n'enyomyo egi n'ey'okuhamya, ku ntariraba aha kirundo eki kukukora kubi, kandi naiwe ku otarikirabaho nari egi nyomyo kunkora kubi. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:23">Kut 21:23</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga wa Abrahamu, Ruhanga wa Nahori, Ruhanga wa ishebo, atucwere orubanja. Yakobo yaarahira Ou Isaaka ishe yaabaire atiina. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Bwanyima Yakobo yaatambira ekitambo aha kibungo, yaayeta beene ishe kurya eby'okurya; baarya, baaraara aho, bwarugaho bwasheesha. <verse eid="GEN 31:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Ku bwabaire nibutaagurukana, Labaani yaimuka, yaanywegyera abaijukuru na bahara be, yaabashabira omugisha. Yaagyenda, yaagaruka owaabo.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo okubugana Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 91:11">Zab 91:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yakobo yaagumizamu yaagyenda, baamaraika ba Ruhanga baamubugana. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:16">2 Bag 6:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:13">Luk 2:13</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaabareebire, yaagira ati: Aba n'eihe rya Ruhanga. Omwanya ogwo yaagweta Mahanaimu. <verse eid="GEN 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:5">Bir 2:5</ref>. </char></note> Yaatuma entumwa kumubandiza ahari Esau mukuru we omu nsi ya Seiri, niyo nsi ya Edomu, <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 15:1">Enf 15:1</ref>. </char></note> yaabaragiira ati: Mugambire mukama wangye Esau muti: Oku nikwo omwiru waawe Yakobo arikugamba, naagira ati: Nkashuhuukira owa Labaani naagumayo n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Nyine ente n'endogoya n'amasyo g'entaama n'abahuuku n'abazaana. Mbwenu ntumire ahariiwe, mukama wangye, kukugambira, ngu okaangirira embabazi. <verse eid="GEN 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Entumwa zaagaruka ahari Yakobo, zaagira ziti: Esau mukuru waawe tumuhikireho; kandi naija n'abashaija magana ana kukubugana. <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />N'ahabw'ekyo Yakobo yaatiina munonga, yaashoberwa. Abantu abu yaabaire aine n'amasyo g'entaama n'ag'ente n'engamira, yaabicwamu ebicweka bibiri; <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />yaagira ati: Esau ku araahikye aha kicweka kimwe, yaakicwekyereza, ekindi kicweka nikiija kukira. <verse eid="GEN 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:15">Zab 50:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 31:3">Kut 31:3</ref>. </char></note> Yakobo yaashaba ati: Ai Ruhanga wa tatenkuru Abrahamu, Ruhanga wa taata Isaaka, MUKAMA owangizire oti: Garuka owaanyu omuri beene waanyu, ndyakukorera gye. <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:43">Kut 27:43</ref>. </char></note> Aha mbabazi zaawe zoona n'obwesigwa bwawe bwona ebi waayorekire omwiru waawe, tinshemereire kuheebwaho nangwa n'akati kaingana busha; ahakuba nkambuka Yorudani egi n'enkoni yonka; mbwenu ndugiremu emitwe ebiri. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Ninkweshengyereza, onkize mukuru wangye Esau; ahakuba nimmutiina, ngu atakaija akanyita n'abaana bangye na baanyinabo. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:13-15">Kut 28:13-15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi naiwe okandaganisa oti: Buzimazima ndyakukorera gye, mpindure oruzaaro rwawe rube nk'omusheenyi gw'aha nyanja, ogutarikubaasa kubarwa. <verse eid="GEN 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:11">Kut 43:11</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo kiro yaaraara aho; yaiha omu bi yaabaire aine ekiconco ky'okuha Esau mukuru we, <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />ebuguma z'embuzi magana abiri, n'empaya makumi abiri, ebuguma z'entaama magana abiri n'empaya makumi abiri, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />engamira ezirikukamwa makumi ashatu n'enyana zaazo, ente z'ejigija makumi ana n'enimi ikumi, n'ebuguma z'endogoya makumi abiri n'abaana baazo ikumi. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Yaaziha abairu be, buri busyo okwabwo, yaabagira ati: Munyebembere, mwambukye, mutsigye omwanya ahagati y'obusyo n'obundi. <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Yaaragiira omwebembezi ati: Mukuru wangye Esau ku araakubugane, yaakubuuza ati: Ori ow'oha? Kandi, Nimuza hi? Kandi amatungo aga n'ag'oha? <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />Omugire oti: N'ag'omwiru waawe Yakobo, mukama wangye Esau; n'ekiconco eki waatwekyerwa; kandi nawe atukuratiire. <verse eid="GEN 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Kandi yaaragiira atyo owa kabiri n'owa kashatu, n'abaabaire nibafunya amasyo boona, naabagira ati: Mube nikwo mwagira Esau, ku muraamubugane; <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 21:14">Enf 21:14</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 12:7">2 Kor 12:7</ref>. </char></note> kandi mumugire muti: Reeba, n'omwiru waawe Yakobo atukuratiire. Ahakuba Yakobo akagira ati: Naaza kumucureeza n'ekiconco ekinyebembeire, bwanyima tureebane; shana akaanyikiriza. <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Ekiconco nikwo kumwebembera, kikambuka; kwonka we akaraara aho ahu baagombekire ekyo kiro.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo okufukaana na maraika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Ekyo kiro yaimuka, yaatwara abakazi be bombi n'abazaana be n'abaana be ikumi n'omwe, baayambukira aha nyambukiro ya Yaboki. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Yaabambutsya ako kagyera n'ebi yaabaire aine byona. <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Yakobo yaatsigarayo wenka; omushaija yaija, yaafukaana nawe bwarugaho bwatagurukana. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Omushaija ogwo ku yaareebire yaamurema, yaamukora aha igufa ry'eitako eitako rya Yakobo ryateruka nibakifukaana. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:28">Luk 24:28</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 12:4">Hos 12:4</ref>. </char></note> Omushaija yaamugira ati: Ndekura, ahakuba nibutaagurukana. Yakobo yaamugira ati: Tindikwija kukurekura otampaire mugisha. <verse eid="GEN 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Onu ati: Eiziina ryawe ori oha? Ati: Ndi Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Onu ati: Okuruga hati torigaruka kwetwa Yakobo kureka Israeli; ahakuba ohakaine na Ruhanga n'abantu, waasinga. <verse eid="GEN 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 13:18">Bar 13:18</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yakobo yaamugira ati: Ninkweshengyereza, ngambira eiziina ryawe. Onu ati: Nooyendera ki kumanya eiziina ryangye? Atyo yaamuheera aho omugisha. <verse eid="GEN 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:20">Kur 33:20</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 6:22">Bar 6:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:5">Isa 6:5</ref>. </char></note> Yakobo yaayeta ogwo mwanya Penueli, naagira ati: Nyereebaniire na Ruhanga amaisho n'amaisho, tinaafa. <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Eizooba ryarasha naarengyera Penueli, naagyenda omunyugu aha bw'eigufa ry'eitako. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Abaisraeli nikyo bazirira enyama y'aha mutsi gw'eitako ry'ekibero n'okuhitsya hati; ahabw'okuba ogwo mushaija akakora aha mutsi gw'eitako ry'ekibero kya Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo okugarukana na Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Yakobo yaimutsya amaisho, yaareeba Esau naija n'abashaija be magana ana; yaabaganisa abaana, yaaha Lea abe, na Rakeeli abe, n'abazaanakazi bombi abaabo. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Yaayebembeza abazaanakazi n'abaana baabo, yaakuratsaho Lea n'abaana be, haahereeruka Rakeeli na Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Yakobo yaabeebembera, yainama ahansi emirundi mushanju, okuhitsya obu yaahikire haihi na mukuru we. <verse eid="GEN 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 21:1">Enf 21:1</ref>. </char></note> Esau yairuka kumubugana, yaamubumbatira, yaamugwa omu kifuba, yaamunywegyera; bombi baarira. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Esau ku yaimukize amaisho, yaareeba abakazi n'abaana, yaagira ati: Aba abu oine nibaahi? Yakobo yaagarukamu ati: N'abaana abu Ruhanga yaahaire omwiru waawe ahabw'embabazi ze. <verse eid="GEN 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Abazaanakazi n'abaana baabo bairira haihi, bainama. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Lea nawe yaija n'abaana be, bainama; bwanyima Yosefu na Rakeeli nabo baija, bainama. <verse eid="GEN 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Esau yaabuuza ati: Ebintu byona ebi mbugaine bibaire biri ebya ki? Onu ati: N'ebi ntwekyeire mukama wangye, ngu angirire embabazi. <verse eid="GEN 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Esau yaagira ati: Ebi nyine nibimmara, mwana wa maawe; ebyo ebi oine yegumire nabyo. <verse eid="GEN 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Yakobo yaamugira ati: Ngaaha! Naakweshengyereza, ku oraabe wangirira embabazi, ikiriza ekiconco eki nkureeteire; ahabw'okuba ku naareeba amaisho gaawe, naashusha nk'owaareeba amaisho ga Ruhanga, kandi wanshemerererwa. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:27">1 Sam 25:27</ref>. </char></note> Naakweshengyereza, yakiira ekiconco eki nkureeteire, ahakuba Ruhanga ankoreire eby'embabazi, kandi ebi nyine, nibimaara. Yaamweshengyereza munonga; yaakitwara.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Bwanyima Esau yaagira ati: Ka tugumizemu tugyende, nyowe mbeebembere. <verse eid="GEN 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Yakobo yaamugarukamu ati: Mukama wangye, noomanya abaana ku bataine maani, kandi amasyo g'entaama n'ag'ente agu nyine nigontsya; ku baraagabindirane eizooba rimwe, goona nigafa. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Ninkweshengyereza, mukama wangye, orabe aha mwiru waawe, ogyende, nyowe niinyija kwija mpora, nk'oku amasyo agu nyine garikugyenda, kandi n'abaana oku barikugyenda, okuhitsya ahu ndaahikire Seiri owa mukama wangye.<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Esau yaagira ati: Ka nkutsigire abashaija bamwe ahari aba abu nyine. Onu ati: Mbwenu n'ab'enki? Nsaasira, mukama wangye, obarekye. <verse eid="GEN 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Atyo Esau yaagyenda eryo eizooba naagaruka Seiri. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Kwonka Yakobo yaagyenda naaza Sukoosi; ku yaahikireyo, yaayeyombekyera enju, kandi yaayombekyerayo amasyo ge ebiju. Omwanya ogwo nikyo gwayeteirwe Sukoosi. <verse eid="GEN 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Yakobo ku yaarugire Padanaramu, yaahika n'obusingye aha rurembo rwe Shekemu omu nsi ya Kanaani, yaasiisira omu maisho gaayo. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:32">Yos 24:32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:5">Yoh 4:5</ref>. </char></note> Yaagura ekibanja ahari beene Hamori ishe wa Shekemu ebicweka by'efeeza igana, ahu yaateire eihema rye. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Yaayombekayo eitambiro, yaaryeta Elelohe-Israeli.<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okwita aba Shekemu ahabwa Dina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="TIT 2:5">Tit 2:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo Dina, muhara wa Lea, ou yaazaariire Yakobo, akaza kutaayaayira abaishiki b'omu nsi egyo. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Shekemu, mwene Hamori Omuhiivi omutegyeki w'ensi egyo, ku yaamureebire, yaamutwara, yaamuhamba, yaamushiisha. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Ogwo mushaija yaamarira omutima gwe ahari Dina muhara wa Yakobo, yaamukunda, yaamugambira eby'okumugwisa gye. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 14:2">Bar 14:2</ref>. </char></note> Shekemu yaagambira Hamori ishe, ati: Nshwererera ogu mwishiki. <verse eid="GEN 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Yakobo yaahurira ku Shekemu asiisire Dina muhara we; obwo abatabani bakaba bariisize; Yakobo yaahunama, okuhitsya ahu baiziire. <verse eid="GEN 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Hamori ishe wa Shekemu yaaruga omu rurembo, yaaza kuhanuura na Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 13:12">2 Sam 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 7:15">Yos 7:15</ref>. </char></note> Beene Yakobo, ku baakihuriire, baaruga omu iriisizo, baataaha. Baashaasha, kandi baagira ekiniga kingi, ahabw'okuba akakora ekihagaro omu ba Israeli okubyama na muhara wa Yakobo, ekintu ekitashemereire kukorwa.<verse eid="GEN 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Hamori yaahanuura nabo, ati: Omutima gwa mutabani wangye gukunzire muhara waanyu; naabeeshengyereza mumumuhe amushwere. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">34:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:32">Kur 23:32</ref>. </char></note> Mushwererane naitwe, mutuhingire bahara baanyu, naimwe mushwere abaitu. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Haza mutuure naitwe; ensi ngigi ebari omu maisho, mugituuremu, mugikoreremu eby'obushuubuzi, kandi mugitungiremu. <verse eid="GEN 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Na Shekemu yaagambira ishe w'omwishiki na banyaanya ati: Mungirire embabazi; eki murancwe kyona, ninkibaha. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Enjugano n'ekiconco ebi murancwe, n'obu byakwingana ki, niinyija kubiha, nk'oku muraabincwe; beitu mumpingire ogu mwishiki. <verse eid="GEN 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Beene Yakobo baagarukamu Shekemu na Hamori ishe nibabaryarya, ahabw'okushiisha Dina munyaanyabo; <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />baabagira bati: Eki titurikubaasa kukikora, okuhingira munyaanyaitwe omuntu otashazirwe; ahakuba omuriitwe kikaaba ekihemu. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Hariho kimwe kyonka ekyakutureetera kubaikiriza, nikwo kwikiriza kuba nkaitwe, buri mushaija weena omuriimwe akasharwa; <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />obwo nibwo turibahingira bahara baitu, naitwe tukashwera bahara baanyu, tukatuura naimwe, tukaba eihanga rimwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Ku muraabe mutatwikiriize mukasharwa, nitwija kutwara omwishiki waitu, twegyendere. <verse eid="GEN 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Ebigambo byabo byashemeza Hamori na Shekemu omutabani. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Omutsigazi ogwo tiyaayeziringa, yaarahuka kukikora, ahabw'okukunda munonga omwishiki wa Yakobo; kandi akaba naasiimwa munonga okukira boona ab'omu ka ya ishe.<verse eid="GEN 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Hamori na Shekemu omutabani baaza aha irembo ry'orurembo rwabo, baahanuura n'abashaija b'omuri orwo rurembo, bati: <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />Abashaija abo twine nabo obusingye; n'ahabw'ekyo ka batuure omu nsi egi, bakoreremu eby'obushuubuzi; ahakuba ensi egi ni mpango, neebamara; tushwere bahara baabo, naitwe tubahingire abaitu. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Hariho kimwe kyonka ekyakureetera abashaija abo okutuura naitwe, tukaba eihanga rimwe, nikwo buri mushaija weena omuriitwe okusharwa, nkabo oku bashazirwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Nimugira ngu ente zaabo n'ebintu byabo n'amatungo gaabo goona tibirikwija kuba ebyaitu? Ka tufe okubaikiriza; nibwo baraatuure naitwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Boona abaashohoire nibaraba omu irembo ry'orurembo rwe, baikiriza ebi Hamori na Shekemu omutabani baabagambira. Buri mushaija weena owaarabire omu irembo ry'orurembo rwe yaasharwa.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 49:5-7">Kut 49:5-7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha kiro kya kashatu, ku baabaire bakirwaire obuhuta, batabani ba Yakobo babiri, Simeoni na Leevi, banyaanya ba Dina, biru omwe yaihayo rurara ye, baateera orurembo kitamanyirwe, baita abashaija boona. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Baitsa Hamori na Shekemu omutabani rurara, baiha Dina omu nju ya Shekemu, baagyenda. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Beene Yakobo baija aha mitumbi, baagicwijura, baanyaga eby'omu rurembo, nibabatura okushiisha munyaanyabo. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Baatwara n'amasyo gaabo ag'entaama n'ag'ente, n'endogoya zaabo, n'ebyabaire biri omu rurembo n'omu ishwa byona; <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />baanyaga eitungo ryabo ryona, n'abaana baabo abato n'abakazi baabo, n'ebintu byona ebyabaire biri omu maju, byaba eminyago yaabo. <verse eid="GEN 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Bwanyima Yakobo yaagira Simeoni na Leevi ati: Mungwisiize akagwe, mwandeetera kwangirwa kimwe abantu abatwire omu nsi egi, Abanyakanaani n'Abaperizi; haza nimureeba ku turi bakye; ku baraayeteerane kundwanisa, niinyija kucwekyerezibwa n'eka yangye. <verse eid="GEN 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Baagira bati: Hoona tukaamurekire agira munyaanyaitwe nka maraaya?<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s1">MUKAMA okweyorekyera Yakobo Beseeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 28:19">Kut 28:19</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ruhanga yaagira Yakobo ati: Imuka, oinamukye Beseeli, otuureyo; kandi okwo oyombekyereyo Ruhanga eitambiro, owaakweyorekire noohunga mukuru waawe Esau. <verse eid="GEN 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:15">Yos 24:15</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yakobo yaagambira ab'omu ka ye n'abandi boona abaabaire bari hamwe nawe, ati: Mwiheho baaruhanga b'abanyamahanga abari omuriimwe, mweyeze, mujware ebindi bijwaro; <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:6">Zab 107:6</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima mwimukye twinamukye Beseeli; niinyija kwombekyerayo Ruhanga eitambiro, owampuriire aha izooba ry'obusaasi bwangye, akaguma naanye omu muhanda ogu naarabiremu. <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Nabo nikwo kuha Yakobo baaruhanga b'abanyamahanga abu baabaire baine, n'empeta ezi baabaire bajwaire aha matu gaabo; Yakobo akabishereka ahansi y'omwela ogwabaire guri haihi na Shekemu.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:27">Kur 23:27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 11:25">Bir 11:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baabaire nibakigyenda, Ruhanga yaakwatsa obwoba ab'omu ndembo ezaabaire zibeehinguririize; n'ahabw'ekyo tibaakurata batabani ba Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Bwanyima Yakobo n'abu yaabaire aine boona baahika Luuzi, niyo Beseeli, ey'omu nsi ya Kanaani; <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:13">Kut 28:13</ref>. </char></note> yaayombekayo eitambiro, yaayeta ogwo mwanya Eli-Beseeli, ahabw'okuba niyo Ruhanga yaamweyorekyeire, obu yaahunga mukuru we. <verse eid="GEN 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:59">Kut 24:59</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Debora, omurezi wa Rebeka, yaafa, yaaziikwa ifo ya Beseeli ahansi y'omwela; n'ahabw'ekyo baagweta <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aloni-bakuusi: amakuru ngu: Omwela gw'eiriro. </char></note>Aloni-bakuusi.<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Yakobo, ku yaarugire Padanaramu, Ruhanga yaagaruka yaamweyoreka, kandi yaamuha omugisha. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:28">Kut 32:28</ref>. </char></note> Ruhanga yaamugira ati: Eiziina ryawe ori Yakobo; kwonka tokyetwa Yakobo obundi, kureka noija kwetwa Israeli. Ruhanga nikwo kumweta Israeli. <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Ruhanga yaamugira ati: Ndi Ruhanga ow'obushoboorozi bwona; ozaare, okanye; eihanga n'omutwe gw'amahanga biryaruga omuriiwe, kandi n'abagabe baryakukomookamu. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:13">Kur 32:13</ref>. </char></note> Ndyakuha ensi ei naahaire Abrahamu na Isaaka, kandi bwanyima ngihe n'oruzaaro rwawe. <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Ruhanga yaamutsiga omu mwanya ogu yaabaire naagaaniriramu nawe, yaatemba omu iguru. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18">Kut 28:18</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 28:19">19</ref>. </char></note> Yakobo yaabyara enyomyo y'eibaare omu mwanya ogu yaagaaniriiremu nawe, yaagishukaho empongano y'eky'okunywa, kandi yaagishukaho n'amajuta. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Yakobo yaayeta omwanya ogu Ruhanga yaagaaniriiremu nawe Beseeli.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Rakeeli na Isaaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Bwanyima baaruga Beseeli; ku baabaire bakiri kaanya, batakahikire Efuraata, Rakeeli yaarumwa kuzaara, yaahangaanirwa. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 30:24">Kut 30:24</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaabaire akihangaaniirwe, omuzaarisa yaamugira ati: Otatiina; waaza kugaruka kuzaara omwojo. <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Ku yaabaire ari haihi kufa, omu kukaba kwe yaamweta <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Benoni, amakuru ngu, Omwana w'obusaasi. </char></note>Benoni; kwonka ishe yaamweta <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Benyamiini, amakuru ngu, Omwana w'omukono gwa buryo </char></note>Benyamiini. <verse eid="GEN 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 48:7">Kut 48:7</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mik 5:2</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Rakeeli yaafa, yaaziikwa aha muhanda ogurikuza Efuraata, niyo Betelehemu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:2">1 Sam 10:2</ref>. </char></note> Yakobo yaabyara enyomyo aha kituuro kye; niyo nyomyo y'aha kituuro kya Rakeeli; kandi ekiriho n'okuhitsya eri izooba.<verse eid="GEN 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Israeli yaagumizamu, bwanyima yaateera eihema rye seeri y'omunaara gwa Ederi. <verse eid="GEN 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">35:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 5:1">1 Bus 5:1</ref>. </char></note> Israeli ku yaabaire akiri omuri ekyo kyanga, Reubeeni yaagyenda, yaabyama na Biliha muka ishe ow'ekinyanshunju; Israeli yaakimanya. Obwo batabani ba Yakobo bakaba baahikire ikumi na babiri. <verse eid="GEN 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Batabani ba Lea, Reubeeni omujigaijo gwa Yakobo, Simeoni, Leevi, Yuda, Isakaari na Zebuluuni. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Batabani ba Rakeeli, Yosefu na Benyamiini. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Batabani ba Biliha, omuzaana wa Rakeeli, Daani na Nafutaali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Batabani ba Zilupa omuzaana wa Lea, Gaadi na Asheri. Abo nibo batabani ba Yakobo abaazaariirwe Padanaramu.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Bwanyima Yakobo yaashanga ishe Mamure, nari Kiryasiaraba, niyo Heburooni, ei Abrahamu na Isaaka baabaire bashuhuukiire. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Emyaka ya Isaaka ekahika igana na makumi munaana. <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />Atyo omwitsyo gwamuhwamu, yaafa, yaakurata abaabo, ari omugurusi ahwitsire; abatabani Esau na Yakobo baamuziika.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s1">Oruzaaro rwa Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Oru nirwo ruzaaro rwa Esau, niwe Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 26:34">Kut 26:34</ref>. </char></note> Esau akashwera abakazi omu baishiki ba Kanaani; Ada muhara wa Eloni Omuhiiti, Oholibama muhara wa Aana, kandi mwijukuru wa Zibeoni Omuhiivi, <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />na Basemaasi muhara wa Ishimaeli, munyaanya wa Nebayoosi. <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Ada yaazaarira Esau Elifaazi; Basemaasi yaazaara Reueli, <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />na Oholibama yaazaara Yeushi, Yalamu na Koora. Abo nibo batabani ba Esau abaazaariirwe omu nsi ya Kanaani.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Esau yaatwara abakazi be, batabani be, bahara be, n'ab'omu ka ye boona n'ente ze n'amatungo ge goona kandi n'ebintu bye byona, ebi yaihire omu nsi ya Kanaani; yaaza omu nsi ya hare, ngu ataane n'omurumuna Yakobo; <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />ahabw'okuba eitungo ryabo rikaba riri ringi, tibaabaasa kutuurana; ensi ei baabaire baashuhuukiiremu, terabaasize kubamara ahabw'amatungo gaabo. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">36:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:3">Kut 32:3</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo Esau yaatuura omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Seiri; Esau ogwo niwe Edomu.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Aba nibo baijukuru ba Esau, ishenkuru w'Abanyaedomu abaabaire batwire omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Seiri. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Aga nigo maziina ga batabani ba Esau: Elifaazi mutabani wa Ada muka Esau, Reueli mutabani wa Basemaasi muka Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />N'abatabani ba Elifaazi bakaba bari Temani, Omari, Zeefo, Gatamu na Kenazi. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Kandi Timuna akaba ari omukaza wa Elifaazi mwene Esau ow'ekinyanshunju; yaazaarira Elifaazi Amaleki. Abo nibo baijukuru ba Ada muka Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Aba nibo baijukuru ba Basemaasi muka Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Aba nibo batabani ba Oholibama muka Esau, muhara wa Aana mwijukuru wa Zibeoni; yaazaarira Esau Yeushi, Yalamu na Koora.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Aba nibo bakuru b'enganda beene Esau; batabani ba Elifaazi omujigaijo gwa Esau, omutware Temani, omutware Omari, omutware Zeefo, omutware Kenazi, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />omutware Koora, omutware Gatamu n'omutware Amaleki; abo nibo bakuru b'enganda abaazairwe Elifaazi omu nsi ya Edomu, kandi nibo baijukuru ba Ada. <verse eid="GEN 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Aba nibo batabani ba Reueli mwene Esau: omutware Nahasi, omutware Zeera, omutware Shama n'omutware Miiza; abo nibo batware abaazairwe Reueli omu nsi ya Edomu, kandi nibo baijukuru ba Basemaasi muka Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Aba nibo batabani ba Oholibama muka Esau: omutware Yeushi, omutware Yalamu, n'omutware Koora; abo nibo batware abaazairwe Oholibama muka Esau, kandi muhara wa Aana. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Abo nibo batabani ba Esau, niwe Edomu; kandi abo nibo batware baabo.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Aba nibo batabani ba Seiri Omuhoori, abaashangirwe batwire omuri egyo nsi: Lotani, Shobali, Zibeoni, Aaba, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />Dishoni, Ezeeri na Dishani; abo nibo baami b'Abahoori beene Seiri ab'omu nsi ya Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />N'abatabani ba Lotani bakaba bari Hoori na Hemani; kandi Timuna akaba ari munyaanya wa Lotani. <verse eid="GEN 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Aba nibo batabani ba Shobali: Alivani, Manahaasi Ebali, Sheefo na Onamu. <verse eid="GEN 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Aba nibo batabani ba Zibeoni: Aaya na Aana; Aana ogwo niwe yaazoire ekitagata omu ihamba, obu yaabaire ariisize endogoya za Zibeoni ishe. <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Aba nibo baana ba Aana: Dishoni na Oholibama muhara wa Aana. <verse eid="GEN 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Aba nibo batabani ba Dishoni: Hemidaani, Eshibaani, Isuraani, na Kerani. <verse eid="GEN 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Aba nibo batabani ba Ezeeri: Biluhaani, Zaavani na Akani. <verse eid="GEN 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Aba nibo batabani ba Dishani: Uuzi na Arani. <verse eid="GEN 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Aba nibo batware b'Abahoori; omutware Lotani, omutware Shobali, omutware Zibeoni, omutware Aana, <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />omutware Dishoni, omutware Ezeri n'omutware Dishani; abo nibo batware b'Abahoori omu nsi ya Seiri, nk'emiryango yaabo oku yaabaire eri. <verse eid="GEN 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Aba nibo bagabe abaategyekire omu nsi ya Edomu, Abaisraeli obu baabaire batakategyekirwe mugabe weena. <verse eid="GEN 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Beela mwene Beori akategyeka Edomu, kandi eiziina ry'orurembo rwe rikaba riri Dinihaba. <verse eid="GEN 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Beela yaafa, Yobabu mwene Zeera owa Bozira yaayema omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="GEN 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Yobabu yaafa, Hushamu ow'omu nsi y'Abatemani yaayema omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="GEN 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Hushamu yaafa, Hadadi mwene Bedadi, owaabingire Abamidiani omu nsi ya Moabu, yaayema omu mwanya gwe; eiziina ry'orurembo rwe rikaba riri Aviisi. <verse eid="GEN 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Hadadi yaafa, Samula owa Masireka yaayema omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="GEN 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Samula yaafa, Shauli owa Rehoboosi aha mugyera Furaati yaayema omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="GEN 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Shauli yaafa, Baali-hanani mwene Akiboori yaayema omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="GEN 36:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Baali-hanani mwene Akiboori yaafa, Hadari yaayema omu mwanya gwe, n'eiziina ry'orurembo rwe rikaba riri Pau, kandi omukazi we akaba naayetwa Mehetabeeli, muhara wa Matireedi, kandi mwijukuru wa Mezahaabu. <verse eid="GEN 36:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Aga nigo maziina g'abatware abaakomookire ahari Esau, n'emiryango yaabo n'emyanya yaabo n'amaziina gaabo; omutware Timuna, omutware Aliva, omutware Yeseti, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />omutware Oholibama, omutware Eela, omutware Pinoni, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />omutware Kenazi, omutware Temani, omutware Mibuzaari, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />omutware Magudieli n'omutware Iraamu; abo nibo batware ba Edomu, niwe Esau ishenkuru w'Abanyaedomu, nk'emyanya yaabo ey'omu nsi ei baakubwire, oku yaabaire eri.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s1">Ebirooto bya Yosefu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Yakobo akatuura omu nsi ya Kanaani, ei ishe yaashuhuukiiremu. <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:22-24">1 Sam 2:22-24</ref>. </char></note> Ebi nibyo byabaire aha ruzaaro rwa Yakobo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Yosefu akaba naariisa amasyo hamwe n'abakuru be, aine emyaka ikumi na mushanju; omu kukura kwe akanyeeta n'abatabani ba Biliha n'aba Zilupa baka ishe; kandi Yosefu akaba agambira ishe ebibi ebi baabaire bakora. <verse eid="GEN 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Kandi Israeli akaba akunda Yosefu okukira abandi baana be boona, ahakuba akaba ari omwana ou yaazaire yaabaire omugurusi; n'ahabw'ekyo akamubaziiriza ekanzu ndaingwa y'amabara. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:23">Kut 49:23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:3">Yoh 7:3</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 7:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 2:11">1 Yoh 2:11</ref>. </char></note> Bakuru be ku baareebire ishe naamukunda okubakira boona, baamwanga, tibaabaasa kugamba gye nawe.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Yosefu yaaroota ekirooto; ku yaakigambiire bakuru be, baayeyongyera kumwanga. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Yaabagira ati: Nimbeeshengyereza muhurire ekirooto eki ndootsire; <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:6">Kut 42:6</ref>. </char></note> tubaire nituboha ebiba omu misiri; ekiba kyangye kyaimuka, kyayemerera; ebyanyu biba nabyo byayemerera byayehinguririza ekyangye, byakiinamira. <verse eid="GEN 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Bakuru be baamubuuza bati: Noogira ngu oryaba omugabe waitu? Buzima oryatutegyeka? Baayeyongyera kumwanga ahabw'ebirooto bye n'ebigambo bye. <verse eid="GEN 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:29">Kut 46:29</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaruka yaaroota ekindi kirooto, yaakigambira bakuru be, naagira ati: Ngarukire naarota ekindi kirooto; eizooba n'okwezi n'enyonyoozi ikumi n'emwe nibiinyinamira. <verse eid="GEN 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Ku yaakigambiire ishe n'abakuru be, ishe yaamuteisa, yaamugira ati: Ekyo ni kirooto ki eki orootsire? Noogira ngu nyowe na nyoko n'abakuru baawe buzima turyaija twiname ahansi omu maisho gaawe? <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Byak 7:9</ref>. </char></note> Bakuru be baamugirira eihari, kwonka ishe yaaguma naijuka ekyo kigambo.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakuru ba Yosefu okugira enaama y'okumwita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Bwanyima bakuru be baaza kuriisa amasyo ga ishebo haihi na Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Israeli yaagira Yosefu ati: Bakuru baawe tibarikuriisiza Shekemu? Ija mbakutumeho. Yaamugarukamu ati: Ntuma, Taata. <verse eid="GEN 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:18">1 Sam 17:18</ref>. </char></note> Ishe yaamugira ati: Irooko oreebe bakuru baawe ku baraabe bari gye n'amasyo ku garaabe gari gye, ogarukye ongambire. Nikwo kumutuma, akaruga omu ruhanga rwa Heburooni, akaza Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />Ku yaahikireyo, omuntu yaamushanga naagyendagyenda omu bwerere; yaamubuuza ati: Noosherura ki? <verse eid="GEN 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Onu ati: Ninsherura bakuru bangye; ninkweshengyereza, ngambira ahu bariisiize. <verse eid="GEN 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Omushaija yaamugarukamu ati: Bafurukire, ahakuba mpuriire nibagira ngu, Tuze Dosani. Atyo Yosefu yaakurata bakuru be, yaabashanga Dosani.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 12:7">Mak 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1">14:1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:53">Yoh 11:53</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku baamureebire akiri hare, atakabahikire haihi, baagira enaama y'okumwita. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Baagambirana bati: Reeba, ruroota yaija. <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 1:11">Enf 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 6:17">6:17</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu murekye tumwite, tumunagye omu kiina; turyagira tuti: Enyamaishwa endi y'abantu ekamurya; haza tureebe ebirooto bye ahu biriherera. <verse eid="GEN 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:22">Kut 42:22</ref>. </char></note> Reubeeni yaakihurira, yaamubakiza, yaagira ati: Katurekye kumwitira kimwe. <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Yaagaruka yaabagira ati: Mutasheesha eshagama, mumunagye aha omu ihamba omuri eki kiina, kwonka emikono yaanyu etagira eki yaamukoraho. Akagira atyo ngu abone kumubakiza, amugarurire ishe.<verse eid="GEN 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Yosefu ku yaahikire bakuru be, baamujuura ekanzu eri endaingwa ei yaabaire ajwaire, <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />baamutwara, baamunaga omu kiina; ekyo kiina kikaba kirimu busha, kitarimu maizi. <verse eid="GEN 37:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Baashutama kurya; ku baimukize amaisho, baareeba omutwe gw'Abaishimaeli nibaruga Gileadi, baine engamira zeekoreire emigaju n'emibazi na sumuruna, nibabitwara Misri. <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:10">Kut 4:10</ref>. </char></note> Yuda yaagira beene ishe ati: Nikitugasira ki kwita murumuna waitu, tukashereka eshagama ye? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:21">Kut 42:21</ref>. </char></note> Mwije tumuguze Abaishimaeli, emikono yaitu erekye kuba niyo yaamwita; ahabw'okuba ni murumuna waitu, kandi turi ab'orura rumwe. Beene ishe baamwikiriza. <verse eid="GEN 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 39:1">Kut 39:1</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:9">Byak 7:9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:9">Mat 27:9</ref>. </char></note> Omuri ako kaanya abashuubuzi b'Abamidiani baarabaho; banu baiha Yosefu omu kiina, baamuguza Abaishimaeli shekeli makumi abiri z'efeeza; baatwara Yosefu Misri.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Reubeeni ku yaagarukire aha kiina, yaashanga Yosefu atarimu, yaataagura ebijwaro bye; <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />yaagaruka ahari beene ishe, yaagira ati: Omwana tariyo; mbwenu ntoore hi? <verse eid="GEN 37:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Baatwara ekanzu ya Yosefu, baita empaya y'embuzi, baagijabika omu shagama yaayo; <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:23">Kut 37:23</ref>. </char></note> egyo kanzu ndaingwa baagitwarira ishebo, baagira bati: Tugwire aha kanzu egi; reeba ku eraabe eri ey'omwana waawe, nari etari yo. <verse eid="GEN 37:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Yakobo yaagimanya, yaagira ati: N'ekanzu y'omwana wangye; enyamaishwa endi y'abantu emuriire; tihariho kubanganisa, Yosefu ataagataagwirwe. <verse eid="GEN 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Yakobo yaataagura ebijwaro bye, yaayezirika ekiguniya, yaamara ebiro bingi naacurira omwana we. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">37:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:38">Kut 42:38</ref>. </char></note> Batabani be na bahara be boona baimuka baija kumwebesa enaku; yaayanga, yaagira ati: Ndyarugaho, nshangye omwana wangye okuzimu ninkicura. Nikwo ishe yaamucuriire atyo. <verse eid="GEN 37:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Kandi Abamidiani abo ku baahikire Misri, baamuguza Potifaari, omwe aha bakuru b'engabo za Faraho, owaabaire ategyeka abarinzi.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s1">Ebibi ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Omu biro ebyo Yuda akaruga omuri beene ishe, yaashuuma, yaataaha ow'omuntu orikwetwa Hiira owa Adulaamu. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 2:3">1 Bus 2:3</ref>. </char></note> Yuda yaareebayo omwishiki w'Omunyakanaani orikwetwa Shua; yaamutwara, yaabyama nawe; <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:19">Kub 26:19</ref>. </char></note> yaagira enda, yaazaara omwana w'omwojo, yaamweta Eeri. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Yaagaruka yaagira enda, yaazaara ondiijo mwojo, yaamweta Onani; <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />kandi yaagaruka yaagira enda, yaazaara ondiijo mwojo, yaamweta Sheela; obwo akaba ari Keziba, obu omukazi we yaazaara ogwo mwana. <verse eid="GEN 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Yuda yaashwererera omutabani omukuru Eeri omukazi eiziina rye Tamari. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Kwonka Eeri omujigaijo gwa Yuda akaba mubi omu maisho ga MUKAMA, MUKAMA nikwo kumwita. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:24">Mat 22:24</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yuda yaagira Onani ati: Irooko otaahe omwa muka mukuru waawe, oraare nawe, omumuzaarireho omwana. <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:6">Bir 25:6</ref>. </char></note> Onani yaamanya ngu omwana tarikwija kuba owe; n'ahabw'ekyo ku yaabyamire na muka mukuru we, yaasheesha ahansi, ngu atazaarira mukuru we. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Eki yaakozire kyaba kibi omu maisho ga Mukama; nawe yaamwita. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Bwanyima Yuda yaagambira Tamari omukaamwana ati: Guma ori omufaakazi omu ka ya sho, okuhitsya obu omwana wangye Sheela arikura; ahakuba akatiina ngu naija kufa nka bakuru be. Tamari nikwo kugyenda, akaguma omu ka ya ishe.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Bwanyima ku haahingwireho ebiro, muhara wa Shua, muka Yuda, yaafa. Yuda ku yaarugire omu rufu rw'omukazi we, yainamuka Timuna hamwe na mugyenzi we Hiira owa Adulaamu, baaza ei abariisa be baabaire nibasharira ebyoya by'entaama. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Baagira Tamari bati: Shozaara yainamuka, yaaza Timuna kusharisa entaama ze ebyoya. <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />Yaajuura ebijwaro by'obufaakazi, yaayetwekyerera akenda ah'amaisho, ogundi yaagwehumbika, yaashutama omu irembo rya Enaimu, eriri aha muhanda ogurikuza Timuna; ahabw'okuba akareeba Sheela akuzire, haza tibamumuha kumuhungura. <verse eid="GEN 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Yuda ku yaamureebire, yaagira ngu ni maraaya; ahakuba akaba ayetwekyereire ah'amaisho. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Yaakiikama aha rubaju rw'omuhanda ahu yaabaire ari, yaamugira ati: Ninkweshengyereza, ija tubyame hamwe; (kwonka akaba atamanyire ku ari omukaamwana). Onu ati: Nompa ki, ku oraabyame naanye? <verse eid="GEN 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Yaagira ati: Niinyija kukutwekyera omwana gw'embuzi ogw'omu busyo bwangye. Onu ati: Noija kunkwatiriza ki, okuhitsya obu oraaguntwekyere? <verse eid="GEN 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Yaagira ati: Nkukwatirize ki? Onu ati: Ontsigire empeta yaawe eriho akamanyiso, n'orukoba rwawe, n'egyo nkoni ei oine omu ngaro. Yaabimuha, yaabyama nawe, yaamutweka. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Omukazi yaimuka, yaayegyendera, yaayeiha ako kenda ahamutwe, yaagaruka yaajwara ebijwaro bye by'obufaakazi. <verse eid="GEN 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Yuda yaatweka munywani we Omunyadulaamu omwana gw'embuzi ngu omukazi amugarurire ebi amukwatiriize; kwonka tiyaamushangayo. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Yaabuuza abashaija b'omuri ogwo mwanya ati: Maraaya obaire ari Enaimu aha rubaju rw'omuhanda agiire hi? Banu bati: Tihariho maraaya obaire ari aha. <verse eid="GEN 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Yaagaruka ahari Yuda, yaamugira ati: Tinaamushangayo; kandi abaayo bangira ngu, Habaire hatariyo maraaya. <verse eid="GEN 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Yuda yaagira ati: K'agume nabyo, turekye kuhemuka; ahakuba naakutweka omwana gw'embuzi, tiwaamushangayo. <verse eid="GEN 38:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">38:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 21:9">Lev 21:9</ref>. </char></note> Ku haahingwireho nk'ameezi ashatu, baagambira Yuda bati: Tamari mukaamwana waawe akeegira maraaya, mbwenu aine enda y'obushambani. Yuda yaagira ati: Mumushohoze, bamunagye omu muriro. <verse eid="GEN 38:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Ku baamushohoize, yaatuma ahari ishezaara, naagira ati: Mukama w'ebintu ebi niwe yantwekire enda; kandi ati: Ninkweshengyereza, obyetegyereze, empeta eriho akamanyiso n'orukoba n'enkoni, omanye mukama waabyo. <verse eid="GEN 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Yuda yaikiriza ku biri ebye, yaagira ati: We niwe ahikiriire okunkira, ahakuba tindamuhaire Sheela mutabani wangye. Tiyaagaruka kubyama nawe obundi.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Obunaku bwe bw'okuzaara ku bwahikire, yaareebeka aine enda y'empasha. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Ku yaabaire naarumwa, omwe yaashohoza omukono, omuzaarisa yaagukwata, yaagukomaho akahuuzi akarikutukura, yaagira ati: Ogu niwe yaabanza kushohora. <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Bwanyima ogwo mwana ku yaabaire naagarurayo omukono, mugyenzi we yaashohora. Omuzaarisa yaagira ati: Ahabw'enki waayeyozyaho? Nikyo yaayeteirwe Pereezi. <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Bwanyima na mugyenzi we owaabaire akomire akahuuzi akarikutukura aha mukono yaazaarwa. Baamweta Zeera.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s1">Yosefu omu ka ya Potifaari n'okutegwa kwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:36">Kut 37:36</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baatwara Yosefu Misri; Potifaari omwe aha bakuru b'engabo za Faraho kandi Omunyamisri owaabaire naategyeka abarinzi, yaamugura aha Baishimaeli abaamutwaireyo. <verse eid="GEN 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:9">Byak 7:9</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaaguma hamwe na Yosefu, yaaba omunyamigisha. Yaaguma omu ka ya mukama we Omunyamisri. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 1:3">Zab 1:3</ref>. </char></note> Mukama we yaareeba oku MUKAMA ari hamwe nawe, kandi oku MUKAMA amuhaire omugisha omuri byona ebi arikukora. <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Yosefu yaashongoka ahari mukama we, yaamuheereza, mukama we yaamugira omureeberezi w'eka ye na byona ebi yaabaire atungire yaabimukwatsa. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 30:27">Kut 30:27</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaaherize kumugira omureeberezi w'eka ye kandi ow'ebintu byona ebi yaabaire aine, MUKAMA yaaha eka y'ogwo Munyamisri omugisha ahabwa Yosefu; kandi omugisha gwa MUKAMA gwaza ahari byona ebi yaabaire aine, eby'omuka n'eby'omu misiri. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Yaakwatsa Yosefu ebi yaabaire aine byona; tiyaagaruka kufa aha kintu kyona eki yaabaire aine, kureka eby'okurya byonka, ebi yaabaire arya. Yosefu akaba anyeetsire gye, aine ahamaisho harungi. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Bwanyima y'ebyo muka mukama we yaamureeba, yaamurigira, yaagira ati: Ija tubyame hamwe. <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Kwonka Yosefu yaayanga, yaagira muka mukama we ati: Reeba, mukama wangye taine ki arikumanya omuri egi ka; akankwatsa ebi aine byona; <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:13">2 Sam 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 51:4">Zab 51:4</ref>. </char></note> egi ka tihariho orikuginkiramu; kandi tihariho ki atarandekuriire, kureka iwe wenka, ahabw'okuba ori omukazi we. Mbwenu nimbaasa nta kukora ekibi ekirikwingana kityo, n'okucumura ahari Ruhanga? <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Kandi n'obu araabe yaabaire abimugambira obutoosha, Yosefu akaba ataikiriza kubyama nawe, n'obu kwakuba okuguma nawe. <verse eid="GEN 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Eizooba rimwe Yosefu ku yaataahire omu nju kukora omurimo gwe, hataine mushaija weena ow'omuri egyo ka orimu, <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 7:13">Enf 7:13</ref>. </char></note> omukazi yaamukwata ekijwaro, yaamugira ati: Ija tubyame hamwe. Yosefu yaatsiga ekyo kijwaro omu ngaro ze, yaahunga, yaashohora aheeru. <verse eid="GEN 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Omukazi ku yaareebire yaamutsigira ekijwaro kye, yaahunga, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />yaayeta abashaija b'omu ka ye, yaabagira ati: Reeba, bakareeta Omuheburaayo okutweshungiraho; mbwenu yantaahirira kubyama naanye, naateera enduuru; <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />ku yaahurira naayamuza ninteera enduuru, yaatsigaho ekijwaro kye, yaahunga, yaashohora aheeru. <verse eid="GEN 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Omukazi nikwo kweta ekyokijwaro haihi, okuhitsya ahu mukama we yaagarukiire omuka, <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 23:27">Enf 23:27</ref>. </char></note> akamuteekyerereza ebigambo ebyo byona, oku bibaire, ati: Omwiru Omuheburaayo, ou waatureeteire, yantaahirira kunyeshungiraho; <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />ku naayamuza naateera enduuru, yantsigira ekijwaro kye, yaahunga, yaashohora. <verse eid="GEN 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 6:34">Enf 6:34</ref>. </char></note> Mukama we ku yaahuriire ebigambo ebi omukazi we yaamugambira naagira ati: Omwiru waawe nikwo yangira, yaagira ekiniga kingi. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:18">Zab 105:18</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:19">1 Pet 2:19</ref>. </char></note> Yaakwata Yosefu, yaamuta omu kihome, ahu embohe z'omugabe zaabaire ziboherwa; yaaguma okwo omu kihome.<verse eid="GEN 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 106:46">Zab 106:46</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka MUKAMA yaaguma hamwe na Yosefu, yaamugirira embabazi, yaamuha okukundwa omurinzi w'ekihome. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Ogwo murinzi w'ekihome yaakwatsa Yosefu embohe zoona ezaabaire ziri omu kihome; byona ebi zaabaire zikora, Yosefu niwe yaabaire abikoresa. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">39:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 39:2">Kut 39:2</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 39:3">3</ref>. </char></note> Omurinzi w'ekihome tiyaagaruka kureeberera kintu kyona omu bi yaamukwatsize, ahabw'okuba MUKAMA akaba ari hamwe nawe, kandi ebi yaabaire akora byona, MUKAMA akaba abiha omugisha.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s1">Yosefu okushoboorora ebirooto by'abaheereza ba Faraho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Bwanyima y'ebyo omugabuzi wa viinyo ow'omugabe wa Misri n'omuteeki we w'emigaati baagwisa kubi mukama waabo, omugabe wa Misri. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 16:14">Enf 16:14</ref>. </char></note> Faraho yaagirira ekiniga abakuru abo bombi, omukuru w'abagabuzi ba viinyo n'omukuru w'abateeki b'emigaati; <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />yaabata omu kihome ekyabaire kiri omu ka y'omukuru w'abarinzi, ahu Yosefu yaabaire akomeirwe. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Omukuru w'abarinzi yaabakwatsa Yosefu kuguma naabaheereza; baamara ebiro bari omu kihome.<verse eid="GEN 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Ekiro kimwe bombi baaroota ebirooto, buri omwe ekirooto kye, kiine amakuru gaakyo, omugabuzi wa viinyo n'omuteeki w'emigaati ab'omugabe wa Misri, abaabaire bari omu kihome. <verse eid="GEN 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Yosefu ku yaizire kubareeba omu kasheeshe, yaashanga bagwirwe kubi; <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />yaabuuza abo bakuru ba Faraho abaabaire bakomeirwe omu nju ya mukama we hamwe nawe, ati: Ahabw'enki eri izooba mwaimuka mugwirwe kubi? <verse eid="GEN 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:11">Dan 2:11</ref>. </char></note> Baamugarukamu bati: Turootsire ebirooto, twabura ow'okubitushobororera. Yosefu yaabagira ati: Okushoboorora shi t'okwa Ruhanga? Nimbashaba mubindootororere.<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Omugabuzi wa viinyo omukuru yaarootororera Yosefu ekirooto kye, naagira ati: Ndootsire omuzaabibu guri omu maisho gangye; <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />ogwo muzaabibu gubaire gwine amataagi ashatu; ku guginire, gwarabya, gwaragaza ebijuma byagwo byahiisa. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Obwo ekikopo kya Faraho kindi omu ngaro; naacwa ebyo bijuma, naabikamuurira omu kikopo kya Faraho, naakimukwatsa omu ngaro. <verse eid="GEN 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:36">Dan 2:36</ref>. </char></note> Yosefu yaamugira ati: Aga nigo makuru gaakyo: ago mataagi ashatu nibyo biro bishatu; <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 52:31">Yer 52:31</ref>. </char></note> omuri ebyo biro bishatu Faraho naija kwimutsya omutwe gwawe akugarure omu bugabuzi bwawe, oheereze Faraho ekikopo kye, nk'oku waabaire omuheereza okiri omugabuzi we wa viinyo. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:42">Luk 23:42</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 2:12">Yos 2:12</ref>. </char></note> Ku oriba waabaire gye, naakweshengyereza onyijukye, ongirire embabazi, ongambe owa Faraho, onyihise omuri egi nju. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Omanye ku naihirwe omu nsi y'Abaheburaayo; kandi na kunu tinkakorayoga ekyakuntaisize omu kihome.<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Omuteeki w'emigaati omukuru ku yaareebire ebi yaamushobororera byaba birungi, yaagambira Yosefu ati: Naanye ndootsire nyekoreire ebitemere bishatu by'emigaati. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Aha kitemere eky'aha mutwe gw'ebindi hariho emigaati y'emiringo yoona ningitwarira Faraho; enyonyi zaija, zaagindiira aha mutwe ahari ekyo kitemere. <verse eid="GEN 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Yosefu yaamugarukamu ati: Aga nigo makuru gaakyo; ebitemere ebyo ebishatu nibyo biro bishatu; <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />omuri ebyo biro bishatu Faraho naija kwimutsya omutwe gwawe, agucweho, akuhanikye aha muti, amahungu gakushokoorereho. <verse eid="GEN 40:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:6">Mat 14:6</ref>. </char></note> Aha kiro kya kashatu, aha izooba ry'okwijuka okuzaarwa kwa Faraho, yaateekyera abairu be boona obugyenyi; yaimutsya omutwe gw'omugabuzi wa viinyo omukuru n'ogw'omuteeki w'emigaati omukuru ahagati y'abairu be; <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />yaagarura omukuru w'abagabuzi ba viinyo omu bugabuzi bwe, yaaguma naabonetsya Faraho omu kikopo kye. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Kwonka omuteeki w'emigaati omukuru yaamuhanika, nk'oku Yosefu yaashoboroire amakuru g'ebirooto byabo. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">40:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 31:12">Zab 31:12</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omugabuzi wa viinyo omukuru tiyaijuka Yosefu, yaamwebwa.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s1">Yosefu okushoboorora amakuru g'ebirooto bya Faraho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Ku haahingwireho emyaka ebiri, Faraho yaaroota ayemereire aha rubaju rw'omugyera; <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />omuri ogwo mugyera haarugamu ente nungi mushanju ezigomokire, zaayahukira ekibingo, zaarya. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Bwanyima haakurataho ezindi nte mbi mushanju ezihweire aha magufa, nazo niziruga omu mugyera; zaayemerera na ziri aha nkungu. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Embi ezihweire aha magufa zaarya ezo enungi mushanju ezigomokire. Bwanyima Faraho yaasisiimuka. <verse eid="GEN 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Yaagaruka yaagwejegyera, yaaroota ekirooto kya kabiri; yaareeba ebishiisha by'engano mushanju birungi by'enjuma, biri aha mushengye gumwe; <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />kandi otundi tushiisha mushanju otwomiibwe omuyaga gw'oburugwa-izooba natwo twakurataho, twamera. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Otushiisha otwo twamira ebishiisha mushanju ebirungi eby'enjuma. Faraho ku yaasisiimukire, yaashanga kiri ekirooto. <verse eid="GEN 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:5">Dan 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 7:11">Kur 7:11</ref>. </char></note> Omu kasheeshe yaimuka ashobeirwe, yaatuma ku bamwetera abafumu boona ab'omuri Misri, n'abanyabwengye baamwo boona, yaabarootororera ebirooto bye, kwonka tihaabaho n'omwe owaabaasa kubimushobororera.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Bwanyima omugabuzi wa viinyo omukuru yaagambira Faraho ati: Eri izooba naijuka eby'orubanja rwangye ruri; <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Faraho akaba agwereirwe kubi abairu be, yanta omu kihome omu nju y'omukuru w'abarinzi hamwe n'omukuru w'abateeki b'emigaati. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Ekiro kimwe twembi twaroota ebirooto, buri omwe ekirooto kye kiine amakuru gaakyo. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Omu kihome ekyo tukaba turimu n'omutsigazi Omuheburaayo, omwiru w'omukuru w'abarinzi. Twamurootororera ebirooto byaitu, yaabitushobororera, buri omwe nk'ekirooto kye oku kyabaire kiri. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Kandi nk'oku yaatushobororeire, nikwo byabaire; nyowe naagarurwa omu bugabuzi bwangye, mugyenzi wangye yaahanikwa.<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 113:7">Zab 113:7</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 113:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:25">Dan 2:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Faraho yaatuma kweta Yosefu, baarahuka baamwiha omu kihome, yaamwaisa eishokye, yaajwara ebindi bijwaro, yaataaha owa Faraho. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:16">Dan 5:16</ref>. </char></note> Faraho yaagambira Yosefu ati: Ndootsire ekirooto, haabura ow'okukinshobororera; mbwenu mpuriire nibakugambaho ngu, ku bakurootororera ekirooto, okishoboorora. <verse eid="GEN 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:30">Dan 2:30</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 3:12">Byak 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 3:5">2 Kor 3:5</ref>. </char></note> Yosefu yaagarukamu Faraho naagira ati: Tiinye; Ruhanga niwe araagarukyemu Faraho eby'obusingye. <verse eid="GEN 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Faraho yaagambira Yosefu ati: Ndootsire nyemereire aha nkungu y'omugyera. <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />Omuri ogwo mugyera haarugamu ente nungi mushanju ezigomokire, zaayahukira ekibingo, zaarya. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Bwanyima zaakuratwa ezindi nte mbi mushanju ezihweire aha magufa, ente mbi ezi ntakareebaga mu nsi yoona eya Misri. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Ente ezo embi ezihweire aha magufa zaarya ziri omushanju enungi ezigomokire ez'okubanza. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Ku ziherize kuzirya, waashusha oti tizaazirya; zaaguma ziri mbi nk'okubanza. Bwanyima naasisiimuka. <verse eid="GEN 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />Naagaruka naaroota nindeeba ebishiisha mushanju birungi by'enjuma, biri aha mushengye gumwe; <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />kandi otundi tushiisha mushanju tuhotokire, twomiibwe omuyaga ogw'oburugwa-izooba, natwo twakurataho twamera; <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:8">Zab 118:8</ref>. </char></note> otwo tushiisha twamira ebishiisha ebirungi mushanju. Naabirootororera abafumu, kwonka haabura owaabaasa kubinshobororera.<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 2:28">Dan 2:28</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 2:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:1">Kush 4:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yosefu yaagambira Faraho ati: Ebirooto bya Faraho nibishushana; Ruhanga ayorekire Faraho eki arikwenda kukora <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Ente mushanju enungi niyo myaka mushanju; n'ebishiisha mushanju ebirungi nayo n'emyaka mushanju; ekirooto ni kimwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:1">2 Bag 8:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi n'ente ezindi mushanju embi ezihweire aha magufa, ezikuratsire ziri n'emyaka mushanju, n'otushiisha mushanju otutarimu njuma otwomiibwe omuyaga gw'oburugwa-izooba; egyo eryaba emyaka mushanju y'enjara. <verse eid="GEN 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Ekyo nikyo naagambira Faraho nti: Ruhanga akworekire, iwe Faraho, eki arikwenda kukora. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Reeba nihaija kubaho emyaka mushanju ey'omweru mwingi omu nsi yoona eya Misri; <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:16">Zab 105:16</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Bag 17:1</ref>. </char></note> bwanyima y'egyo haryabaho emyaka mushanju ey'enjara, omweru gwona gwebe omu nsi ya Misri; egyo njara eryamaraho ensi. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Omweru guryaba gutakiijukwa mu nsi ahabw'enjara erikurataho, ahabw'okuba eryaba nyingi munonga. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Ekireeteire Faraho okuroota ekirooto ekyo omu miringo ebiri n'ahabw'okuba kitairweho Ruhanga, kandi niwe arikwija kukihikiiriza juba. <verse eid="GEN 41:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />Mbwenu nu Faraho asherure omuntu orikwetegyereza kandi omunyabwengye, amuhe obushoboorozi bw'okutegyeka ensi ya Misri. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Faraho akore atyo, ateho ab'okureeberera ensi, bahunikise ekicweka kya kataano ky'eby'okurya by'ensi yoona eya Misri omu myaka mushanju ey'omweru; <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />bateeranire hamwe ebirikuhunikwa byona eby'omu myaka egyo emirungi eyaaza kwija, babihunikye omu ndembo, babirinde biri omu bushoboorozi bwa Faraho. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Eby'okurya ebyo biryabiikirwa ensi ahabw'emyaka mushanju ey'enjara, eribaho omu nsi ya Misri, ensi erekye kwitwa enjara.<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okukuzibwa kwa Yosefu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Ekyo kigambo kyasiimwa Faraho n'abaheereza be boona. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:18">Kub 27:18</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:11">Dan 5:11</ref>. </char></note> Farao yaabuuza abaheereza be ati: Ebyo tukaabaasa kubona omuntu orikushusha nk'ogu, oine Omwoyo wa Ruhanga? <verse eid="GEN 41:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Faraho yaagambira Yosefu ati: Nk'oku Ruhanga akworekire ebyo byona, tihariho ondiijo orikwetegyereza kandi omunyabwengye nkaiwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Naakuha okutegyeka eka yangye, kandi abantu bangye boona baryatwaza nk'oku oribaragiira; kureka eki ndikweshumbya n'ekitebe ky'obugabe kyonka. <verse eid="GEN 41:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:21">Zab 105:21</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 4:13">Mub 4:13</ref>, <ref loc="ECC 4:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Faraho yaagaruka yaamugira ati: Reeba, naakuha obushoboorozi bw'okutegyeka ensi yoona eya Misri. <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:10">Est 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="EST 8:2">8:2</ref>. </char></note> Faraho yaajuura empeta ye eriho akamanyiso omu rukumu rwe, yaagijweka Yosefu omu rukumu; yaamujweka n'ebijwaro birungi bya kitaani, kandi n'omukuufu gw'ezaabu omu bitsya; <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />yaamugyendeseza omu kigaari ekya kabiri aha kye, baateera akaari omu maisho ge, nibagira bati: Mumutsimbire amaju. Yaamuha obushoboorozi kutegyeka ensi yoona eya Misri. <verse eid="GEN 41:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Faraho yaagambira Yosefu ati: Nk'oku ndi Faraho, tihariho muntu weena oriimutsya omukono n'obu kyakuba ekigyere omu nsi yoona eya Misri, otamwikiriize. <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Faraho yaakubya Yosefu Zafunasi-panea; yaamuha Asenasi, muhara wa Potifeera omunyamurwa wa Oni kumushwera. Okuruga aho Yosefu yaarambura ensi ya Misri.<verse eid="GEN 41:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:46: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 3:23">Luk 3:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yosefu akaba ahikize emyaka makumi ashatu, obu yaayemerera omu maisho ga Faraho omugabe wa Misri. Yosefu yaaruga omu maisho ga Faraho, yaaza kurambura ensi yoona eya Misri. <verse eid="GEN 41:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Omu myaka egyo mushanju ey'omweru ensi tiyaayeza, yaacwa ebintu. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Yosefu yaateeranira hamwe eby'okurya ebirikuhunikwa byona ebi baasharwire omu myaka mushanju eyaabaireho omu nsi ya Misri, yaabihunikisa omu ndembo; eby'okurya by'omu misiri eyaabaire eba eyehinguririize buri rurembo, nimwo yaabaire abihunika. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Yosefu yaahunika eby'okurya bingi munonga ebirikwingana n'omusheenyi ogw'aha nyanja, okuhitsya obu yaarekire kubara; ahakuba bikaba bitakibaasa kubarwa.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:50: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 48:5">Kut 48:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enjara etakateire, Yosefu akazaara abaana b'aboojo babiri, abu Asenasi muhara wa Potifeera omunyamurwa wa Oni yaamuzaariire. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Ow'omujigaijo yaamweta Manaase, naagira ati: Ahakuba Ruhanga akanyebesa okufa kubi kwangye kwona n'eka ya taata yoona. <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Owa kabiri yaamweta Efuraimu, naagira ati: Ahakuba Ruhanga ampeereire oruzaaro omu nsi ei naareebeiremu enaku.<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Egyo myaka mushanju ey'omweru eyaabaireho omu nsi ya Misri yaahwa. <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:54: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:16">Zab 105:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:11">Byak 7:11</ref>. </char></note> Emyaka mushanju ey'enjara yaatandika, nk'oku Yosefu yaagambire; enjara yaabuga ensi zoona, kwonka omu nsi ya Misri yoona hakaba harimu eby'okurya. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Ensi yoona eya Misri ku yaateirwe enjara, baayetuurira Faraho ngu abahe eby'okurya. Faraho yaagambira Abanyamisri boona ati: Muze owa Yosefu; eki araabagambire kyona, mukikore. <verse eid="GEN 41:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:56: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:26">Enf 11:26</ref>. </char></note> Enjara yaabuga ensi yoona. Yosefu yaigura ebitara byona, yaashakisa Abanyamisri; enjara yaaba nyingi omu nsi ya Misri. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">41:57: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:10">Kut 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:1">26:1</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:1">2 Bag 8:1</ref>. </char></note> Ab'omu nsi zoona baija ahari Yosefu omuri Misri kushaka eby'okurya, ahakuba enjara ekaba eri nyingi omu nsi yoona.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s1">Bakuru ba Yosefu okuza kushaka Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 7:12">Byak 7:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yakobo ku yaahuriire ngu omuri Misri hariyo eby'okurya, yaagira abatabani ati: Ahabw'enki nimureebana aha riisho? <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 33:18">Zab 33:18</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 33:19">19</ref>. </char></note> Yaagira ati: Reeba, mpuriire ngu Misri hariyo eby'okurya; mwirooko muzeyo, mutushakire eby'okurya, bitutambire tutafa. <verse eid="GEN 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Bakuru ba Yosefu ikumi baashuuma, baaza Misri kushaka; <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />kwonka Benyamiini murumuna wa Yosefu, Yakobo tiyaamwohereza n'abakuru be; ahakuba akatiina ngu shana atakaaguubwaho akabi. <verse eid="GEN 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Batabani ba Israeli baija n'abandi abaizire kushaka, ahakuba enjara ekaba eri nyingi omu nsi ya Kanaani.<verse eid="GEN 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 60:14">Isa 60:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo Yosefu niwe yaabaire ari omutegyeki w'ensi egyo, kandi naashakisa ab'omuri egyo nsi boona eby'okurya. Bakuru ba Yosefu baija, baamugwa omu maisho, bainama. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Yosefu ku yaareebire bakuru be, yaabamanya, kwonka yaayehindura nk'omunyaihanga aharibo, yaabakabukira, yaababuuza ati: Nimuruga hi? Banu bati: Nituruga omu nsi ya Kanaani, twizire kushaka. <verse eid="GEN 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Yosefu yaamanya bakuru be, kwonka bo tibaamumanya. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:5">Kut 37:5</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 37:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Yosefu yaijuka ebirooto biri ebi yaabarootsireho; yaabagira ati: Muri entatsi; mwizire kureeba ahu ensi etaine maani. <verse eid="GEN 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Baamugarukamu bati: Ngaaha, mukama waitu; abairu baawe tureetsirwe okushaka. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Twena turi eishe-emwe; turi abantu b'amazima, abairu baawe tituri ntatsi. <verse eid="GEN 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Yaabagira ati: Ngaaha; mwizire kureeba ahu ensi etaine maani. <verse eid="GEN 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 44:20">Kut 44:20</ref>. </char></note> Baamugarukamu bati: Abairu baawe turi eishe-emwe ikumi na babiri, abaana b'omushaija omwe omu nsi ya Kanaani; murumuna waitu omuto hati tariho, atsigaire na tataitwe, kandi ondiijo takibaho. <verse eid="GEN 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Yosefu yaabagira ati: Ekyo nikyo naabagirira nti, muri entatsi. <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Mbwenu aha niho muraamanyirwe; nindahira Faraho, timurikwija kuruga aha, murumuna waanyu omuto atakaizire. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Mutume omwe ahariimwe, areete murumuna waanyu, abandi mutsigare mubohirwe, ebigambo byanyu bibone kuhamibwa, tumanye ku muri ab'amazima; ku kiraabe kitabaire kityo, nindahira Faraho, buzima muri entatsi. <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Boona yaabata omu kihome okumara ebiro bishatu. <verse eid="GEN 42:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 5:15">Neh 5:15</ref>. </char></note> Aha kiro kya kashatu Yosefu yaabagira ati: Mukore muti, nimwija kukira; ahakuba nintiina Ruhanga. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Ku muraabe muri ab'amazima, omwe ahariimwe atsigare omu nju y'ekihome ahu mubaire mukomeirwe; abandi mugyende mutware eby'okurya ahabw'enjara y'omu maka gaanyu; <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />bwanyima mundeetere murumuna waanyu omuto; obwo ebigambo byanyu biryahamibwa, timurifa. Nabo baatwaza batyo. <verse eid="GEN 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 36:8">Yob 36:8</ref>, <ref loc="JOB 36:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:2">Mat 7:2</ref>. </char></note> Baagambirana bonka bati: Buzima twine orubanja ahabwa murumuna waitu; ahakuba tukareeba aine obusaasi omu mutima, obu yaatweshengyereza, tukanga kumuhurira; nikyo kyatureetera akabi aka. <verse eid="GEN 42:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:21">Kut 37:21</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:22">2 Bus 24:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 9:12">Zab 9:12</ref>. </char></note> Reubeeni yaabagarukamu naagira ati: Tindabagambiire nti: Mutakora kubi omwana, mukanga kumpurira? Mbwenu reeba, twazira eshagama ye. <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Kwonka tibaamanya ku Yosefu yaabahurira, ahabw'okuba akaba naagambirirwa omuhinduzi. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Yosefu yaabateera amabega, yaarira; bwanyima yaagaruka ahu bari, yaagamba nabo, yaabaihamu Simeoni, yaamukomera omu maisho gaabo.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:17-21">Rom 12:17-21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okuruga aho Yosefu yaaragiira kwijuza enshaho zaabo eby'okurya, n'okugarura efeeza ya buri muntu omu nshaho ye, n'okubaha entanda y'okuriira omu muhanda; okwo nikwo baabakoreire. <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Banu baata eby'okurya byabo aha ndogoya zaabo, baagyenda. <verse eid="GEN 42:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Ku baahikire omu icumbi, omwe aharibo yaakomorora enshaho ye okuriisa endogoya, yaashanga efeeza ye eri omu minwa yaayo; <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />yaagambira bagyenzi be ati: Efeeza yangye baagingarurira; reeba ngigi omu nshaho yangye; baahuruutuka emitima, bahindukirana nibatetema, nibagira bati: Eki n'enki eki Ruhanga yaatukorera? <verse eid="GEN 42:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Ku baahikire ahari Yakobo ishebo omu nsi ya Kanaani, baamugambira byona ebyababaireho, nibagira bati: <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />Omushaija orikutegyeka egyo nsi akatukabukira, yaatweta abaizire kutata ensi; <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />naitwe twamugira tuti: Turi ab'amazima, tituri ntatsi; <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />turi eishe-emwe ikumi na babiri, abaana b'omushaija omwe; omwe takibaho, kandi na murumuna waitu omuto atsigaire n'omugurusi waitu omu nsi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />Omushaija ogwo orikutegyeka ensi yaatugira ati: Eki nikyo kirimmanyisa ku muri ab'amazima. Muntsigire omwe ahariimwe, mutware eby'okurya ahabw'enjara y'omu maka gaanyu, mugyende; <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />mundeetere murumuna waanyu omuto; niho ndimanyira ku mutari ntatsi, kureka ku muri ab'amazima; reero naanye ndyabagarurira mugyenzi waanyu, mubone kushuubura omu nsi egi. <verse eid="GEN 42:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Ku baabaire nibaiha eby'okurya omu nshaho zaabo, buri muntu yaashanga ekifunyika ky'efeeza kiri omu nshaho ye; bo na ishebo ku baareebire ebifunyika by'efeeza, baatiina. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:14">Kut 43:14</ref>. </char></note> Ishebo Yakobo yaabagira ati: Mbwenu ho mwancwa; Yosefu takibaho, na Simeoni tariho; mbwenu nimwenda kuunyihaho na Benyamiini. Ebyo byona niinye biiziire! <verse eid="GEN 42:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Reubeeni yaagira ishe ati: Ku ndiba ntamukugaruriire, oite batabani bangye bombi; munkwatse, ndyamukugarurira. <verse eid="GEN 42:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">42:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 44:28-31">Kut 44:28-31</ref>. </char></note> Onu ati: Omwana wangye tarikwija kugyenda naimwe; ahabw'okuba mukuru we akafa, niwe atsigaireho wenka; akabi katakaamuhikaho, mukandeetera obujune bukampuhura, nkashuuma okuzimu nk'oku murikundeeba n'ezi nju.<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s1">Beene Yakobo okugaruka Misri kushaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Enjara yaagumizamu kuba nyingi omu nsi. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Aba Yakobo ku baaherize engano ezi baihire Misri, ishebo yaabagira ati: Mugarukyeyo, mutushakire ak'okurya. <verse eid="GEN 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Yuda yaamugarukamu ati: Omushaija ou twakugambiire akatwehanangiriza, naagira ati: Timuringaruka mu maisho, mutareetsire murumuna waanyu. <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Ku oraatwohereze na murumuna waitu, nitwija kuzayo, tukushakire; <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />kwonka ku oraabe otamwohereize, titurikuzayo; ahabw'okuba ogwo mushaija akatugira ati: Timuringaruka mu maisho mutaine murumuna waanyu. <verse eid="GEN 43:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Israeli yaababuuza ati: Ahabw'enki mwangiriire kubi mutyo, mukagambira ogwo mushaija, ku mwine murumuna waanyu ondiijo? <verse eid="GEN 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Baamugarukamu bati: Omushaija ogwo akatubuuza naatucondooza, oku turi, n'ab'owaitu, kandi yaatugira ati: Shoimwe akibaho? Mwineho murumuna waanyu ondiijo? Naitwe twamugarukamu, nk'oku yaatubuurize. Tukaba nitumanya ku arikwenda kugira ati: Mureete murumuna waanyu? <verse eid="GEN 43:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Yuda yaagambira Israeli ishe ati: Omwojo mwohereze, agyende naanye, twimukye tugyende, tukize amagara gaitu, tutafa, itwe naiwe n'abaana baitu abato. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:18">Film 1:18</ref>, <ref loc="PHM 1:19">19</ref>. </char></note> Nyowe ndyamwemererera; niinye orimubuuza. Ku ndiba ntamugarwire, nkamuhitsya omu maisho gaawe, obwo ndyagiibwaho orubanja orutarindugaho ebiro byona; <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />ahakuba kuri tutareeziringire, buzima hati kuri twagarukire omurundi gwa kabiri.<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:25">Kut 37:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Israeli ishebo yaabagira ati: Ku kiraabe nikwo kiri, mugire muti; mutware aha bijuma by'ensi egi ebirikukira oburungi omu nshaho zaanyu, mubitoijere ogwo mushaija hamwe n'omubazi mukye, n'obwoki bukye, n'emigaju na sumuruna, n'ebinyobwa, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Endozi n'obujuma bw'omuti oburikushusha empande. </char></note>n'endozi; <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />kandi mutware efeeza ezirikwingana na ziri kabiri, n'efeeza ezaagarwirwe omu minwa y'enshaho zaanyu nazo muzitware; shana bakakikora batakimanyire. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Kandi mutware murumuna waanyu, mwimukye mugarukye ow'ogwo mushaija. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 13:15">Yob 13:15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Ruhanga Ow'obushoboorozi bwona abahe omugisha, ogwo mushaija abagirire embabazi, abagarurire mugyenzi waanyu na Benyamiini. Ku ndiba naafeereirwe abaana bangye, biri naafeereirwe.<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosefu okuteekyera beene ishe obugyenyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Abo bashaija baatwara egyo mitoijo, n'efeeza eziri nka ziri kabiri, baatwara na Benyamiini, baimuka baashuuma Misri, baayemerera omu maisho ga Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Yosefu ku yaareebire baine Benyamiini, yaagambira omubiiki w'eby'omuka ye ati: Twara abashaija aba omuka, obabaagire, otebeekanise byona, ahakuba abashaija aba nibaija kurya naanye omu ihangwe. <verse eid="GEN 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Omubiiki yaakora nk'oku Yosefu yaamugambira, yaatwara abo bashaija omu kya Yosefu. <verse eid="GEN 43:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Baatiina ahabw'okutwarwa omu nju ya Yosefu; baagira bati: Eki baatutaahiza omu n'ahabw'efeeza ezaagarwirwe omu nshaho zaitu obw'okubanza, ngu agire eki yaatureebaho, atugurukire atukwate, atugire abahuuku, kandi anyagye n'endogoya zaitu. <verse eid="GEN 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Bairira haihi omubiiki w'eby'omu nju ya Yosefu, baagambira nawe aha muryango gw'enju, <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />nibagira bati: Mukama waitu, n'eky'amazima, tukaija omurundi gw'okubanza kushaka; <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:35">Kut 42:35</ref>. </char></note> ku twahikire omu icumbi, twakomorora enshaho zaitu, twashanga efeeza za buri muntu ziri omu minwa y'enshaho ye, zoona ziri nk'oku zaabaire ziri; mbwenu nzizi, twazigarura. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Kandi twareeta n'ezindi kushaka eby'okurya; titurikumanya owaazitaire omu nshaho zaitu. <verse eid="GEN 43:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Yaabagira ati: Muhuumure, mutatiina; Ruhanga waanyu, kandi Ruhanga wa shoimwe niwe yaataire obutungi omu nshaho zaanyu. Nyowe nkaakiira efeeza zaanyu. Yaabashohoreza Simeoni. <verse eid="GEN 43:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:5">Yoh 13:5</ref>. </char></note> Yaabataasya omu nju ya Yosefu, yaabaha amaizi g'okunaaba aha bigyere; yaaha n'endogoya zaabo eby'okurya. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Baatebeekanisa emitoijo y'okuha Yosefu yaija omu ihangwe; ahakuba bakahurira ngu, nibaija kuriirayo.<verse eid="GEN 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Yosefu ku yaagarukire omuka, baamushangisa omu nju emitoijo ei baareetsire, baamwinamira. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Yaababuuza oku bari, kandi ati: Shoimwe agumire, omugurusi ou mwagambireho? Akibaho? <verse eid="GEN 43:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:7">Kut 37:7</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 37:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Banu bati: Omwiru waawe tataitwe akiriho agumire? Bainika emitwe, baamuramya. <verse eid="GEN 43:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Yaanaga amaisho, yaareeba Benyamiini mwene nyina, yaababuuza ati: Ogu niwe murumuna waanyu omuto ou mwangambiire? Yaamugambira ati: Ruhanga akugirire embabazi mwana wangye. <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:20">Yer 31:20</ref>. </char></note> Yosefu yaarahuka kubarugaho, ahakuba akaba ainiire mwene nyina orushusho ruhango; yaasherura ah'okuririra, yaataaha omu kishengye kye, yaaririramu. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Bwanyima yaanaaba ah'amaisho, yaashohora, yaayegumya, yaagira ati: Mwihure eby'okurya. <verse eid="GEN 43:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:34">Kut 46:34</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 8:26">Kur 8:26</ref>. </char></note> Baamugaburira ahakwe, na bari ahakwabo, n'Abanyamisri abaabaire barya nawe nabo ahakwabo, ahabw'okuba Abanyamisri bakaba batarya n'Abaheburaayo; kikaba kiri ekihagaro aha Banyamisri. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Beene ishe baashutama omu maisho ge, nk'oku barikukuratana omu kuzaarwa okuruga aha mukuru okuhika aha muto; baareebana nibatangaara. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">43:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:22">Kut 45:22</ref>. </char></note> Yosefu yaababegyera ebitongye aha by'okurya ebyabaire biri omu maisho ge, kwonka ekitongye kya Benyamiini kyakira ekya buri omwe aharibo emirundi etaano. Bwanyima baanywa, baashemererwa hamwe nawe.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s1">Yosefu okugyeza bakuru be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Bwanyima Yosefu yaaragiira omubiiki w'eby'omu nju ye ati: mwijuze enshaho z'abo bashaija, nk'oku omuntu weena arikubaasa kwekorera, ote n'efeeza ya buri muntu omu minwa y'enshaho ye, <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />kandi ote ekikopo kyangye ky'efeeza omu minwa y'enshaho ya murumuna waabo omuto hamwe n'efeeza ei yaabaire areetsire kushakisa. Nawe yaatwaza nk'oku Yosefu yaamuragiira. <verse eid="GEN 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Ku bwabaire nibutaagurukana, abo bashaija baaragwa, baagyenda n'endogoya zaabo. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Ku baabaire baaruga omu rurembo, batakahikire hare, Yosefu yaagira omubiiki we ati: Imuka okurate abo bashaija; ku oraabahikye, obabuuze oti: Ahabw'enki mwaihura obubi, haza mugiriirwe gye? Ahanki mwaiba ekikopo kye ky'efeeza? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Tikyo mukama wangye anywaisa, kandi tikyo aragurisa? Mukozire kubi okukora mutyo.<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Ku yaabahikire, yaabagambira ebigambo ebyo. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Baamugarukamu bati: Mukama wangye, ahabw'enki waatugambira ebigambo nk'ebyo? Nikikabure abairu baawe okukora ekintu nk'ekyo! <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 43:21">Kut 43:21</ref>. </char></note> Noomanya ngu efeeza ezi twashangire omu minwa y'enshaho zaitu tukazikugarurira, obu twaruga Kanaani. Mbwenu nitubaasa tuta kwiba efeeza nari ezaabu eby'omu nju ya mukama waawe? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Weena ou oraashangye akiine omu bairu baawe, afe, kandi naitwe tube abahuuku ba mukama waitu. <verse eid="GEN 44:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Nawe yaagira ati: Mbwenu hati kibe nk'oku mwagamba. Ou turaashangye akiine, niwe araabe omuhuuku wangye; haza obwo abandi nimurugwaho orubanja. <verse eid="GEN 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Baarahuka, buri muntu yaata enshaho ye ahansi, yaagikomorora. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Omushaija ogwo yaacaaka, naatandikira aha mukuru okuhitsya obu yaahikire aha muto; ekikopo kyashangwa omu nshaho ya Benyamiini. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:6">Kub 14:6</ref>. </char></note> Baatagura ebijwaro byabo, buri muntu yaata ebintu bye aha ndogoya ye, baagaruka omu rurembo.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Yuda na bagyenzi be baahika omu nju ya Yosefu, baashanga akiri aho, baagwa ahansi omu maisho ge. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Yosefu yaabagira ati: Eki eki mukozire n'enki? Timurikumanya ngu omuntu nkaanye nimbaasa kuragura? <verse eid="GEN 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 40:4">Yob 40:4</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 44:9">Kut 44:9</ref>. </char></note> Yuda yaagira ati: Mbwenu nitukyenda kukugambira ki, mukama waitu? Ekindi tugambe ki? Nari shi twetonganire tuta? Ruhanga asherembwire obubi bw'abairu baawe. Mbwenu twaba abahuuku ba mukama waitu, hamwe n'ou baashanga aine ekikopo. <verse eid="GEN 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Kwonka Yosefu yaagira ati: Nikikabure nyowe okukora ntyo; kureka omushaija ou baashanga aine ekikopo, niwe araabe omuhuuku wangye; haza imwe mwegyendere n'obusingye, mugarukye owa shoimwe.<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 32:22">Kur 32:22</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 41:40">Kut 41:40</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yuda nikwo kumwirira haihi, akamugira ati: Mukama wangye, ninkweshengyereza reka omwiru waawe agire eki yaakugambira; kandi otagirira omwiru waawe ekiniga, Mukama wangye; ahakuba ori nka Faraho buzima. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Mukama wangye akabuuza abairu be, naagira ati: Mwine shoimwe, nari murumuna waanyu ondiijo? <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Twagarukamu mukama wangye tuti: Twine tataitwe, n'omugurusi, kandi na murumuna waitu ou yaazaire yaakuzire; mukuru we akafa, niwe atsigaireho omunda ya nyina, kandi ishe naamukunda. <verse eid="GEN 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Naiwe waagambira abairu baawe, oti: Mumundeetere, mmureebe; <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />naitwe twagambira mukama wangye tuti: Omwana ogwo tarikubaasa kutsigaho ishe; ahakuba ku yaakumutsigaho, ishe akaafa. <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Waagarukamu abairu baawe oti: Murumuna waanyu omuto ku ariba ataizire naimwe, timuringaruka mu maisho. <verse eid="GEN 44:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />Ku twagarukire aha mwiru waawe tataitwe, twamugambira ebigambo bya mukama wangye. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Bwanyima tataitwe yaagira ati: Mugarukyeyo, mutugurire ak'okurya. <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Naitwe twagira tuti: Titurikubaasa kuzayo; murumuna waitu omuto ku araagyende naitwe, obwo naitwe nitwija kuzayo; ahakuba tituribaasa kugaruka ogwo mushaija mu maisho, kureka murumuna waitu omuto yaagyenda naitwe. <verse eid="GEN 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />N'ahabw'ekyo omwiru waawe taata akatugira ati: Nimumanya ku omukazi wangye yanzaariire aboojo babiri; <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />omwe akandugaho, naateekateeka nti: Buzima akataagataagurwa; kandi n'okuhitsya hati tinkamureebaga. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:36">Kut 42:36</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ku muraanyiheho n'ogu, haagira ekyamubaho, nimwija kundeetera obujune bumpuhure, nshuume okuzimu nk'oku murikundeeba n'ezi nju. <verse eid="GEN 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:1">1 Sam 18:1</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ku ndigaruka aha mwiru waawe taata, omwojo tutamwine, yaareeba tutaija nawe, aryafa, <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />ahabw'okuba amagara ge gakwaitswe ag'ogu mwana; kandi itwe abairu baawe turyaba tureeteire omwiru waawe tataitwe obujune bw'okumuhuhura, ogwo mugurusi ashuume okuzimu n'ezo nju. <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Omanye ngu nyowe omwiru waawe niinye naayemerereire ogu mwana ahari taata, ningira nti: Ku ndiba ntamukugaruriire, ndyagiibwaho orubanja orutarindugaho. <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">44:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:32">Kur 32:32</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ninkweshengyereza, Mukama wangye, mbe niinye naaguma aha, mbe omuhuuku waawe, haza omwana ogu we ataahe n'abakuru be. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Mbwenu nimbaasa nta kugaruka ahari taata, ntaine ogu mwojo? Nintiina kureeba akabi akarihika ahari taata.<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s1">Yosefu okwegambira bakuru be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Yosefu yaaremwa kwegumya omu maisho ga boona abaabaire bamwemereire haihi, yaagira ati: Ragiira abantu boona bashohore bampigize. Tihaagira muntu weena owaatsigara na Yosefu, omu kwegambira beene ishe. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Yaarira naaborooga munonga; Abanyamisri n'ab'omu nju ya Faraho baamuhurira. <verse eid="GEN 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Yosefu yaagambira beene ishe, ati: Niinye Yosefu. Taata akibaho? Beene ishe baabura eki baamugarukamu, ahakuba bakashobererwa omu maisho ge. <verse eid="GEN 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Yosefu yaagira beene ishe ati: Nimbeeshengyereza muunyirire haihi. Baamwirira haihi. Yaagira ati: Niinye Yosefu murumuna waanyu, ou mwagurize kutwarwa Misri. <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 2:7">2 Kor 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:20">Kut 50:20</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu mutashaasha, n'obu kwakuba okwegwerwa kubi ahabw'okunguza nkaija kunu; ahabw'okuba Ruhanga niwe yantumire kubabandiza kunu kukiza amagara g'abantu. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Ahakuba hati enjara emazire emyaka ebiri omu nsi, kandi hakiriyo endiijo myaka etaano, ei abantu batarihingiramu, n'obu kwakuba okugyesha. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Kandi Ruhanga akantuma kubabandiza kunu ngu abakwatire eihembe omu nsi, kandi abajune omu buryo bw'okutangaaza. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:43">Kut 41:43</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo tiimwe mwanyohereize kunu, ni Ruhanga; kandi angizire nk'omuzaire ahari Faraho, mukama w'eka ye yoona, kandi omutegyeki w'ensi yoona eya Misri.<verse eid="GEN 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />Nimwimukye mwehuute, muze owa taata, mumugire muti: Omwana waawe Yosefu atutumire naagira ati: Ruhanga angizire mukama wa Misri yoona; shuuma onshangye kunu, oteeziringa; <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:1">Kut 47:1</ref>. </char></note> kandi noija kutuura omu kyanga kya Gosheni, onze haihi iwe n'abaana baawe na baijukuru baawe n'amasyo gaawe ag'entaama n'ag'ente, n'ebi oine byona. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 5:4">1 Tim 5:4</ref>. </char></note> Okwo ndyakuheerayo eby'okurya, ahabw'okuba hakitsigaireyo endiijo myaka etaano y'enjara, otakaitwa obworo, iwe n'ab'omu ka yaawe n'abu oine boona. <verse eid="GEN 45:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />Kandi reeba, hati imwe na murumuna wangye Benyamiini nimwereebera ku niinye ndikugamba naimwe. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:14">Byak 7:14</ref>. </char></note> Mushemereire kugambira taata eby'ekitiinisa kyangye kyona eki nyine omuri Misri, n'ebi mureebire byona; kandi murahukye mureete taata kunu. <verse eid="GEN 45:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Yaagwa Benyamiini omurumuna omu bitsya, yaarira; na Benyamiini nawe yaarira amugwire omu bitsya. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Kandi yaanywegyera bakuru be boona naarira; bwanyima y'ebyo bakuru be baagaaniira nawe.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Faraho okutuma Yakobo kwija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Amakuru ku gaahikire owa Faraho ngu beene ishe wa Yosefu baizire, byashemeza Faraho n'abaheereza be. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Faraho yaagira Yosefu ati: Gambira beene sho oti: Mugire muti: Mute emitwaro aha ndogoya zaanyu, mugyende, mugarukye omu nsi ya Kanaani; <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />mureete shoimwe n'ab'omu maka gaanyu, mwije owangye; naanye ndyabaha ebirungi by'omu nsi ya Misri, naimwe murye aha bishaju byayo. <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Kandi obaragiire oti: Mutwaze muti: mutware ebigaari by'omu nsi ya Misri eby'okureetamu abaana baanyu abato n'abakazi baanyu, mureete na shoimwe, mwije. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Kandi murekye kufa aha bintu byanyu, ahakuba ebirungi by'omu nsi yoona eya Misri n'ebyanyu. <verse eid="GEN 45:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Beene Israeli baatwaza batyo; Yosefu yaabaha ebigaari, nk'oku Faraho aragiire, yaabaha n'entanda y'okuriira omu muhanda. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Boona oku baingana, buri omwe yaamuha ebijwaro by'okwihaihanisa; kwonka Benyamiini we yaamuha ebicweka by'efeeza magana ashatu n'ebijwaro by'okwihaihanisa kataano. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Kandi ishe yaamutwekyera endamutsyo y'endogoya ikumi ezeekoreire ebintu birungi bya Misri, n'ezindi ndogoya ikumi z'ebuguma ezeekoreire engano n'emigaati n'entanda ya ishe y'okuriira omu muhanda. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Atyo yaaraga beene ishe; ku baabaire nibaimuka kugyenda, yaabagira ati: Mwerinde, mutatonganira omu muhanda.<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Bainamuka baaruga Misri, baahika omu nsi ya Kanaani ahari ishebo Yakobo, <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">45:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:41">Luk 24:41</ref>. </char></note> baamugambira bati: Yosefu abaho, kandi niwe mutegyeki w'ensi yoona eya Misri. Omutima gwe gwagwa enshazi, ahakuba tarabaikiriize. <verse eid="GEN 45:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Baamutekyerereza ebi Yosefu yaabagambiire byona; kandi ku yaareebire ebigaari, ebi Yosefu yaatwekire kumutwara, omutima gwe gwagaruka eruguru; <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Israeli nikwo kugira ati: Nikimara; Yosefu omwana wangye obu ariho; ka ngyende, ndeebane nawe ntakafiire.<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo okuza Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Atyo Israeli yaimuka, yaagyenda n'ebi yaabaire aine byona, yaahika Beeri-sheba, yaatambira Ruhanga wa Isaaka ishe ebitambo. <verse eid="GEN 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Ruhanga yaayeta Israeli omu kworekwa kwa nyekiro, ati: Yakobo! Yakobo! Onu ati: Ndi aha, Mukama wangye. <verse eid="GEN 46:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:2">Kut 12:2</ref>. </char></note> Yaamugira ati: Ndi Ruhanga, Ruhanga wa sho; otatiina kushuuma Misri; ahakuba okwo niyo ndikuhindurira eihanga rihango; <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 48:21">Kut 48:21</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 3:8">Kur 3:8</ref>. </char></note> ndyashuuma naiwe Misri, kandi buzima ndyagaruka nkwiheyo; na Yosefu niwe arikukwata ahamaisho nookaba. <verse eid="GEN 46:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Byak 7:15</ref>. </char></note> Yakobo yaimuka, yaaruga Beeri-sheba; abatabani baamutwara hamwe n'abaana baabo abato n'abakazi baabo omu bigaari ebi Faraho yaatwekire kumureetamu. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:4">Yos 24:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 105:23">Zab 105:23</ref>. </char></note> Kandi baatwara amatungo gaabo n'ebintu byabo ebi baatungiire omu nsi ya Kanaani, baaza omuri Misri, Yakobo n'oruzaaro rwe rwona, <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />abatabani n'abatabani baabo, na bahara be, na bahara ba batabani be; orwo nirwo ruzaaro rwe rwona oru yaagyenzire narwo Misri.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 1:1">Kur 1:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aga nigo maziina g'abaana ba Israeli abaagiire Misri, Yakobo n'abatabani; Reubeeni omujigaijo gwe; <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />batabani ba Reubeeni, Hanoki, Palu, Hezirooni na Karumi. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Batabani ba Simeoni ni Yemueli, Yamini, Ohadi, Yakini, Zohari, na Shauli omutabani, w'Omunyakanaanikazi. <verse eid="GEN 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Batabani ba Leevi ni Gereshoni, Kohasi na Merari. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Batabani ba Yuda ni Eeri, Onani, Sheela, Pereezi na Zeera; kwonka Eeri na Onani bakafeera omu nsi ya Kanaani; batabani ba Pereezi ni Hezirooni na Hamuli. <verse eid="GEN 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Batabani ba Isakaari ni Toola, Puuva, Yobu na Shimirooni. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Batabani ba Zebuluuni ni Seredi, Eloni na Yahaleeli. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Abo nibo batabani ba Lea, abu yaazaariire Yakobo omuri Padanaramu hamwe na muhara we Dina; abaana be b'aboojo n'ab'abaishiki boona bakaba bari makumi ashatu na bashatu. <verse eid="GEN 46:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Batabani ba Gaadi ni Zifioni, Haagi, Shuuni, Ezibooni, Eeri, Arodi na Areeli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Batabani ba Asheri ni Imuna, Ishiva, Ishivi na Beeria na munyaanyabo Seera; batabani ba Beria ni Heberi na Malikieli. <verse eid="GEN 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Abo nibo baana ba Zilupa ou Labaani yaahaire Lea muhara we, kandi abo nibo yaazaariire Yakobo, abantu ikumi na mukaaga. <verse eid="GEN 46:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Batabani ba Rakeeli muka Yakobo ni Yosefu na Benyamiini. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Kandi Yosefu yaazaarira Manaase na Efuraimu omu nsi ya Misri, abu Asenaasi muhara wa Potifeera omunyamurwa wa Oni yaamuzaariire. <verse eid="GEN 46:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Batabani ba Benyamiini ni Beela, Bekeri, Ashubeeli, Geera, Naamani, ehi, Roshi, Mupimu, Hupimu na Aridi. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Abo nibo batabani ba Rakeeli abu yaazaariire Yakobo; boona bakaba bari ikumi na bana. <verse eid="GEN 46:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Mutabani wa Daani ni Hushimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Batabani ba Nafutaali ni Yahazeeli, Guuni, Yezeri na Shileemu. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Abo nibo batabani ba Biliha ou Labaani yaahaire Rakeeli muhara we, abu yaazaariire Yakobo; boona bakaba bari mushanju. <verse eid="GEN 46:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:5">Kur 1:5</ref>. </char></note> Abantu boona ab'omu nda ya Yakobo abaagyenzire nawe Misri, otabariiremu bakaamwana be, bakaba bari makumi mukaaga na mukaaga. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:22">Bir 10:22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:14">Byak 7:14</ref>. </char></note> Batabani ba Yosefu abu yaazaariire Misri bakaba bari babiri; abantu boona ab'omu ka ya Yakobo abaagiire Misri bakaba bari makumi mushanju.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo okureebana na Yosefu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Yakobo yaatuma Yuda ahari Yosefu ku amushanga Gosheni; batyo baahika omu kyanga kya Gosheni. <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Yosefu yaaboneza ekigaari kye, yainamuka, yaaza kubugana Israeli ishe omuri Gosheni; yaamwetondera, yaamugwa omu bitsya, yaamara omwanya naarira akimuri omu bitsya. <verse eid="GEN 46:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:29">Luk 2:29</ref>. </char></note> Israeli yaagira Yosefu ati: N'obu naakufa nka hati, niho naakureeba, nkamanya ku obaho. <verse eid="GEN 46:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Yosefu yaagambira beene ishe n'ab'omu ka ya ishe ati: Ka ngyende ngambire Faraho, mmugira nti: Beene taata n'ab'omu ka ye abaabaire batwire omu nsi ya Kanaani naatsiga baija; <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />nti, kandi abo bashaija n'abariisa, ahakuba omurimo gwabo n'okuriisa; na mbwenu baareeta amasyo gaabo ag'entaama n'ag'ente, n'ebindi byona ebi baatungire. <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Faraho ku araabeete, yaababuuza ati: Mukora murimo ki? <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">46:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 8:26">Kur 8:26</ref>. </char></note> Mumugire muti: Abairu baawe turi abariisa okwiha omu buto bwaitu n'okuhitsya hati, itwe na baatatenkuriitwe; mubone kutuura omu kyaro kya Gosheni; ahakuba omuriisa weena n'ekihagaro aha Banyamisri.<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="s1">Yosefu okutondera Faraho ishe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Yosefu yaaza owa Faraho, yaamugira ati: Taata na beene taata n'amasyo gaabo ag'entaama n'ag'ente n'ebi baatungire byona barugire omu nsi ya Kanaani, hati bari omu kyanga kya Gosheni. <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:13">Byak 7:13</ref>. </char></note> Omuri beene ishe yaatooranamu bataano, yaabatondera Faraho. <verse eid="GEN 47:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Faraho yaababuuza ati: Mukora murimo ki? Baamugarukamu bati: Abairu baawe turi abariisa, itwe na baatatenkuriitwe. <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13">Kut 15:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 26:5">Bir 26:5</ref>. </char></note> Baagaruka baagambira Faraho bati: Twizire kushuhuukira omu nsi egi; ahakuba abairu baawe tukabura obunyaatsi bw'amasyo gaitu owaitu Kanaani, kandi hariyo n'enjara nyingi; mbwenu nitukweshengyereza, oikirize abairu baawe batuure omu kyaro kya Gosheni. <verse eid="GEN 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Faraho yaagambira Yosefu ati: Sho na beene sho bakuhikire; <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />ensi ya Misri ekuri omu maisho; ohe sho na beene sho ah'okutuura aharikukira oburungi; batuure omu kyanga kya Gosheni. Kandi ku oraabe oine abu orikumanyamu abarikumanya gye eby'ente, obahindure abakuru b'amasyo gangye. <verse eid="GEN 47:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 22:29">Enf 22:29</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yosefu yaataasya Yakobo ishe owa Faraho, yaamuta omu maisho ge; Yakobo yaashabira Faraho omugisha. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Faraho yaabuuza Yakobo ati: Mbwenu oine emyaka engahi? <verse eid="GEN 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 39:12">Zab 39:12</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 14:1">Yob 14:1</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 4:14">Yak 4:14</ref>. </char></note> Yakobo yaamugarukamu ati: Ebiro by'emyaka ei mmazire ningyendagyenda nibihika emyaka igana na makumi ashatu; ebiro by'egyo myaka y'amagara gangye ni bikye kandi ni bibi; terikwingana n'ei baatatenkuru baamazire omu kugyendagyenda kwabo. <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Yakobo ku yaaherize kushabira Faraho omugisha, yaashohora, yaaruga omu maisho ge. <verse eid="GEN 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Yosefu yaaha ishe na beene ishe ah'okuzingura omu nsi ya Misri omu kyaro kya Rameseesi aharikukira oburungi okuba obutaka bwabo, nk'oku Faraho yaaragiire. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Kandi Yosefu yaaguma naaha ishe eby'okurya na beene ishe n'ab'omu ka ya ishe boona, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosefu okugurira Faraho ensi ya Misri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Kandi omuri egyo nsi yoona hakaba hatarimu by'okurya; ahakuba enjara ekaba eri nyingi munonga, kyareetera ab'omu nsi ya Misri n'eya Kanaani okukuuhura ahabw'egyo njara. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Yosefu yaateerana hamwe empiiha zoona ezaabaire ziri omu nsi ya Misri n'eya Kanaani, ezaarugire omu ngano ezi baaguzire; empiiha ezo zoona yaazireeta omu nju ya Faraho. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Empiiha ku zaahwereire kimwe omu nsi ya Misri n'eya Kanaani, Abanyamisri boona baayetuurira Yosefu, baagira bati: Tuhe eby'okurya. Mbwenu tukugwe omu maisho ahabw'okubura empiiha? <verse eid="GEN 47:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Yosefu yaagira ati: Empiiha ku ziraabe zihweire, mureete amatungo gaanyu, mbaguze eby'okurya. <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Batyo baareetera Yosefu amatungo gaabo; yaabaguza eby'okurya, baamuha embaraasi n'entaama n'ente n'endogoya; omuri ogwo mwaka gwona yaabaha eby'okurya, nibabishakisa amatungo gaabo. <verse eid="GEN 47:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Omwaka ogwo ku gwahweire, baamugarukaho omu gundi ogwakuratsireho, baamugira bati: Titurikubaasa kushereka mukama waitu ku empiiha zaitu zihwereire kimwe, kandi n'amatungo gaitu ku gabaire age; tihaine kitsigaireho omu maisho ga mukama waitu, kureka emibiri yaitu n'ebibanja byaitu. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Mbwenu tukugwe omu maisho n'ebibanja byaitu? Otugure n'ebibanja byaitu, otuhe eby'okurya; haza itwe turyaba abahuuku ba Faraho n'ebibanja byaitu; otuhe embibo, tukire tutafa, ensi erekye kuhinduka amatongo. <verse eid="GEN 47:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Atyo Yosefu yaagurira Faraho ensi yoona eya Misri; ahakuba Omunyamisri weena akatunda omusiri gwe, ahabw'okuba enjara ekabateera munonga. Ensi yoona yaaba eya Faraho. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Abantu boona yaabagira abahuuku, okuruga aha rubaju rumwe rwa Misri okuhika aha rundi. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 7:24">Ezr 7:24</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ebibanja by'abanyamurwa nibyo ataraguzire; ahabw'okuba abanyamurwa bakaba baine omugabo gwabo ogu baahairwe Faraho, kandi nigwo baabaire baryaho; nikyo bataratundiire bibanja byabo. <verse eid="GEN 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Bwanyima Yosefu yaagambira abantu ati: Reeba, eri izooba naaheza kubagura n'ebibanja byanyu kuba ebya Faraho. Mbwenu reeba, naabaha embibo, mugyende mubibe omu misiri yaanyu. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Omu ishaaruura muryaha Faraho ekicweka kimwe kya kataano, kandi ebicweka bina bibe ebyanyu, mwiheho embibo, ebindi bibe eby'okurya byanyu n'ab'omu maka gaanyu hamwe n'abaana baanyu abato. <verse eid="GEN 47:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Baagarukamu bati: Otutambiire, titwafa; Mukama waitu, na mbwenu otugirire embabazi, nitwija kuguma turi abahuuku ba Faraho. <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Okuruga aho Yosefu yaataho ekiragiro ky'ebibanja omu nsi ya Misri, ekikiriho na hati, Faraho okutunga ekicweka kimwe kya kataano; kureka ebibanja by'abanyamurwa bonka nibyo bitarabaire bya Faraho.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yakobo okurahiza Yosefu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">47:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 1:7">Kur 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:17">Byak 7:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abaisraeli baatuura omu nsi ya Misri, omu kyanga kya Gosheni; baagitungiramu ebintu, baagizaariramu, baakanya munonga. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Yakobo yaamara emyaka ikumi na mushanju omu nsi ya Misri; n'ahabw'ekyo emyaka yoona ei yaamazire yaahika igana na makumi ana na mushanju. <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:14">Bir 31:14</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:1">1 Bag 2:1</ref>. </char></note> Obunaku bw'okufa kwa Israeli ku bwabaire buri haihi, yaayeta omutabani Yosefu, yaamugira ati: Ku oraabe nongirira embabazi, ninkweshengyereza ta omukono gwawe ahansi y'ekibero kyangye, onkorere eby'embabazi kandi eby'amazima; otarinziika Misri, <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">47:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:16">Byak 7:16</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:22">Heb 11:22</ref>. </char></note> orekye nshangye baatatenkuru; onyihe Misri, onziikye omu kituuro kyabo. Onu ati: Ndyakora nk'oku waagamba. <verse eid="GEN 47:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Yaagira ati: Ndahira. Yaamurahira. Israeli yainama aha mushego gw'ekitabo kye.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo okushabira Yosefu n'abatabani omugisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Bwanyima y'ebyo baagambira Yosefu ku ishe arwaire; yaatwara abatabani bombi, Manaase na Efuraimu. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Baagambira Yakobo bati: Yosefu omwana waawe yaija kukureeba. Israeli yaayehangaana, yaashutama aha kitabo. <verse eid="GEN 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:13">Kur 28:13</ref>. </char></note> Yakobo yaagira Yosefu ati: Ruhanga ow'obushoboorozi bwona akanyeyorekyera Luuzi omu nsi ya Kanaani, yampa omugisha; <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />yangira ati: Ndyakuha oruzaaro, nkukanyise, nkuhindure omutwe muhango gw'amahanga; kandi ensi egi ndyagiha oruzaaro rwawe orurikukurata kuba eyaabo ey'ebiro n'ebiro. <verse eid="GEN 48:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:50">Kut 41:50</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 14:4">Yos 14:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi mbwenu batabani baawe bombi, abu waazaariire Misri, ntakakushangireyo, n'abangye; Efuraimu na Manaase baryaba abangye nka Reubeeni na Simeoni oku bari. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Abandi baana, abu orizaara bwanyima yaabo, baryaba baawe; baryayetererwa bakuru baabo omu by'obuhunguzi bwabo. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:19">Kut 35:19</ref>. </char></note> Eky'obusaasi, ku naabaire ninduga Padani, naahika Kanaani tukiri omu muhanda, naafeerwa Rakeeli, hakitsigaire omwanya okuhika Efuraata; naamuziika aho aha muhanda ogurikuza Efuraata, (niyo Betelehemu).<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Bwanyima Israeli ku yaareebire beene Yosefu, yaamubuuza ati: Aba ni baahi? <verse eid="GEN 48:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Yosefu yaagarukamu ishe ati: Ni batabani bangye, abu Ruhanga yampeereire kunu. Ishe yaamugira ati: Ninkweshengyereza bampitsye, mbashabire omugisha. <verse eid="GEN 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Obwo Israeli akaba atakibaasa kuhweza ahabw'obukuru. Yosefu yaabamuhitsya, Israeli yaabanywegyera ababumbatiire; <verse eid="GEN 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />yaagira Yosefu ati: Nkaba ntarikuteekateeka ngu turyareebana; mbwenu reeba Ruhanga yandeebesa n'oruzaaro rwawe. <verse eid="GEN 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Yosefu yaabaiha aha maju ga ishe, yainama ahansi. <verse eid="GEN 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Yaabatwara bombi, akwaitse Efuraimu n'omukono gwe gwa buryo amugyemire omukono gwa Israeli ogwa bumosho, na Manaase amukwaitse n'omukono gwe gwa bumosho amugyemire omukono gwa Israeli ogwa buryo, yaabamuhitsya. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Israeli yaananuura omukono gwe ogwa buryo, yaata engaro ze aha mutwe gwa Efuraimu omuto, kandi ez'ogwa bumosho yaazita aha mutwe gwa Manaase, arabaniisemu emikono ye, akigyendereire; ahakuba Manaase niwe yaabaire ari omujigaijo.<verse eid="GEN 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 11:21">Heb 11:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yaashabira Yosefu omugisha, naagira ati: Ruhanga, ou tatenkuru Abrahamu na taata Isaaka baabaire bagyendera gye omu maisho; Ruhanga owantungire ebiro byona eby'amagara gangye n'okuhitsya hati; <verse eid="GEN 48:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />na maraika owancungwire omu bubi bwona, ahe aba boojo omugisha; kandi beetererwe eiziina ryangye n'amaziina g'abanzaire Abrahamu na Isaaka, kandi barugyemu omutwe muhango gw'abantu omu nsi. <verse eid="GEN 48:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Yosefu ku yaareebire ishe ataire omukono gwe gwa buryo aha mutwe gwa Efuraimu, kyamugwisa kubi; yaakwata omukono gwa ishe kugwiha aha mutwe gwa Efuraimu kuguta aha gwa Manaase. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Yaagira ishe ati: Ngaaha, Taata; ogu niwe mujigaijo; ba niwe waataho omukono gwawe gwa buryo. <verse eid="GEN 48:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 33:17">Bir 33:17</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ishe yaayanga, yaagira ati: Ninkimanya, mwana wangye, ninkimanya; ogu nawe aryahinduka eihanga, kandi aryaba mukuru; kwonka omurumuna aryamukiza obukuru, n'oruzaaro rwe ruryahinduka omutwe muhango gw'amahanga. <verse eid="GEN 48:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Atyo yaabashabira omugisha eryo izooba, naagira ati: Muryaba eky'okureeberaho aha Baisraeli, baaba nibashabirana emigisha, bagire bati: Ruhanga akugire nka Efuraimu na Manaase. Okwo nikwo yaatungwire Efuraimu okukira Manaase. <verse eid="GEN 48:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:24">Kut 50:24</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Israeli yaagira Yosefu ati: Reeba, naaza kufa; kwonka Ruhanga aryaguma naimwe, kandi aryabagarura omu nsi ya baashwenkuriimwe; <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">48:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 5:2">1 Bus 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:5">Yoh 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 34:28">Kut 34:28</ref>. </char></note> kandi iwe naakuha omugabo gumwe okweshumba beene sho, ogu naanyagire Abaamori na rurara yangye n'obuta bwangye.<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s1">Yakobo okuhanuurira abandi batabani ebiribabaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="AMO 3:7">Amo 3:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Yakobo yaayeta abatabani, yaagira ati: Mweteerane hamwe, mbahanuurire ebiribabaho omu biro by'omumaisho.<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />Imwe beene Yakobo, muteeranire hamwe, muhurire; Mutegye shoimwe Israeli amatu.<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />Reubeeni, niiwe naabandize kuzaara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:3">Amaani gangye, kandi omujigaijo gw'obutsigazi bwangye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:3">Ow'amaryo rurangaanwa, kandi ow'amaani rugambwa.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 27:20">Bir 27:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ori nk'amaizi agatahamira hamwe; toriheebwa bukuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:4">Ahakuba okatemba ekitabo kya sho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:4">Waakihagara. Waaza ahu mbyama!<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 34:25">Kut 34:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Simeoni na Leevi n'enyineemwe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:5">Zaarurara zaabo n'ez'okwitanisa.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Iwe magara gangye, otariza omu naama zaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">Iwe kitiinisa kyangye, otarikwatanisa nabo bateeraine;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">Ahakuba ahabw'ekiniga bakaita abantu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">Ahabw'okwenda kwemara ak'aha mutima baatema n'ente ebiteega.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Ekiniga kyabo kikyeenwe, ahakuba ni kingi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">Ekiniga kyabo kikaba kiine obushaarizi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">Ndyababaganisiza omuri Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">Mbataataanisize omuri Israeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />Iwe Yuda, beene sho baryakuhimbisa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:8">Omukono gwawe guryakwata abazigu baawe aha bitsya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:8">Beene sho baryakwinamira.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Yuda n'ekitsigazi ky'entare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">Mwana wangye, oinamukire, nooruga aha ki waita;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">Yainama, yaabundama nk'entare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">Kandi nk'entare enkazi; n'oha owaakwemera kumusisiimura?<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 24:17">Kub 24:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 60:7">Zab 60:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:9">Mat 21:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:1-5">Isa 60:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 2:7">Hag 2:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Enkoni y'obugabe teriruga ahari Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">N'obu yaakuba ey'obutegyeki kumuruga aha bigyere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">Okuhitsya obu mukama waayo ariija;<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Aryatsibika omwana gw'embaraasi ye aha muzaabibu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">N'omwana gw'endogoya ye aha muzaabibu ogutoorainwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">Ayogyese ebijwaro bye viinyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">N'eby'okujwara bye abyogyese eshande y'emizaabibu.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Amaisho ge garyatukuzibwa viinyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:12">Namaino ge geezibwe amate.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 33:18">Bir 33:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Zebuluuni aryatuura aha rubaju rw'enyanja;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:13">Abe enyambukiro y'emeeri;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:13">Omwatano gwe guryagarukira ahari Sidoni.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />Isakaari n'endogoya y'amaani</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:14">Ebyami ahagati y'engo z'entaama.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Akareeba omwanya gw'okuruhuukiramu ku guri murungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">Kandi n'ensi ku erikushemeza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">Yainika eibega rye okwekorera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">Atyo yaahinduka omuhuuku w'okugyemwa emirimo.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />Daani aryacwera oruganda rwe emanja, Nk'oku oruganda rwe ruri rumwe aha nganda za Israeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 18:27">Bar 18:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Daani aryaba enjoka omu muhanda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">Kandi encwera omu kahanda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">Eruma ebitsintsiino by'embaraasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">Ngu egaranjure ogitembire.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 25:9">Isa 25:9</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:13">Tit 2:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ai MUKAMA, ntegyereize okujuna kwawe.<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 33:20">Bir 33:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Gaadi ababisha baryamuteera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:19">Kwonka aryababinga abahambize.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />Omuri Asheri haryarugamu eby'okurya birungi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:20">Baryareeta eby'okurya ebishemereire abagabe.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />Nafutaali n'ebuguma y'ensa etsibwirwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:21">Agamba ebigambo birungi.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />Yosefu n'eitaagi eririkwana munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:22">Eitaagi eririkwana munonga haihi n'enshuro;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:22">Amataagi ge garengyera aha rugo rw'amabaare.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Abarasi bakamugwisa kubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:23">Baamurasha, baamuhiiga.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 132:2">Zab 132:2</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 132:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 33:13">Bir 33:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka obuta bwe bwaguma bureegire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">Emikono ye n'engaro ze byaheebwa amaani</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">Omukono gw'Ow'obushoboorozi owa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">Omu iziina ry'omuriisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">Orukiri rwa Israeli,<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Niwe Ruhanga wa sho, orikuhwera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">Ow'obushoboorozi bwona orikuha omugisha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">Emigisha erikuruga omu iguru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">N'emigisha erikuruga hare okuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">N'emigisha ey'aha mabeere n'ey'omu nda.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Emigisha ei sho akushabira</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">Neekira eya taata na tatenkuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">Neehika aha muheru gw'enshozi ezitahwaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">Emigisha egyo eryaguma aha mutwe gwa Yosefu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">Aha kazingiro k'ogwo owaatoorainwe omuri beene ishe.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 20:21">Bar 20:21</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 20:25">25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Benyamiini n'omushega ogurikutaanyagura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:27">Omu kasheeshe gurya eki gwitsire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:27">Omu mwabazyo gubagana eminyago.<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Abo boona n'enganda za Israeli ikumi na ibiri; kandi ebyo nibyo ishebo yaabagambiire naabashabira omugisha; buri muntu nk'omugisha gwe oku guri, nikwo yaabashabiire atyo. <verse eid="GEN 49:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Bwanyima yaabeehanangiriza, naabagira ati: Niinyija kushanga abaitu; muryanziika hamwe na baatatenkuru omu nyanga y'omu kibanja kya Efurooni Omuhiiti, <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">49:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:16">Kut 23:16</ref>. </char></note> egyo nyanga eri omu kibanja kya Makipeela ahashungaine na Mamure omu nsi ya Kanaani, niyo nyanga ei Abrahamu yaaguzire hamwe n'ekibanja ahari Efurooni Omuhiiti, okuba obutaka bw'okuziikamu. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Okwo niyo baaziikire Abrahamu na Saara omukazi we; niyo baaziikire Isaaka na Rebeka omukazi we, kandi niyo naaziikire Lea; <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />ekyo kibanja n'enyanga yaamwo bikagurwa aha ba Heesi. <verse eid="GEN 49:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Yakobo ku yaaherize kwehanangiriza abatabani, yaagarura amaguru ge aha kitabo, gwahwamu, yaashanga abaabo.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="s1">Okuziikwa kwa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Yosefu yaajuumara aha maisho ga ishe, yaamuriririraho, yaamunywegyera. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:14">2 Bus 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:39">Yoh 19:39</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 19:40">40</ref>. </char></note> Yosefu yaaragiira abaheereza be abafumu okwomya omutumbi gwa ishe n'omubazi; abafumu nikwo kwomya Israeli. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:29">Kub 20:29</ref>. </char></note> Baamara ebiro makumi ana nibamwomya; ahakuba ebiro by'okwomya nikwo byabaire bingana; kandi Abanyamisri baamara ebiro makumi mushanju omu rufu rwe. <verse eid="GEN 50:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Ebiro by'orufu rwe ku byahweire, Yosefu yaagambira ab'eka ya Faraho ati: Ku muraabe nimungirira embabazi, nimbeeshengyereza mumpikire Faraho, mumugambire ku taata yandahiize, naagira ati: <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:14">2 Bus 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:60">Mat 27:60</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, naaza kufa; oryanziika omu kituuro kyangye eki naayekoreire omu nsi ya Kanaani. Mumugire muti: Mbwenu naakweshengyereza omurekye ainamukye, aziikye ishe, agarukye. <verse eid="GEN 50:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Faraho yaagarukamu ati: Inamuka oziikye sho, nk'oku yaakurahiize. <verse eid="GEN 50:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Yosefu yainamuka kuziika ishe; yaagyenda hamwe n'abagaragwa ba Faraho boona, abakuru b'omu ka ye, kandi n'abakuru boona ab'ensi ya Misri, <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />n'eka ye yoona na beene ishe n'ab'eka ya ishe; kwonka abaana baabo abato n'amasyo gaabo g'entaama nag'ente baabitsiga omu kyanga kya Gosheni. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Yainamuka n'ebigaari n'ab'aha mbaraasi; gwaba omutwe muhango munonga. <verse eid="GEN 50:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:2">Byak 8:2</ref>. </char></note> Baahika omu ihuuriro rya Atadi eriri seeri ya Yorudani; aho niho baacuriire munonga n'obusaasi; bwanyima yaamara ebiro mushanju naaririra ishe. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Abatuuzi b'ensi egyo Abanyakanaani ku baareebire nibacurira omu ihuuriro rya Atadi, baagira bati: Oku n'okucura kw'obusaasi aha Banyamisri; nikyo omwanya ogwo gwayeteirwe Abeeli-misraimu, kandi guri seeri ya Yorudani. <verse eid="GEN 50:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Batabani be baamukorera nk'oku yaabaragiire; <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />ahakuba bakamutwara omu nsi ya Kanaani, baamuziika omu nyanga y'omu kibanja kya Makipeela, ahashungaine na Mamure, ei Abrahamu yaaguzire hamwe n'ekyo kibanja ahari Efurooni Omuhiiti, okuba obutaka bw'okuziikamu.<verse eid="GEN 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Yosefu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Yosefu ku yaaherize kuziika ishe, yaagaruka Misri na beene ishe n'abandi boona abaagyenzire nawe kumuziikisa ishe. <verse eid="GEN 50:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Beene ishe ba Yosefu ku baareebire ishebo aherize kufa, baagira bati: Obundi Yosefu akaatwanga, atutura ebibi byona ebi twamwitsize. <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Baatuma ahari Yosefu, nibagira bati: Sho atakafiire, akaragiira ati: Muryagambira Yosefu muti: <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />Naakweshengyereza osaasire beene sho okushiisha kwabo n'ekibi kyabo; ahakuba bakakukora kubi. Mbwenu nitukweshengyereza osaasire okushiisha kw'abairu ba Ruhanga wa sho. Yosefu ku baamugizire batyo, yaarira. <verse eid="GEN 50:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:7">Kut 37:7</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 37:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Na beene ishe nabo baija, baamugwa omu maisho; baagira bati: Reeba, hati twaba abairu baawe. <verse eid="GEN 50:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:30">Heb 10:30</ref>. </char></note> Yosefu yaabagira ati: Mutatiina; nimugira ngu ndi omu mwanya gwa Ruhanga? <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:5">Kut 45:5</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 45:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 3:13-15">Byak 3:13-15</ref>. </char></note> Imwe enaama yaanyu ekaba eri ey'okunkora kubi, kwonka eya Ruhanga ekaba eri ey'okureeta ebirungi okukiza abantu baingi, ngu barekye kufa nk'oku kiri hati. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />N'ahabw'ekyo hati mutatiina; niinyija kubaha eby'okubatunga n'abaana baanyu abato. Yaabahamiza, yaabagarura omutima omunda.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Bwanyima Yosefu yaatuura omuri Misri, we n'ab'eka ya ishe; yaahitsya emyaka igana na ikumi. <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 42:16">Yob 42:16</ref>. </char></note> Yaareeba baijukuru ba Efuraimu aba kashatu; kandi n'abaana ba Makiri mwene Manaase bakamuzaarirwa aha maju. <verse eid="GEN 50:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:22">Heb 11:22</ref>. </char></note> Yosefu yaagambira beene ishe ati: Naaza kufa; kwonka buzimazima Ruhanga aryabataayaayira, abaihe omu nsi egi, abate omu nsi ei yaarahiire kuha Abrahamu na Isaaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">50:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:19">Kur 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Yos 24:32</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yosefu yaarahiza abaana ba Israeli, naagira ati: Buzimazima Ruhanga aryabataayaayira; naimwe muryaiha amagufa gangye omu nsi egi, mugagyendane. <verse eid="GEN 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Atyo Yosefu yaafa, ahikize emyaka igana na ikumi; baamwomya n'omubazi, baamuta omu shanduukye y'okuziikamu omuri Misri.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>